<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.233" end="00:00:03.733" style="s2">Who said this food is stale?</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.900" end="00:00:05.433" style="s2">It&#39;s damn delicious!</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.033" end="00:00:07.266" style="s2">Where are the bananas?</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.466" end="00:00:08.366" style="s2">Take it back!</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.433" end="00:00:12.833" style="s2">Don&#39;t serve me this crap.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.000" end="00:00:14.500" style="s2">I just want broccoli.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.900" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">Where&#39;s the meat?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.666" end="00:00:28.766" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.100" end="00:00:31.666" style="s2">No one has ever dared to fool the king like this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.933" end="00:00:33.166" style="s2">You&#39;re the first.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.066" end="00:00:38.133" style="s2">Stop arguing!</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.300" end="00:00:39.533" style="s2">All of you, shut up!</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.200" end="00:00:51.333" style="s2">I must be sleep-deprived.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.566" end="00:00:53.466" style="s2">I actually dreamt that animals were talking.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.500" end="00:00:55.066" style="s2">I&#39;ve just been under too much stress lately.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.866" end="00:00:59.800" style="s2">It&#39;s $23,800 in total.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.833" end="00:01:01.133" style="s2">The Utilities Board is coming next week</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.133" end="00:01:02.166" style="s2">to cut off the water and power.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.233" end="00:01:03.400" style="s2">And the Feed Mill and Vet Supply Shop,</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.433" end="00:01:04.833" style="s2">they&#39;re all hounding me like the Grim Reaper.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.800" end="00:01:15.366" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.166" end="00:01:17.700" style="s2">This Wildlife Park was your life&#39;s work.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.066" end="00:01:19.733" style="s2">And now I can barely afford to feed the animals.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.800" end="00:01:20.700" style="s2">You&#39;re not going to beat me up</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.833" end="00:01:21.900" style="s2">in my dreams tonight, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.533" end="00:01:27.200" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.633" end="00:01:29.000" style="s2">I have to save this park!</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.066" end="00:01:44.666" style="s2">The park&#39;s infrastructure is a mess.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.933" end="00:01:46.433" style="s2">Fixing things costs money.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.466" end="00:01:47.733" style="s2">Plus all these overdue bills.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.100" end="00:01:49.000" style="s2">I need to use my brain</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.066" end="00:01:49.966" style="s2">and think this through.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.966" end="00:01:51.000" style="s2">Well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.133" end="00:01:52.966" style="s2">Out for a stroll again, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.533" end="00:01:54.800" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.966" end="00:01:56.100" style="s2">All he does is wander around</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.133" end="00:01:56.966" style="s2">the park every day.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.033" end="00:01:58.333" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t even bring any food back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.500" end="00:01:59.266" style="s2">So adorable.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.633" end="00:02:00.300" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.000" end="00:02:02.166" style="s2">Who&#39;s cursing me behind my back?</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.366" end="00:02:03.333" style="s2">Show yourself if you dare!</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.366" end="00:02:04.566" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with this guy?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.600" end="00:02:06.466" style="s2">Yelling at thin air in broad daylight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.500" end="00:02:07.600" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.666" end="00:02:08.666" style="s2">What&#39;s up with the park&#39;s security?</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.733" end="00:02:10.100" style="s2">They even let an Adorable out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.133" end="00:02:10.600" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.800" end="00:02:11.833" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you just hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.166" end="00:02:13.533" style="s2">Someone called me Adorable.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.533" end="00:02:14.400" style="s2">How cute.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.433" end="00:02:16.000" style="s2">I think you look pretty Adorable right now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.800" end="00:02:21.033" style="s2">This guy&#39;s acting crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.166" end="00:02:22.533" style="s2">What&#39;s he yelling about?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.900" end="00:02:24.266" style="s2">There&#39;s definitely something wrong</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.300" end="00:02:24.933" style="s2">with his head.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.500" end="00:02:29.866" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.733" end="00:02:32.266" style="s2">I can understand them.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.466" end="00:02:35.366" style="s2">I can actually hear the animals&#39; thoughts!</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.200" end="00:02:56.966" style="s2">Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.100" end="00:02:58.766" style="s2">Turning the park into such a dump,</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.866" end="00:03:00.833" style="s2">and you still have the nerve to stroll around?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.933" end="00:03:01.600" style="s2">Stand still!</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.833" end="00:03:02.900" style="s2">What are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.800" end="00:03:04.866" style="s2">I&#39;m looking</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.900" end="00:03:05.766" style="s2">What if I am?</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.033" end="00:03:07.833" style="s2">Oh, wow.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.000" end="00:03:10.133" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerve, kid.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.166" end="00:03:12.100" style="s2">Believe it or not, I&#39;ll beat you up!</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.433" end="00:03:12.866" style="s2">Rex</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.000" end="00:03:14.100" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk this out.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.200" end="00:03:16.033" style="s2">I&#39;ve worked so hard raising you all this time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.100" end="00:03:17.533" style="s2">Even if I don&#39;t get credit for success,</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.866" end="00:03:19.133" style="s2">I at least get credit for hard work.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.000" end="00:03:21.766" style="s2">I stay up late working overtime every day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.866" end="00:03:24.033" style="s2">I&#39;m full of unhealthy fat, really!</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.233" end="00:03:25.433" style="s2">I&#39;m a full-fat disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.966" end="00:03:27.466" style="s2">I don&#39;t taste good at all!</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.333" end="00:03:33.866" style="s2">Geez.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.100" end="00:03:36.200" style="s2">I have zero interest in human meat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.600" end="00:03:39.133" style="s2">You should&#39;ve said so, Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.133" end="00:03:40.233" style="s2">You scared me half to death.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.266" end="00:03:42.500" style="s2">Please, call me Boss Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.866" end="00:03:43.466" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.533" end="00:03:44.133" style="s2">Boss Rex?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.200" end="00:03:45.233" style="s2">He&#39;s a northerner?</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.866" end="00:03:47.366" style="s2">The way you speak, Two-Legger,</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.466" end="00:03:48.366" style="s2">really ticks me off.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.400" end="00:03:49.000" style="s2">I gotta ask,</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.133" end="00:03:49.833" style="s2">you&#39;re a big tiger,</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.866" end="00:03:50.833" style="s2">why not stay in your cage?</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.900" end="00:03:51.833" style="s2">Why stroll around out here?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.833" end="00:03:53.000" style="s2">Who wants to stroll?</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.300" end="00:03:55.033" style="s2">I haven&#39;t had meat in three days!</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.233" end="00:03:56.766" style="s2">Nothing but rotten veggies every day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.333" end="00:03:59.666" style="s2">What exactly are you trying to pull?</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.700" end="00:04:01.200" style="s2">Hurry up and get me some meat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.366" end="00:04:02.233" style="s2">Or I&#39;ll show you</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.266" end="00:04:03.766" style="s2">who you&#39;re messing with.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.933" end="00:04:07.833" style="s2">Oh, wow.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.000" end="00:04:10.400" style="s2">Rex is playing the big boss again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.733" end="00:04:12.333" style="s2">Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.533" end="00:04:14.366" style="s2">These two lunatics are teaming up.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.733" end="00:04:16.133" style="s2">What a perfect match.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.233" end="00:04:17.200" style="s2">Fight! Fight!</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.300" end="00:04:21.700" style="s2">You think I don&#39;t want to?</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.766" end="00:04:23.333" style="s2">You scared all the visitors away.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.400" end="00:04:24.700" style="s2">Where do I get the money for your meat?</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.700" end="00:04:25.500" style="s2">Excuse me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.700" end="00:04:27.100" style="s2">Now you&#39;re blaming me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.633" end="00:04:29.533" style="s2">I&#39;ll just hide in these bushes</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.066" end="00:04:31.800" style="s2">and see if anyone comes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.266" end="00:04:33.000" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.100" end="00:04:34.266" style="s2">Oh my gosh, guys!</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.533" end="00:04:35.200" style="s2">Did you see that?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.500" end="00:04:37.433" style="s2">This guy is just talking to a wild tiger!</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.533" end="00:04:38.833" style="s2">The tiger looks like it understands him!</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.866" end="00:04:41.466" style="s2">This guy is literally talking to a tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.500" end="00:04:42.733" style="s2">This tiger gives off CEO vibes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.900" end="00:04:43.900" style="s2">Address, please!</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.900" end="00:04:45.166" style="s2">I wanna go see this boss tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.500" end="00:04:47.300" style="s2">This is terrifying.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.466" end="00:04:48.366" style="s2">They&#39;re basically treating</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.433" end="00:04:49.566" style="s2">visitors&#39; lives like a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.833" end="00:04:51.266" style="s2">We&#39;re just lucky it didn&#39;t bite anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.500" end="00:04:52.566" style="s2">If someone actually got bitten,</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.033" end="00:04:54.233" style="s2">they could have been killed.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.466" end="00:04:54.766" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.933" end="00:04:56.066" style="s2">Is this the Landscape Authority?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.300" end="00:04:57.166" style="s2">I want to make a report.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.333" end="00:04:58.600" style="s2">At Starlight Wildlife Park,</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.733" end="00:04:59.966" style="s2">a huge tiger escaped!</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.066" end="00:05:01.533" style="s2">It&#39;s going crazy on the visitor path.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.566" end="00:05:02.666" style="s2">It&#39;s absolutely terrifying!</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.266" end="00:05:07.266" style="s2">Rex has finally settled down.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.633" end="00:05:10.233" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.500" end="00:05:11.566" style="s2">Someone just reported us.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.833" end="00:05:13.433" style="s2">Inspectors from the Landscape Authority</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.466" end="00:05:14.200" style="s2">are already here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.233" end="00:05:14.966" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.066" end="00:05:16.833" style="s2">Director Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.933" end="00:05:18.033" style="s2">We received a report</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.100" end="00:05:19.600" style="s2">that a tiger escaped from your park.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.633" end="00:05:20.433" style="s2">We&#39;re here to verify it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.466" end="00:05:21.433" style="s2">Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.466" end="00:05:22.533" style="s2">This was completely an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.000" end="00:05:24.800" style="s2">The lock just rusted and broke today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.033" end="00:05:27.900" style="s2">Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.933" end="00:05:29.400" style="s2">Two of them actually showed up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.466" end="00:05:31.200" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.400" end="00:05:34.800" style="s2">Wow!</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.133" end="00:05:36.166" style="s2">There really is a tiger!</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.533" end="00:05:37.566" style="s2">So majestic!</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.900" end="00:05:38.533" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.700" end="00:05:39.666" style="s2">Your tiger got out!</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.833" end="00:05:40.700" style="s2">What if it hurts someone?</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.766" end="00:05:41.766" style="s2">This is too dangerous!</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.100" end="00:05:43.700" style="s2">Dangerous? Please.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.900" end="00:05:44.966" style="s2">I have zero interest</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.066" end="00:05:46.066" style="s2">in your scrawny meat.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.300" end="00:05:47.266" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.300" end="00:05:48.233" style="s2">This tiger is out of control!</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.366" end="00:05:49.466" style="s2">Lock it up right now!</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.300" end="00:05:54.666" style="s2">I can&#39;t even take a stroll?</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.900" end="00:05:56.166" style="s2">What exactly do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.333" end="00:05:57.266" style="s2">Looking for trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.300" end="00:05:57.700" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.933" end="00:05:58.600" style="s2">Director Rivers!</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.700" end="00:05:59.400" style="s2">If I get hurt,</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.600" end="00:06:00.833" style="s2">I&#39;ll make your park pay!</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.600" end="00:06:02.866" style="s2">Look at you, coward.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.866" end="00:06:03.466" style="s2">Pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.466" end="00:06:03.933" style="s2">Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.133" end="00:06:04.900" style="s2">Stop messing around!</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.033" end="00:06:06.233" style="s2">You can&#39;t mess with them!</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.533" end="00:06:07.033" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.466" end="00:06:08.733" style="s2">You think I&#39;d actually eat him?</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.733" end="00:06:09.700" style="s2">If you don&#39;t go back in,</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.833" end="00:06:10.800" style="s2">the park gets shut down!</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.900" end="00:06:11.633" style="s2">Forget about meat,</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.866" end="00:06:13.533" style="s2">you won&#39;t even get a chicken feather to eat!</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.666" end="00:06:16.366" style="s2">What the heck?</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.533" end="00:06:17.000" style="s2">No meat?</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.100" end="00:06:17.966" style="s2">Are you messing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.200" end="00:06:19.133" style="s2">Just say you don&#39;t want to feed me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.433" end="00:06:20.233" style="s2">You stingy jerk.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.233" end="00:06:21.300" style="s2">Do I look like I&#39;m joking?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.400" end="00:06:22.400" style="s2">With no money for meat,</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.466" end="00:06:23.466" style="s2">are we gonna beg on the streets?</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.466" end="00:06:24.366" style="s2">Oh, forget it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.533" end="00:06:26.466" style="s2">How could I live a miserable life like that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.233" end="00:06:27.533" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.566" end="00:06:29.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll do you a solid.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.400" end="00:06:31.500" style="s2">Oh my goodness!</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.500" end="00:06:33.166" style="s2">The tiger went back on its own!</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.200" end="00:06:33.600" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.600" end="00:06:34.733" style="s2">He&#39;s usually very docile.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.800" end="00:06:35.733" style="s2">Today was purely an oversight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.200" end="00:06:37.366" style="s2">We&#39;ll install new steel locks right away.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.633" end="00:06:38.666" style="s2">I promise it won&#39;t happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.666" end="00:06:39.500" style="s2">You must fix this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.600" end="00:06:41.200" style="s2">Next time, the park gets shut down.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.233" end="00:06:42.066" style="s2">Director Rivers,</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.333" end="00:06:44.500" style="s2">can I get half off to see the tiger next time?</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.333" end="00:06:46.233" style="s2">That was close.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.500" end="00:06:47.800" style="s2">We almost went bankrupt just now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.533" end="00:06:50.000" style="s2">I nearly had a heart attack!</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.233" end="00:06:51.000" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.033" end="00:06:51.900" style="s2">What do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.933" end="00:06:54.100" style="s2">Disperse the visitors first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.233" end="00:06:55.600" style="s2">Then lock down Tiger Territory.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.666" end="00:06:57.066" style="s2">Also, get all the locks in the park</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.166" end="00:06:58.066" style="s2">replaced with new ones.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.700" end="00:06:59.466" style="s2">Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.766" end="00:07:00.700" style="s2">Look at this mess.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.933" end="00:07:02.900" style="s2">Am I still getting meat after this?</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.266" end="00:07:04.100" style="s2">Look, Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.300" end="00:07:05.366" style="s2">Just stay here and behave.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.433" end="00:07:06.700" style="s2">Can you stop coming out to scare people?</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.700" end="00:07:09.433" style="s2">How was I supposed to know that guy</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.500" end="00:07:10.400" style="s2">can&#39;t take a joke?</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.300" end="00:07:11.966" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.066" end="00:07:13.300" style="s2">I don&#39;t have time to argue with you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.400" end="00:07:15.433" style="s2">The top priority is saving my wildlife park.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.966" end="00:07:21.633" style="s2">It&#39;s been days.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.766" end="00:07:22.933" style="s2">Not a single visitor.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.300" end="00:07:24.300" style="s2">What am I supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.900" end="00:07:28.200" style="s2">Look at this idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.400" end="00:07:29.733" style="s2">Spacing out again.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.000" end="00:07:31.300" style="s2">The park is about to go under.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.300" end="00:07:32.700" style="s2">Let&#39;s hit the trash cans next door.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.866" end="00:07:34.033" style="s2">Eating garbage beats this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.033" end="00:07:35.000" style="s2">Shut up, you two.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.133" end="00:07:37.333" style="s2">One more word and I&#39;m making soup out of you!</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.000" end="00:07:43.766" style="s2">This is the place.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.766" end="00:07:45.000" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.066" end="00:07:45.833" style="s2">I heard the director here</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.833" end="00:07:47.366" style="s2">can understand what the animals say.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.400" end="00:07:47.966" style="s2">Yeah, exactly!</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.966" end="00:07:49.133" style="s2">Avalon&#39;s Stream is blowing up about it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.133" end="00:07:49.966" style="s2">Let&#39;s go in and see.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.266" end="00:07:53.033" style="s2">Finally, some visitors.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.166" end="00:07:58.766" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.133" end="00:08:00.500" style="s2">Never seen Bronte</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.600" end="00:08:02.233" style="s2">scratch an itch before?</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.066" end="00:08:05.233" style="s2">These Two-Leggers freeload every day,</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.400" end="00:08:06.800" style="s2">and won&#39;t even bring a banana.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.000" end="00:08:07.833" style="s2">So stingy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.866" end="00:08:08.666" style="s2">Hey, Director.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.700" end="00:08:10.300" style="s2">I heard you can understand what animals say.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.400" end="00:08:11.333" style="s2">These monkeys on the ridge,</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.500" end="00:08:12.566" style="s2">what are they chattering about?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.566" end="00:08:14.500" style="s2">We came all the way here to see it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.933" end="00:08:16.266" style="s2">Tell us!</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.466" end="00:08:17.633" style="s2">How did they know?</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.800" end="00:08:18.166" style="s2">Whatever.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.600" end="00:08:19.633" style="s2">As long as it can bring the park</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.766" end="00:08:21.300" style="s2">back to life, I&#39;m down.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.800" end="00:08:22.300" style="s2">He says,</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.700" end="00:08:23.400" style="s2">&quot;What are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.700" end="00:08:25.233" style="s2">Never seen Bronte scratch an itch before?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.666" end="00:08:29.600" style="s2">He was just complaining,</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.700" end="00:08:31.266" style="s2">saying you guys just watch and don&#39;t feed them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.366" end="00:08:32.200" style="s2">Called us stingy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.100" end="00:08:34.333" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.833" end="00:08:36.533" style="s2">This monkey even knows Bronte?</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.666" end="00:08:38.600" style="s2">Here, Bronte, enjoy your food.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.266" end="00:08:39.766" style="s2">Whoa!</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.966" end="00:08:41.066" style="s2">Speak of the banana!</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.200" end="00:08:42.066" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper,</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.266" end="00:08:43.433" style="s2">I&#39;ll share half with you tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.466" end="00:08:44.666" style="s2">I want a banana too!</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.000" end="00:08:46.533" style="s2">This one says he wants a banana too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.066" end="00:08:48.366" style="s2">We gotta share the love.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.433" end="00:08:48.900" style="s2">Sure thing!</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.033" end="00:08:49.933" style="s2">Here&#39;s one for you too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.266" end="00:08:52.666" style="s2">Look!</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.800" end="00:08:54.233" style="s2">There&#39;s another golden monkey over there.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.433" end="00:08:55.500" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what he&#39;s saying.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.033" end="00:08:56.833" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.833" end="00:08:58.433" style="s2">Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.633" end="00:08:59.700" style="s2">Drop the act.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.600" end="00:09:01.500" style="s2">Made up some jokes,</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.533" end="00:09:02.033" style="s2">and you think</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.100" end="00:09:03.233" style="s2">you can talk to animals?</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.533" end="00:09:05.333" style="s2">Don&#39;t let this scammer fool you, guys.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.533" end="00:09:05.933" style="s2">Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.600" end="00:09:07.366" style="s2">believe it or not,</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.600" end="00:09:08.566" style="s2">I have no reason to lie.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.733" end="00:09:10.233" style="s2">Is that so?</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.333" end="00:09:12.400" style="s2">Then how about a bet?</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.633" end="00:09:13.433" style="s2">It&#39;s very simple.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.600" end="00:09:14.300" style="s2">Tell this monkey</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.366" end="00:09:15.266" style="s2">to climb that tree.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.366" end="00:09:16.233" style="s2">Then you win the bet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.433" end="00:09:16.866" style="s2">If you win,</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.133" end="00:09:17.900" style="s2">I&#39;ll personally bring</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.966" end="00:09:19.000" style="s2">a thousand people here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.166" end="00:09:20.533" style="s2">and invest in this dump.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.300" end="00:09:22.633" style="s2">A thousand visitors,</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.633" end="00:09:23.533" style="s2">and an investment.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.866" end="00:09:25.133" style="s2">The park is saved.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.366" end="00:09:27.900" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.600" end="00:09:29.133" style="s2">This bet,</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.633" end="00:09:30.366" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.800" end="00:09:33.266" style="s2">Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.833" end="00:09:34.433" style="s2">Do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.700" end="00:09:35.600" style="s2">See that tree right there?</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.266" end="00:09:37.166" style="s2">Go up there and take a stroll.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.333" end="00:09:37.833" style="s2">Just once!</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.033" end="00:09:40.433" style="s2">Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.633" end="00:09:41.333" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.600" end="00:09:42.166" style="s2">If you just help me</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.200" end="00:09:42.833" style="s2">get through this today,</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.366" end="00:09:44.366" style="s2">you&#39;ll get double the fruit!</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.666" end="00:09:45.700" style="s2">Bananas, peaches</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.766" end="00:09:46.800" style="s2">All you can eat, every day!</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.666" end="00:09:49.766" style="s2">That monkey&#39;s just been sitting there.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.000" end="00:09:50.633" style="s2">Is he a fraud?</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.633" end="00:09:52.000" style="s2">The past streams were probably staged.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.066" end="00:09:53.233" style="s2">Don&#39;t brag if you can&#39;t back it up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.266" end="00:09:54.466" style="s2">Do you take us for fools?</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.900" end="00:09:56.800" style="s2">Come and see this.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.200" end="00:09:58.600" style="s2">Is this the legendary man</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.633" end="00:10:00.566" style="s2">who talks to animals? Director?</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.400" end="00:10:02.000" style="s2">He&#39;s deaf.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.200" end="00:10:03.366" style="s2">Mr. Rivers is deaf now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.533" end="00:10:04.366" style="s2">He can&#39;t understand them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.400" end="00:10:05.100" style="s2">Look over there.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.200" end="00:10:06.200" style="s2">Your keeper is getting</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.300" end="00:10:07.666" style="s2">ganged up on by those Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.933" end="00:10:09.000" style="s2">What do these guys know?</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.533" end="00:10:10.633" style="s2">I really can understand them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.933" end="00:10:12.533" style="s2">But this old monkey is just ignoring me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.866" end="00:10:14.066" style="s2">What am I supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.666" end="00:10:16.066" style="s2">Let&#39;s go, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.300" end="00:10:17.500" style="s2">Just consider it a lesson learned.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.733" end="00:10:19.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t go, everyone!</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.400" end="00:10:24.700" style="s2">Look!</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.100" end="00:10:25.866" style="s2">Everyone, look!</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.166" end="00:10:26.566" style="s2">He moved!</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.066" end="00:10:27.966" style="s2">He&#39;s going up!</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.666" end="00:10:34.433" style="s2">This itch is killing me!</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.733" end="00:10:37.033" style="s2">Sure is a hot one today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.800" end="00:10:41.166" style="s2">He&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.166" end="00:10:42.366" style="s2">changing spots to scratch an itch.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.500" end="00:10:43.466" style="s2">You making such a fuss,</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.566" end="00:10:44.800" style="s2">think you&#39;re in a comedy sketch?</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.233" end="00:10:46.133" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.233" end="00:10:47.733" style="s2">wanting to go viral isn&#39;t shameful,</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.200" end="00:10:49.300" style="s2">but your acting is just</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.333" end="00:10:50.000" style="s2">terrible!</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.733" end="00:10:56.066" style="s2">Oh man, what should I do?</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.300" end="00:10:57.866" style="s2">My reputation is totally ruined!</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.033" end="00:11:06.600" style="s2">Hey, Two-Legger Keeper.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.633" end="00:11:08.000" style="s2">It&#39;s not that grandpa is ignoring you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.033" end="00:11:09.833" style="s2">He&#39;s just really hard of hearing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.233" end="00:11:12.666" style="s2">You sound like a mosquito to him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.766" end="00:11:13.833" style="s2">He can&#39;t hear you at all.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.166" end="00:11:15.000" style="s2">You gotta speak up.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.566" end="00:11:20.966" style="s2">So he wasn&#39;t ignoring me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.500" end="00:11:22.566" style="s2">He just couldn&#39;t hear me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.833" end="00:11:23.933" style="s2">Now I know what to do!</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.133" end="00:11:27.266" style="s2">Thanks, Clover.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.533" end="00:11:28.433" style="s2">I promise I&#39;ll feed you</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.466" end="00:11:29.266" style="s2">till you&#39;re stuffed later.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.266" end="00:11:32.133" style="s2">You better keep your word, Director!</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.533" end="00:11:36.433" style="s2">You got it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.700" end="00:11:48.000" style="s2">Bronte!</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.400" end="00:11:51.966" style="s2">Oh my god!</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.400" end="00:11:53.033" style="s2">That scared me!</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.433" end="00:11:54.833" style="s2">Has the director gone crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.866" end="00:11:55.933" style="s2">Probably too much stress.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.933" end="00:11:57.000" style="s2">He&#39;s completely lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.100" end="00:11:58.233" style="s2">Poor guy, he&#39;s so young.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.266" end="00:11:59.100" style="s2">Oh, you can&#39;t communicate,</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.133" end="00:12:00.233" style="s2">so you switch to sonic attacks?</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.333" end="00:12:00.900" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.900" end="00:12:01.400" style="s2">Are you just trying to</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.500" end="00:12:02.466" style="s2">shock him into reacting?</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.733" end="00:12:15.666" style="s2">What&#39;s all the yelling?</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.766" end="00:12:17.500" style="s2">My ears are ringing from all that noise.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.600" end="00:12:18.900" style="s2">You want me to teach you a lesson?</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.900" end="00:12:19.600" style="s2">The monkey came over.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.733" end="00:12:20.933" style="s2">And he&#39;s got quite the accent.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.966" end="00:12:21.366" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.566" end="00:12:22.333" style="s2">Cut the crap.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.800" end="00:12:23.766" style="s2">You were screaming like a pig.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.900" end="00:12:24.900" style="s2">Any living thing would come over.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.933" end="00:12:25.900" style="s2">What&#39;s so special about that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.133" end="00:12:26.633" style="s2">Rupert,</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.000" end="00:12:27.566" style="s2">relax.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.066" end="00:12:29.466" style="s2">Keep your eyes wide open.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.933" end="00:12:31.533" style="s2">The real show is just starting.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.933" end="00:12:32.333" style="s2">Bronte,</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.866" end="00:12:33.400" style="s2">please</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.700" end="00:12:34.266" style="s2">climb up</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.666" end="00:12:35.133" style="s2">the tree</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.233" end="00:12:36.300" style="s2">next to you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.866" end="00:12:39.700" style="s2">What the heck?</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.866" end="00:12:41.366" style="s2">So you&#39;re saying you wanna</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.400" end="00:12:42.200" style="s2">get hitched?</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.733" end="00:12:48.500" style="s2">Bad hearing is one thing,</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.900" end="00:12:49.833" style="s2">but what&#39;s with the heavy accent?</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.033" end="00:12:50.433" style="s2">Stay calm.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.866" end="00:12:51.566" style="s2">I need to be louder.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.600" end="00:12:52.033" style="s2">I SAID,</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.566" end="00:12:53.566" style="s2">CLIMB THE TREE!</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.000" end="00:12:55.333" style="s2">THAT BIG TREE NEXT TO YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.333" end="00:12:57.566" style="s2">What? You&#39;re gonna pee your pants?</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.733" end="00:12:59.366" style="s2">Man, that&#39;s a weird kink.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.666" end="00:13:00.466" style="s2">I ain&#39;t watching that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.500" end="00:13:01.600" style="s2">Burns my eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.600" end="00:13:02.800" style="s2">What the heck is he saying?</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.133" end="00:13:03.400" style="s2">I SAID,</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.700" end="00:13:04.766" style="s2">CLIMB THE TREE NEXT TO YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.133" end="00:13:08.166" style="s2">A pig in a tree?</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.400" end="00:13:09.333" style="s2">Where is it?</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.900" end="00:13:14.933" style="s2">You old deaf fool!</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.066" end="00:13:16.766" style="s2">Donate your ears if they don&#39;t work!</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.766" end="00:13:19.466" style="s2">You disrespectful little brat!</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.800" end="00:13:21.366" style="s2">How dare you call me deaf?</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.866" end="00:13:23.166" style="s2">I watched you grow up!</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.300" end="00:13:24.700" style="s2">Running around bare-bottomed,</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.866" end="00:13:26.166" style="s2">raiding bird nests</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.633" end="00:13:27.766" style="s2">I remember it all!</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.200" end="00:13:29.000" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.900" end="00:13:31.400" style="s2">You were faking it!</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.300" end="00:13:36.566" style="s2">I&#39;m just a little hard of hearing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.733" end="00:13:38.433" style="s2">I&#39;m not completely deaf yet!</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.566" end="00:13:39.633" style="s2">You little brat,</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.866" end="00:13:41.466" style="s2">how dare you yell at me!</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.266" end="00:13:43.766" style="s2">It&#39;s been days since I had</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.800" end="00:13:45.166" style="s2">a proper meal on time.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.300" end="00:13:46.800" style="s2">Oh, my good Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.100" end="00:13:48.466" style="s2">I apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.400" end="00:13:50.000" style="s2">If you can just</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.133" end="00:13:51.333" style="s2">help me get through this today,</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.833" end="00:13:52.300" style="s2">I promise</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.400" end="00:13:53.766" style="s2">all the animals in the park</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.900" end="00:13:55.166" style="s2">will get a huge feast tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.800" end="00:13:56.933" style="s2">A real feast.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.933" end="00:13:58.766" style="s2">You just making empty promises?</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.966" end="00:14:00.100" style="s2">I have my pride.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.100" end="00:14:01.133" style="s2">I swear I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.233" end="00:14:03.333" style="s2">Unlimited fresh bananas and peaches.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.333" end="00:14:06.800" style="s2">Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.133" end="00:14:08.766" style="s2">For the sake of those peaches,</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.933" end="00:14:10.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll trust you this once.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.400" end="00:14:10.800" style="s2">Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.000" end="00:14:12.166" style="s2">What do you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.433" end="00:14:16.000" style="s2">The tourists are losing patience.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.166" end="00:14:17.500" style="s2">We need a unique performance.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.633" end="00:14:18.566" style="s2">To totally win them over,</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.666" end="00:14:20.166" style="s2">especially that picky rich kid.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.400" end="00:14:20.766" style="s2">Bronte,</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.966" end="00:14:21.600" style="s2">work with me here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.733" end="00:14:22.600" style="s2">Let&#39;s put on a show.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.700" end="00:14:23.300" style="s2">What do you say?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.700" end="00:14:24.600" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.433" end="00:14:28.600" style="s2">So everyone can see,</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.133" end="00:14:30.366" style="s2">and to prove someone wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.400" end="00:14:31.933" style="s2">Bronte and I</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.966" end="00:14:33.600" style="s2">will put on a live show.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.000" end="00:14:36.466" style="s2">Alright, Mr. Rivers.</p>
