<p begin="00:14:38.366" end="00:14:40.200" style="s2">to see what you can pull off.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.433" end="00:14:48.000" style="s2">Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.666" end="00:14:49.700" style="s2">What&#39;s the plan?</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.033" end="00:14:53.566" style="s2">See that rake by your feet?</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.800" end="00:14:54.766" style="s2">Pick it up.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.866" end="00:14:57.433" style="s2">Bronte,</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.766" end="00:14:58.400" style="s2">now what?</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.600" end="00:15:00.933" style="s2">Even if he&#39;s in,</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.966" end="00:15:02.366" style="s2">the monkey still ignores him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.466" end="00:15:03.466" style="s2">Stop wasting time.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.466" end="00:15:04.766" style="s2">Yeah, let&#39;s just go.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.900" end="00:15:06.533" style="s2">The boss is obviously stalling.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.733" end="00:15:07.200" style="s2">Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.333" end="00:15:08.833" style="s2">Please, move.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.900" end="00:15:13.733" style="s2">Look, everyone!</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.966" end="00:15:15.466" style="s2">The monkey is spinning the staff!</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.300" end="00:15:24.866" style="s2">You big-faced, thick-necked fool!</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.000" end="00:15:26.000" style="s2">Take this!</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.800" end="00:15:28.633" style="s2">Just fake it!</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.800" end="00:15:29.666" style="s2">Are you for real?</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.566" end="00:15:31.133" style="s2">Duh!</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.400" end="00:15:33.100" style="s2">Take my second hit!</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.433" end="00:15:36.600" style="s2">You won&#39;t stop, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.800" end="00:15:38.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll beat your butt red!</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.200" end="00:15:39.366" style="s2">Try and catch me!</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.566" end="00:15:40.866" style="s2">Watch out, or your butt</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.900" end="00:15:42.133" style="s2">will be as red as mine!</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.233" end="00:15:49.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach you a lesson today!</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.233" end="00:15:51.200" style="s2">Take this!</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.466" end="00:15:56.000" style="s2">Bronte!</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.300" end="00:15:57.233" style="s2">I give up!</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.133" end="00:15:59.866" style="s2">You begged me to do this!</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.500" end="00:16:01.733" style="s2">You fool!</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.400" end="00:16:04.066" style="s2">Amazing!</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.133" end="00:16:05.766" style="s2">This monkey is actually playing Bronte!</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.800" end="00:16:06.466" style="s2">That&#39;s incredible!</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.466" end="00:16:08.333" style="s2">The ticket to this wildlife park is totally worth it!</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.333" end="00:16:09.533" style="s2">Bravo!</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.900" end="00:16:13.033" style="s2">He actually did it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.100" end="00:16:13.633" style="s2">This</p>
