<p begin="00:16:52.333" end="00:16:53.300" style="s2">Thank you all for your support.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.333" end="00:16:54.066" style="s2">I hope you&#39;ll continue to</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.133" end="00:16:55.566" style="s2">support Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.666" end="00:16:56.433" style="s2">I don&#39;t take apprentices.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.500" end="00:16:57.633" style="s2">It mostly comes down to talent.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.666" end="00:16:58.766" style="s2">Where&#39;s Rupert?</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.100" end="00:17:00.766" style="s2">What about the thousand-person tour group</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.800" end="00:17:02.566" style="s2">and the investment you promised?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.600" end="00:17:03.833" style="s2">Hey.</p>
