<p begin="00:17:09.500" end="00:17:11.300" style="s2">Just holler in the chat if you need anything.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.433" end="00:17:14.266" style="s2">Hello, Admin?</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.333" end="00:17:15.033" style="s2">Send out a notice.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.166" end="00:17:16.800" style="s2">Cancel the hot spring retreat this weekend.</p>
