<p begin="00:17:25.500" end="00:17:26.533" style="s2">There&#39;s a genius here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.700" end="00:17:27.533" style="s2">Just do as I say.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.600" end="00:17:28.933" style="s2">Draft a plan immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.333" end="00:17:30.733" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.400" end="00:17:33.666" style="s2">This is incredibly efficient.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.766" end="00:17:35.033" style="s2">Am I dreaming?</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.733" end="00:17:37.733" style="s2">I&#39;m not dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.900" end="00:17:39.733" style="s2">Grandpa, did you see this?</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.766" end="00:17:41.333" style="s2">Our park is really coming back to life.</p>
