<p begin="00:17:43.966" end="00:17:45.066" style="s2">I&#39;ll sort it out for you today.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.333" end="00:17:46.600" style="s2">But don&#39;t get too excited just yet.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.700" end="00:17:47.833" style="s2">The investment I promised you,</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.933" end="00:17:49.133" style="s2">I won&#39;t short you a single cent.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.066" end="00:17:50.566" style="s2">Great.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.766" end="00:17:52.400" style="s2">Thought he was a troublemaker,</p>
