<p begin="00:18:54.266" end="00:18:54.933" style="s2">See you this weekend!</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.933" end="00:18:57.600" style="s2">See you, Rupert the Angel.</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.666" end="00:18:59.700" style="s2">So generous, Rupert!</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.133" end="00:19:03.900" style="s2">Hey, kid!</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.700" end="00:19:05.633" style="s2">I just helped you</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.700" end="00:19:06.933" style="s2">make a ton of money.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.733" end="00:19:08.566" style="s2">If I don&#39;t see</p>
