<p begin="00:19:19.133" end="00:19:20.633" style="s2">Why do I feel a chill down my spine?</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.100" end="00:19:22.066" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Bronte!</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.400" end="00:19:23.500" style="s2">I always keep my word.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.900" end="00:19:24.966" style="s2">You won&#39;t just get fruit tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.200" end="00:19:26.166" style="s2">you&#39;ll get double!</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.200" end="00:19:38.233" style="s2">Hello, Mr. Griffiths?</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.333" end="00:19:39.800" style="s2">It&#39;s Galen from Starlight Wildlife Park!</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.933" end="00:19:40.833" style="s2">Right, right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.900" end="00:19:41.500" style="s2">No credit today.</p>
