<p begin="00:19:42.300" end="00:19:43.366" style="s2">Oh, Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.466" end="00:19:44.566" style="s2">Did you strike it rich today?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.533" end="00:19:46.266" style="s2">Cut the chatter.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.500" end="00:19:47.866" style="s2">Send three truckloads of</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.900" end="00:19:49.500" style="s2">your best ingredients over today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.500" end="00:19:50.566" style="s2">I need a truck of beef,</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.666" end="00:19:51.433" style="s2">a truck of bananas,</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.500" end="00:19:52.366" style="s2">and a truck of peaches.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.066" end="00:19:54.500" style="s2">Remember,</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.700" end="00:19:55.833" style="s2">I only want the freshest.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.966" end="00:19:56.833" style="s2">Send them over right now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.933" end="00:19:58.266" style="s2">I&#39;ll transfer the money right away.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.200" end="00:20:03.266" style="s2">The money&#39;s already sent.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.433" end="00:20:04.333" style="s2">Hurry up and deliver!</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.666" end="00:20:07.300" style="s2">Yes!</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.566" end="00:20:08.800" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.900" end="00:20:10.100" style="s2">is finally coming back to life!</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.433" end="00:20:12.233" style="s2">I&#39;m an absolute genius!</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.233" end="00:20:24.866" style="s2">Oh my.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.066" end="00:20:26.133" style="s2">Am I seeing things?</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.400" end="00:20:27.200" style="s2">Is that truck carrying</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.300" end="00:20:28.500" style="s2">Bananas and peaches?</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.700" end="00:20:29.833" style="s2">It really is.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.866" end="00:20:30.766" style="s2">How did our genius keeper</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.800" end="00:20:31.833" style="s2">suddenly get so rich?</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.866" end="00:20:32.666" style="s2">I can&#39;t miss out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.733" end="00:20:33.700" style="s2">I need to go buddy up with</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.700" end="00:20:34.533" style="s2">the other birds here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.600" end="00:20:36.166" style="s2">Maybe I can score a piece of fruit.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.100" end="00:20:37.500" style="s2">Maggie.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.766" end="00:20:38.700" style="s2">Let&#39;s hand these out to</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.733" end="00:20:39.633" style="s2">the animals.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.666" end="00:20:40.333" style="s2">No problem.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.100" end="00:20:43.600" style="s2">Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.033" end="00:20:44.833" style="s2">Fresh peaches.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.933" end="00:20:45.333" style="s2">Try one.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.533" end="00:20:46.900" style="s2">I told you I keep my promises.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.566" end="00:20:49.200" style="s2">Oh my.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.366" end="00:20:50.800" style="s2">This peach is so sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.900" end="00:20:51.900" style="s2">Good on you, kid.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.100" end="00:20:53.400" style="s2">All that acting I did</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.566" end="00:20:54.400" style="s2">Totally worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.500" end="00:20:56.333" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.433" end="00:20:57.066" style="s2">Where&#39;s mine?</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.233" end="00:20:58.133" style="s2">Since you&#39;re being generous,</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.300" end="00:20:59.233" style="s2">hurry up and feed me!</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.266" end="00:21:00.466" style="s2">And me!</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.466" end="00:21:04.000" style="s2">Wow!</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.233" end="00:21:05.366" style="s2">Long live the keeper!</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.433" end="00:21:06.666" style="s2">He&#39;s seriously the most</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.733" end="00:21:08.166" style="s2">generous Two-Legger on earth!</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.433" end="00:21:08.866" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.966" end="00:21:09.966" style="s2">Monkey Ridge is almost done.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.100" end="00:21:11.300" style="s2">Let&#39;s head to Tiger Territory.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.466" end="00:21:12.633" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle Tiger Territory.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.666" end="00:21:14.300" style="s2">Can you tally up today&#39;s accounts for me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.633" end="00:21:17.233" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.300" end="00:21:18.900" style="s2">Fresh beef and fruit salad.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.166" end="00:21:20.833" style="s2">Top-tier dining today, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.466" end="00:21:23.100" style="s2">Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.366" end="00:21:24.133" style="s2">Glad you&#39;re smart.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.300" end="00:21:25.566" style="s2">You didn&#39;t try to fool me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.700" end="00:21:26.933" style="s2">The meat is fresh enough.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.633" end="00:21:28.666" style="s2">As for this peach,</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.933" end="00:21:30.300" style="s2">I&#39;ll do you a favor and accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.500" end="00:21:31.366" style="s2">Let&#39;s have a taste.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.700" end="00:21:34.333" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.500" end="00:21:35.100" style="s2">Your tail</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.133" end="00:21:36.766" style="s2">sure knows how to &quot;do a favor.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.400" end="00:21:38.700" style="s2">Stop mocking me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.933" end="00:21:40.133" style="s2">I&#39;m just preventing waste,</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.333" end="00:21:40.800" style="s2">got it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.066" end="00:21:41.866" style="s2">Getting food sorted</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.900" end="00:21:42.833" style="s2">is just the first step.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.866" end="00:21:44.233" style="s2">This park my grandpa left me,</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.333" end="00:21:45.733" style="s2">I need to truly bring it back to life.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.833" end="00:21:46.833" style="s2">I&#39;m going to make him proud.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.866" end="00:21:48.400" style="s2">Director, the accounts are tallied.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.433" end="00:21:49.600" style="s2">After deducting the fruit costs,</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.700" end="00:21:50.066" style="s2">we still have</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.166" end="00:21:52.200" style="s2">a solid $196,000 in the bank.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.233" end="00:21:53.433" style="s2">The thousand-person tour group</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.433" end="00:21:54.333" style="s2">is arriving this weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.366" end="00:21:55.533" style="s2">If we host them well,</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.533" end="00:21:56.733" style="s2">it&#39;ll bring us massive business.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.833" end="00:21:58.066" style="s2">I must seize this opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.433" end="00:22:01.133" style="s2">Director, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.133" end="00:22:02.100" style="s2">Is there a problem?</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.400" end="00:22:07.333" style="s2">This can&#39;t wait any longer.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.400" end="00:22:08.066" style="s2">Now that the food is sorted,</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.133" end="00:22:08.566" style="s2">let&#39;s finalize</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.600" end="00:22:09.600" style="s2">the park&#39;s renovation plan right now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.633" end="00:22:10.500" style="s2">First, we need</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.600" end="00:22:11.833" style="s2">a major overhaul of the infrastructure.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.833" end="00:22:13.566" style="s2">Especially the safety net joints and iron locks.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.600" end="00:22:14.733" style="s2">We can&#39;t leave a single hazard.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.733" end="00:22:15.300" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.466" end="00:22:17.100" style="s2">We&#39;ll fix all the safety issues first.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.866" end="00:22:20.166" style="s2">After fixing the safety issues,</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.400" end="00:22:22.066" style="s2">how do we get the animals moving?</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.600" end="00:22:23.200" style="s2">Step two:</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.566" end="00:22:24.900" style="s2">Without tiring them out,</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.200" end="00:22:26.200" style="s2">we get them active.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.500" end="00:22:28.200" style="s2">Add climbing frames to Monkey Ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.633" end="00:22:30.100" style="s2">Give the Predator Zone rolling,</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.200" end="00:22:32.700" style="s2">chaseable enrichment toys that hide food.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.800" end="00:22:33.833" style="s2">When animals are active,</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.866" end="00:22:35.400" style="s2">visitors love to watch.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.466" end="00:22:36.366" style="s2">As for how to get them</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.400" end="00:22:37.100" style="s2">moving safely,</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.333" end="00:22:38.000" style="s2">leave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.066" end="00:22:40.366" style="s2">Hello, Mr. Finch.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.533" end="00:22:41.900" style="s2">Bring the workers tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.200" end="00:22:43.600" style="s2">I&#39;m renovating the park.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.533" end="00:22:54.400" style="s2">Snap to it!</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.633" end="00:22:56.433" style="s2">Listen up, here are my rules!</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.500" end="00:22:57.333" style="s2">Within three days,</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.466" end="00:22:58.500" style="s2">the main zone&#39;s safety nets</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.566" end="00:22:59.633" style="s2">must be completely replaced!</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.900" end="00:23:01.433" style="s2">Make sure all the welds are ground smooth!</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.633" end="00:23:03.066" style="s2">Yes, boss!</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.333" end="00:23:12.833" style="s2">This is my royal resting spot.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.000" end="00:23:14.033" style="s2">How dare these Two-Leggers</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.100" end="00:23:15.500" style="s2">make a racket with those metal chunks?</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.733" end="00:23:16.333" style="s2">Those things</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.366" end="00:23:18.200" style="s2">are giving me a splitting headache.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.600" end="00:23:23.300" style="s2">Ouch!</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.533" end="00:23:25.800" style="s2">You little brat, get out here!</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.933" end="00:23:27.333" style="s2">If this shaking keeps up,</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.700" end="00:23:28.366" style="s2">I&#39;ll go deaf!</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.000" end="00:23:31.666" style="s2">I&#39;m definitely gonna go deaf today!</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.133" end="00:23:33.000" style="s2">This Two-Legger Keeper,</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.166" end="00:23:34.433" style="s2">what kind of stunt is he pulling now?</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.500" end="00:23:35.966" style="s2">He even brought a demolition crew!</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.100" end="00:23:36.933" style="s2">I don&#39;t know about demolition</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.000" end="00:23:39.133" style="s2">But the animals are gonna flip out sooner or later!</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.600" end="00:23:40.700" style="s2">My little darlings!</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.766" end="00:23:41.433" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.633" end="00:23:42.633" style="s2">Just bear with it for a bit!</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.433" end="00:23:48.833" style="s2">Mr. Finch, Mr. Finch!</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.933" end="00:23:49.433" style="s2">To the left.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.633" end="00:23:51.500" style="s2">Move that drill half a meter to the left.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.500" end="00:23:51.833" style="s2">Maggie!</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.233" end="00:23:52.833" style="s2">Go tell the workers</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.900" end="00:23:54.500" style="s2">to secure this protective pillar first.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.966" end="00:24:01.800" style="s2">That Two-Legger with the blond hair</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.000" end="00:24:03.466" style="s2">It looks exactly like my old mane</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.500" end="00:24:04.266" style="s2">before I shed it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.333" end="00:24:05.166" style="s2">It&#39;s such an eyesore,</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.433" end="00:24:06.166" style="s2">really ticks me off.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.200" end="00:24:07.233" style="s2">Hey, Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.466" end="00:24:08.466" style="s2">Listen to my decree.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.700" end="00:24:09.300" style="s2">Starting tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.600" end="00:24:11.000" style="s2">I&#39;m dyeing my fur green!</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.233" end="00:24:12.500" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna be the whole forest&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.633" end="00:24:14.033" style="s2">one and only green tiger king!</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.900" end="00:24:15.500" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.300" end="00:24:17.666" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what&#39;s going on with you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.033" end="00:24:20.133" style="s2">But going green is never a good sign.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.966" end="00:24:22.500" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.100" end="00:24:24.200" style="s2">Did your lady cheat on you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.366" end="00:24:26.833" style="s2">Two-Legger, you itching for a beating, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.000" end="00:24:28.833" style="s2">Who would dare touch my queen?</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.200" end="00:24:30.233" style="s2">Alright, my bad, Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.733" end="00:24:33.300" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.600" end="00:24:34.633" style="s2">Mr. Barrett did a great job.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.866" end="00:24:35.600" style="s2">The safety inspection</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.633" end="00:24:36.600" style="s2">Passed with flying colors.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.866" end="00:24:42.266" style="s2">Maggie.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.433" end="00:24:43.400" style="s2">Please see the inspector out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.500" end="00:24:44.900" style="s2">Then contact the enrichment expert.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.966" end="00:24:46.066" style="s2">And get ready for phase two.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.066" end="00:24:47.366" style="s2">You got it, Director.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.433" end="00:24:53.700" style="s2">Let&#39;s go see Rex first.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.133" end="00:24:57.633" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.200" end="00:24:59.066" style="s2">The new wire fences</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.333" end="00:24:59.933" style="s2">Do you like them?</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.433" end="00:25:04.966" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.300" end="00:25:06.766" style="s2">You think some flimsy wire fences</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.900" end="00:25:08.266" style="s2">can lock up my wild side?</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.666" end="00:25:09.600" style="s2">What a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.866" end="00:25:11.433" style="s2">I can bust it open with one paw.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.666" end="00:25:14.300" style="s2">Ow, damn it!</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.566" end="00:25:15.900" style="s2">Why is this wire so tough?</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.466" end="00:25:16.866" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.300" end="00:25:18.333" style="s2">How dare you plot against me!</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.466" end="00:25:19.400" style="s2">You got a death wish?</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.166" end="00:25:22.100" style="s2">Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.300" end="00:25:23.800" style="s2">I&#39;m just protecting you, Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.133" end="00:25:25.633" style="s2">Or else you won&#39;t get any beef later.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.100" end="00:25:27.533" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.333" end="00:25:29.233" style="s2">Since you actually care,</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.300" end="00:25:31.633" style="s2">I guess I&#39;ll reluctantly</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.733" end="00:25:32.900" style="s2">let this slide.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.300" end="00:25:34.700" style="s2">Rex</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.800" end="00:25:37.066" style="s2">really has a terminal case of CEO syndrome.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.366" end="00:25:38.866" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.066" end="00:25:40.000" style="s2">I got in touch with the top</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.066" end="00:25:41.366" style="s2">enrichment designer in the industry,</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.466" end="00:25:42.100" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.166" end="00:25:44.900" style="s2">That&#39;s great.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.400" end="00:25:46.966" style="s2">Is there anything Maggie can&#39;t do?</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.633" end="00:25:49.066" style="s2">Director,</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.200" end="00:25:50.566" style="s2">Ms. Avery will be here tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.666" end="00:25:51.666" style="s2">We need to be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.766" end="00:25:54.400" style="s2">Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.466" end="00:26:00.033" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.333" end="00:26:01.866" style="s2">This is Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.600" end="00:26:02.900" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.133" end="00:26:03.633" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.866" end="00:26:05.166" style="s2">I&#39;m the director of the wildlife park,</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.266" end="00:26:06.000" style="s2">Galen Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.633" end="00:26:07.733" style="s2">No need to shake hands.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.433" end="00:26:10.933" style="s2">This is what I made for your park</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.166" end="00:26:11.766" style="s2">overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.900" end="00:26:13.833" style="s2">A standardized enrichment design plan.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.566" end="00:26:16.300" style="s2">Ms. Avery, you&#39;re indeed a professional.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.433" end="00:26:17.133" style="s2">So efficient.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.600" end="00:26:20.266" style="s2">Ms. Avery,</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.433" end="00:26:21.100" style="s2">these plans</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.166" end="00:26:22.500" style="s2">aren&#39;t they a bit too rigid?</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.600" end="00:26:23.600" style="s2">Shouldn&#39;t we adjust them</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.766" end="00:26:25.266" style="s2">according to their specific preferences?</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.066" end="00:26:30.533" style="s2">Based on the animals&#39; preferences?</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.600" end="00:26:32.200" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.633" end="00:26:34.066" style="s2">I&#39;ve won more industry awards</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.100" end="00:26:35.500" style="s2">than I can count on both hands.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.833" end="00:26:36.900" style="s2">Your gimmick about hearing</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.933" end="00:26:37.833" style="s2">the animals&#39; thoughts</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.133" end="00:26:39.133" style="s2">won&#39;t fly with me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.333" end="00:26:41.000" style="s2">Just follow my blueprints exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.000" end="00:26:50.800" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.066" end="00:26:51.566" style="s2">Take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.133" end="00:26:54.233" style="s2">The Enrichment Plan is fully completed.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.366" end="00:27:10.900" style="s2">Bronte!</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.200" end="00:27:12.033" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.166" end="00:27:13.466" style="s2">Ouch, look at this!</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.566" end="00:27:14.833" style="s2">Do I look like I&#39;m okay?</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.933" end="00:27:15.900" style="s2">That hurts so much!</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.166" end="00:27:17.333" style="s2">What is this garbage wood?</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.566" end="00:27:19.200" style="s2">I want real, natural tree trunks!</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.433" end="00:27:21.966" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.400" end="00:27:23.766" style="s2">See? The monkey just fell down.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.066" end="00:27:27.633" style="s2">He&#39;s just not used to it yet.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.566" end="00:27:28.833" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.166" end="00:27:30.866" style="s2">See how adaptable the tiger is?</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.266" end="00:27:32.600" style="s2">He&#39;s already playing with the ball.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.266" end="00:27:46.433" style="s2">You dare fool me with this garbage?</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.533" end="00:27:49.200" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.466" end="00:27:51.166" style="s2">I&#39;m only giving you three days.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.766" end="00:27:53.800" style="s2">I want a giant swimming pool.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.133" end="00:27:56.666" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.133" end="00:27:58.166" style="s2">The animals don&#39;t seem</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.200" end="00:27:59.466" style="s2">very interested in this.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.600" end="00:28:00.500" style="s2">Do you think we could</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.733" end="00:28:02.066" style="s2">adjust the plan just a bit?</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.200" end="00:28:04.966" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.633" end="00:28:07.466" style="s2">Are you questioning my expertise?</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.233" end="00:28:09.333" style="s2">Your animals don&#39;t like it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.566" end="00:28:11.100" style="s2">I think you&#39;re just picking a fight.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.100" end="00:28:12.033" style="s2">My eyes are telling me</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.333" end="00:28:13.800" style="s2">they hate this piece of junk.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.866" end="00:28:15.233" style="s2">Looking at it will make me go blind!</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.866" end="00:28:19.833" style="s2">My nose refuses to breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.966" end="00:28:21.166" style="s2">This smells worse than the farts</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.200" end="00:28:22.266" style="s2">of the skunks next door.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.366" end="00:28:23.733" style="s2">It&#39;s a biological weapon!</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.900" end="00:28:25.800" style="s2">My mouth just can&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.866" end="00:28:26.433" style="s2">but say,</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.733" end="00:28:27.566" style="s2">garbage!</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.966" end="00:28:30.633" style="s2">Impressive,</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.000" end="00:28:31.900" style="s2">my animal friends.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.233" end="00:28:33.900" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t even roast it this well.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.566" end="00:28:37.166" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.333" end="00:28:38.400" style="s2">Let&#39;s just revise it once.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.500" end="00:28:39.600" style="s2">Even just tweaking the details.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.733" end="00:28:40.400" style="s2">Will that work?</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.366" end="00:28:42.466" style="s2">It&#39;s not changing.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.533" end="00:28:46.133" style="s2">I, Philippa Avery, never compromise on my designs.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.766" end="00:28:47.700" style="s2">Mark my words.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.100" end="00:28:48.800" style="s2">Within three days,</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.966" end="00:28:49.500" style="s2">these beasts</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.566" end="00:28:51.000" style="s2">will fall in love with this equipment.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.133" end="00:28:52.100" style="s2">If they don&#39;t play with it,</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.266" end="00:28:54.133" style="s2">you can spell my name backwards.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.600" end="00:28:58.466" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.966" end="00:29:00.400" style="s2">You said it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.666" end="00:29:02.366" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.566" end="00:29:04.033" style="s2">Since you&#39;re so confident, Ms. Avery,</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.266" end="00:29:05.600" style="s2">then we&#39;ll just wait and see.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.333" end="00:29:11.866" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.100" end="00:29:13.000" style="s2">The three days are up.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.166" end="00:29:14.033" style="s2">You just saw it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.100" end="00:29:15.766" style="s2">My monkeys never even went up that frame.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.900" end="00:29:17.800" style="s2">Now look at this tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.066" end="00:29:18.166" style="s2">Oh!</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.933" end="00:29:19.766" style="s2">What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.200" end="00:29:25.033" style="s2">How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.300" end="00:29:26.933" style="s2">This is the most advanced Sensory Sphere.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.100" end="00:29:28.500" style="s2">How can it be used as a toilet?</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.066" end="00:29:30.266" style="s2">What a piece of junk.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.566" end="00:29:31.500" style="s2">Taking a dump on it</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.566" end="00:29:33.033" style="s2">is a blessing from the king himself.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.866" end="00:29:36.366" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.933" end="00:29:38.100" style="s2">Looks like your science</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.433" end="00:29:39.500" style="s2">isn&#39;t really working out for them.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.000" end="00:29:41.866" style="s2">This tiger must have mental issues!</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.633" end="00:29:42.966" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.300" end="00:29:44.300" style="s2">Now it&#39;s my turn to step in.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.800" end="00:29:45.300" style="s2">Mr. Finch.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.400" end="00:29:46.033" style="s2">Got all the tools ready?</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.166" end="00:29:46.800" style="s2">Let&#39;s get to work.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.833" end="00:29:47.333" style="s2">Got &#39;em all.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.433" end="00:29:48.000" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.066" end="00:29:48.800" style="s2">How are we doing this today?</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.933" end="00:29:49.500" style="s2">You&#39;re the boss.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.533" end="00:29:49.933" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.933" end="00:29:50.900" style="s2">To Monkey Ridge first.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.866" end="00:29:55.700" style="s2">I want old tree trunks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.900" end="00:29:56.900" style="s2">With bark on them!</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.100" end="00:29:58.000" style="s2">Nice and rough.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.200" end="00:29:59.900" style="s2">Crisscross the trunks,</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.200" end="00:30:01.233" style="s2">layered together.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.400" end="00:30:03.166" style="s2">And get some thick vines.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.400" end="00:30:04.466" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna swing on &#39;em</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.700" end="00:30:06.033" style="s2">like a real boss.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.800" end="00:30:07.333" style="s2">Mr. Finch.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.500" end="00:30:08.233" style="s2">Tear down all those</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.233" end="00:30:09.166" style="s2">smooth climbing frames.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.300" end="00:30:10.833" style="s2">Bring in some old trunks with rough bark.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.933" end="00:30:12.133" style="s2">Stack them up in a crisscross pattern.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.300" end="00:30:13.533" style="s2">Then get some thick vines</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.766" end="00:30:15.000" style="s2">and tie them tightly between the trunks.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.033" end="00:30:15.633" style="s2">You got it!</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.700" end="00:30:16.100" style="s2">Will do.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.266" end="00:30:16.533" style="s2">Boys,</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.733" end="00:30:17.333" style="s2">tear it down!</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.133" end="00:30:28.833" style="s2">Big pool!</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.033" end="00:30:29.433" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.733" end="00:30:31.100" style="s2">Where&#39;s the big pool I ordered?</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.266" end="00:30:32.500" style="s2">I want to have a good splash in it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.533" end="00:30:33.066" style="s2">Mr. Finch.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.200" end="00:30:33.666" style="s2">Right here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.666" end="00:30:34.700" style="s2">Take the original small puddle</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.733" end="00:30:36.100" style="s2">and expand it three times the size.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.166" end="00:30:37.100" style="s2">Dig the pool deeper,</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.100" end="00:30:38.533" style="s2">and fill it with clean water when done.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.866" end="00:30:44.233" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.766" end="00:30:46.533" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how long you can keep this up.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.200" end="00:30:49.833" style="s2">Ms. Avery.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.100" end="00:30:51.000" style="s2">Monkey Ridge is almost done.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.166" end="00:30:51.866" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you take a look?</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.733" end="00:31:01.833" style="s2">Oh, wow.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.933" end="00:31:03.933" style="s2">This is so comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.366" end="00:31:05.433" style="s2">He really did it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.133" end="00:31:06.766" style="s2">These animals</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.933" end="00:31:08.500" style="s2">really do prefer his design.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.500" end="00:31:11.366" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.800" end="00:31:12.800" style="s2">Here is my business card.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.966" end="00:31:15.066" style="s2">You have my utmost respect.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.300" end="00:31:15.600" style="s2">I admit defeat.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.600" end="00:31:16.866" style="s2">Total defeat.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.833" end="00:31:19.133" style="s2">You&#39;re too kind, Ms. Farley.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.000" end="00:31:20.366" style="s2">Maggie,</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.700" end="00:31:21.900" style="s2">please see Ms. Farley out.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.466" end="00:31:25.233" style="s2">Ms. Farley,</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.566" end="00:31:26.266" style="s2">let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.200" end="00:31:34.200" style="s2">Oh my goodness.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.766" end="00:31:35.966" style="s2">Tomorrow is the weekend already.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.900" end="00:31:40.200" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.233" end="00:31:41.100" style="s2">You got this, Galen.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.233" end="00:31:49.366" style="s2">Head on in, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.700" end="00:31:50.500" style="s2">Don&#39;t be shy!</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.800" end="00:31:52.500" style="s2">I booked the whole place today!</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.333" end="00:31:55.033" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.466" end="00:31:56.366" style="s2">Our park has never</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.433" end="00:31:57.733" style="s2">had this many people at once.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.200" end="00:31:59.700" style="s2">I already gave all the animals</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.766" end="00:32:00.700" style="s2">a heads-up yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.033" end="00:32:02.600" style="s2">As long as they behave well today,</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.800" end="00:32:04.233" style="s2">they&#39;ll all get extra treats tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.400" end="00:32:04.800" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.166" end="00:32:05.933" style="s2">Come on, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.133" end="00:32:07.866" style="s2">Please follow me in an orderly fashion.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.200" end="00:32:10.466" style="s2">Foolish Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.833" end="00:32:13.000" style="s2">Check out my chiseled jawline.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.466" end="00:32:15.566" style="s2">Am I handsome or what?</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.733" end="00:32:19.400" style="s2">Everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.533" end="00:32:21.433" style="s2">welcome to Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.500" end="00:32:22.533" style="s2">What you see now is Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.700" end="00:32:23.433" style="s2">He&#39;s showing off</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.466" end="00:32:24.633" style="s2">his perfect jawline.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.500" end="00:32:26.533" style="s2">Looking fierce, Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.533" end="00:32:27.033" style="s2">Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.200" end="00:32:28.533" style="s2">That jawline is sharp!</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.566" end="00:32:31.033" style="s2">You&#39;re already mesmerized by me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.300" end="00:32:32.333" style="s2">I guess my charm</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.400" end="00:32:33.933" style="s2">is just irresistible.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.533" end="00:32:34.933" style="s2">Rex,</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.366" end="00:32:36.433" style="s2">confidence is a good thing,</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.500" end="00:32:37.800" style="s2">but let&#39;s keep it in check, yeah?</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.600" end="00:32:40.200" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.400" end="00:32:41.700" style="s2">You questioning your king?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.100" end="00:32:42.700" style="s2">Look, look, look!</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.733" end="00:32:43.633" style="s2">What did Mr. Rivers say?</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.700" end="00:32:45.000" style="s2">Rex&#39;s expression totally changed.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.066" end="00:32:45.766" style="s2">He looks mad.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.800" end="00:32:47.666" style="s2">The boss gets mad, people get hurt!</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.833" end="00:32:48.633" style="s2">He&#39;s not gonna make us</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.666" end="00:32:49.633" style="s2">disappear, is he?</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.933" end="00:32:51.933" style="s2">No, no, not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.033" end="00:32:53.733" style="s2">Our Rex is just striking a pose.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.966" end="00:32:55.600" style="s2">See that?</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.800" end="00:32:56.733" style="s2">That tiger&#39;s posture</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.733" end="00:32:57.933" style="s2">was shaped by my advanced</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.033" end="00:32:59.033" style="s2">investment philosophy!</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.466" end="00:33:02.066" style="s2">Attention, all visitors.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.133" end="00:33:02.933" style="s2">If anyone has seen</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.066" end="00:33:04.366" style="s2">a four-year-old boy</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.400" end="00:33:05.466" style="s2">wearing a yellow shirt,</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.500" end="00:33:07.066" style="s2">please contact the office immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.066" end="00:33:08.333" style="s2">I just glanced at the tiger!</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.433" end="00:33:09.833" style="s2">He disappeared in the blink of an eye!</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.000" end="00:33:11.166" style="s2">What am I going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.200" end="00:33:12.866" style="s2">Excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.900" end="00:33:14.000" style="s2">There&#39;s been a slight emergency.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.066" end="00:33:15.366" style="s2">Please feel free to explore on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.766" end="00:33:19.266" style="s2">Maggie.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.533" end="00:33:20.200" style="s2">Don&#39;t panic.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.433" end="00:33:21.433" style="s2">Take her to the security room.</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.166" end="00:33:23.266" style="s2">Pull up the footage of the main gate</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.333" end="00:33:24.200" style="s2">and all the main paths.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.200" end="00:33:24.733" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.766" end="00:33:25.466" style="s2">I&#39;m on it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.466" end="00:33:28.366" style="s2">There are too many people.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.633" end="00:33:30.100" style="s2">The cameras have blind spots too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.533" end="00:33:32.033" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to ask the animals for help.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.533" end="00:33:35.933" style="s2">Clover,</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.433" end="00:33:37.133" style="s2">did you happen to see a</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.133" end="00:33:38.800" style="s2">little boy by himself in a yellow shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.800" end="00:33:41.833" style="s2">A yellow shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.233" end="00:33:43.600" style="s2">I think I saw him heading over</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.633" end="00:33:44.533" style="s2">to see Atlas.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.833" end="00:33:48.866" style="s2">Little Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.000" end="00:33:50.500" style="s2">Could you stop screaming?</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.933" end="00:33:54.700" style="s2">You scared Miss Daisy back inside.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.933" end="00:33:57.333" style="s2">I haven&#39;t even confessed to her today!</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.366" end="00:34:04.666" style="s2">Maggie.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.166" end="00:34:06.333" style="s2">We found the kid in the Elephant Grove.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.533" end="00:34:07.766" style="s2">Tell the mother not to worry.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.933" end="00:34:13.233" style="s2">Baby!</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.166" end="00:34:14.866" style="s2">My baby!</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.533" end="00:34:17.633" style="s2">Someone, please save him!</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.200" end="00:34:20.866" style="s2">We&#39;re doomed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.066" end="00:34:21.900" style="s2">This gap is so narrow.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.333" end="00:34:23.766" style="s2">An adult can&#39;t fit in there at all!</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.166" end="00:34:25.066" style="s2">Galen, think of something!</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.633" end="00:34:26.300" style="s2">If someone dies here,</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.366" end="00:34:27.566" style="s2">My dad will break my legs!</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.333" end="00:34:31.533" style="s2">Director, you&#39;re finally here!</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.833" end="00:34:32.966" style="s2">This little Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.066" end="00:34:34.766" style="s2">is howling like a stuck pig.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.100" end="00:34:36.733" style="s2">Miss Daisy is so mad.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.833" end="00:34:38.366" style="s2">Get him out of here, please!</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.566" end="00:34:40.166" style="s2">Or she&#39;ll ignore me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.166" end="00:34:40.866" style="s2">Atlas.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.266" end="00:34:42.200" style="s2">I know you&#39;re anxious.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.466" end="00:34:43.700" style="s2">But calm down first.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.900" end="00:34:44.766" style="s2">Stay quiet for me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.433" end="00:34:46.700" style="s2">If you dare to stomp around again,</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.866" end="00:34:49.300" style="s2">I&#39;ll separate you and Miss Daisy!</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.466" end="00:34:51.533" style="s2">If you keep causing a scene,</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.633" end="00:34:53.033" style="s2">you&#39;ll be single for life!</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.066" end="00:34:53.966" style="s2">No, no, no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.233" end="00:34:55.600" style="s2">Director, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.833" end="00:34:57.166" style="s2">I won&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.733" end="00:35:01.566" style="s2">Hey, come down and help!</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.833" end="00:35:03.700" style="s2">I&#39;ll say it one more time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.966" end="00:35:04.733" style="s2">My name isn&#39;t &quot;Hey.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.933" end="00:35:06.366" style="s2">I&#39;m Ffion, got it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.566" end="00:35:11.800" style="s2">Okay, okay, Ffion.</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.966" end="00:35:12.833" style="s2">Please do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.966" end="00:35:14.366" style="s2">Fly in and see where the kid&#39;s stuck.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.500" end="00:35:15.600" style="s2">And see if he&#39;s hurt at all.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.666" end="00:35:27.666" style="s2">I got a good look.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.666" end="00:35:28.266" style="s2">This little Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.366" end="00:35:29.566" style="s2">His clothes are caught on a wire.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.633" end="00:35:31.066" style="s2">And his butt is stuck, too.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.100" end="00:35:32.033" style="s2">The gap is too narrow.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.266" end="00:35:33.533" style="s2">An adult can&#39;t fit inside.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.666" end="00:35:34.866" style="s2">If we pull him out by force,</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.233" end="00:35:36.833" style="s2">the wire will definitely scratch him.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.066" end="00:35:38.500" style="s2">It&#39;s too dangerous to force it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.833" end="00:35:39.633" style="s2">We need a small,</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.033" end="00:35:41.033" style="s2">agile helper.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.266" end="00:35:45.233" style="s2">Brute force won&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.366" end="00:35:46.333" style="s2">We have to be smart about this.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.500" end="00:35:47.600" style="s2">I&#39;ll go get Clover to help.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.766" end="00:35:48.433" style="s2">You all stay out here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.533" end="00:35:49.166" style="s2">Keep the boy calm.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.333" end="00:35:51.300" style="s2">Whatever you do, don&#39;t agitate him or Atlas.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.400" end="00:35:52.100" style="s2">I&#39;m going to get help.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.200" end="00:35:52.866" style="s2">I&#39;ll be right back!</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.333" end="00:36:05.333" style="s2">This is a joke!</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.166" end="00:36:08.233" style="s2">Can a monkey save a child?</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.433" end="00:36:09.166" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.233" end="00:36:10.866" style="s2">Don&#39;t let it scratch his face.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.700" end="00:36:13.566" style="s2">Quiet down, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.900" end="00:36:14.866" style="s2">Step back two meters.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.233" end="00:36:15.900" style="s2">Don&#39;t crowd around.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.000" end="00:36:17.066" style="s2">Don&#39;t interfere with the rescue.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.700" end="00:36:19.466" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.833" end="00:36:21.033" style="s2">This is your rescue team?</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.500" end="00:36:23.000" style="s2">You want a monkey to save my son?</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.300" end="00:36:24.366" style="s2">Are you kidding me!</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.166" end="00:36:27.700" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, I&#39;m not kidding.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.733" end="00:36:29.333" style="s2">Do you have any snacks he likes?</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.400" end="00:36:40.900" style="s2">Clover,</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.633" end="00:36:43.966" style="s2">take this candy and crawl into the gap.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.433" end="00:36:45.866" style="s2">Give it to that little Two-Legger first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.300" end="00:36:47.533" style="s2">Then untangle his clothes</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.933" end="00:36:49.033" style="s2">from the wire mesh.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.066" end="00:36:51.866" style="s2">And slowly guide him out.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.600" end="00:36:54.200" style="s2">Director,</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.500" end="00:36:56.733" style="s2">I&#39;m doing you a huge favor this time.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.866" end="00:36:57.766" style="s2">When it&#39;s done,</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.966" end="00:36:59.666" style="s2">I want five big bananas.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.933" end="00:37:02.200" style="s2">They must be the imported ones.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.833" end="00:37:03.166" style="s2">Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.633" end="00:37:04.000" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.433" end="00:37:12.433" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid, little Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.333" end="00:37:25.933" style="s2">Atlas, I need a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.966" end="00:37:27.633" style="s2">Wrap your trunk around this safety belt.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.766" end="00:37:29.200" style="s2">Pull back slowly on my command.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.433" end="00:37:30.466" style="s2">No problem.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.166" end="00:37:32.866" style="s2">I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.233" end="00:37:40.433" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared, kiddo.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.133" end="00:37:41.933" style="s2">Follow the little monkey.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.566" end="00:37:43.900" style="s2">Step out slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.233" end="00:37:51.433" style="s2">Come here, little guy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.966" end="00:37:52.866" style="s2">Give me your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.600" end="00:38:21.200" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, thank you so much for today.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.600" end="00:38:22.500" style="s2">Our group is currently</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.533" end="00:38:24.000" style="s2">planning a Cultural Tourism Project.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.133" end="00:38:25.066" style="s2">As for our partnership,</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.233" end="00:38:26.266" style="s2">it&#39;s a done deal.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.266" end="00:38:28.100" style="s2">I&#39;ll draft the contract when I get back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.833" end="00:38:45.733" style="s2">Oh my god!</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.133" end="00:38:47.166" style="s2">Why are there so many people?</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.266" end="00:38:48.700" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, we&#39;re famous!</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.833" end="00:38:51.300" style="s2">Yesterday, a travel streamer posted the video of Clover</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.366" end="00:38:52.800" style="s2">and the elephant&#39;s rescue online.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.933" end="00:38:54.500" style="s2">It hit the top ten trending!</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.266" end="00:38:56.933" style="s2">Excellent.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.066" end="00:38:57.400" style="s2">Maggie,</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.566" end="00:38:58.533" style="s2">get ready for the guests!</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.733" end="00:39:06.500" style="s2">Why are there so many Two-Leggers?</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.633" end="00:39:07.833" style="s2">If you disturb my Daisy,</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.933" end="00:39:08.866" style="s2">are you gonna pay for it?</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.133" end="00:39:10.100" style="s2">Have some manners!</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.100" end="00:39:10.833" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.166" end="00:39:12.266" style="s2">I heard you speak animal.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.433" end="00:39:13.733" style="s2">What&#39;s this elephant saying?</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.733" end="00:39:15.833" style="s2">He&#39;s saying we have no manners.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.966" end="00:39:17.700" style="s2">And that we&#39;re disturbing his girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.800" end="00:39:20.133" style="s2">This elephant has a girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.233" end="00:39:21.066" style="s2">Which one is it?</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.800" end="00:39:25.766" style="s2">What are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.933" end="00:39:27.433" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna start charging for this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.866" end="00:39:29.366" style="s2">So what is she saying?</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.400" end="00:39:30.566" style="s2">She looks pretty upset.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.100" end="00:39:31.700" style="s2">She said</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.833" end="00:39:33.600" style="s2">she&#39;s gonna start charging if you keep looking.</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.600" end="00:39:34.400" style="s2">Who would&#39;ve thought?</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.500" end="00:39:35.766" style="s2">Miss Daisy is pretty trendy.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.466" end="00:39:43.733" style="s2">My voice is cracking.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.033" end="00:39:45.166" style="s2">I need some water.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.533" end="00:39:58.733" style="s2">Water, I can&#39;t lose you!</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.133" end="00:40:00.933" style="s2">How can I live without you?</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.966" end="00:40:07.400" style="s2">Enough, Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.600" end="00:40:08.233" style="s2">Stop acting.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.366" end="00:40:09.033" style="s2">Drink this.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.833" end="00:40:10.700" style="s2">What do you know?</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.366" end="00:40:12.800" style="s2">This is genuine emotion.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.900" end="00:40:20.233" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.033" end="00:40:21.866" style="s2">That hits the spot.</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.500" end="00:40:26.233" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, your acting is even worse than mine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.100" end="00:40:28.233" style="s2">Shoo, shoo!</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.300" end="00:40:29.566" style="s2">You haven&#39;t even won over your girl yet,</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.666" end="00:40:30.800" style="s2">and you have time to mock me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.933" end="00:40:34.233" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to hit an elephant where it hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.333" end="00:40:41.866" style="s2">Hello, Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.966" end="00:40:43.233" style="s2">The contract has been drafted.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.233" end="00:40:44.433" style="s2">The project support funds</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.433" end="00:40:46.133" style="s2">have been transferred to your account as well.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.233" end="00:40:47.300" style="s2">Our project will be named</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.433" end="00:40:48.533" style="s2">Wildlife Drama Live.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.566" end="00:40:49.433" style="s2">Prepare for it well.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.100" end="00:40:50.966" style="s2">No problem, Chairman Turner.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.466" end="00:41:01.200" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, can we really pull this off?</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.433" end="00:41:04.000" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget what your director is capable of.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.166" end="00:41:10.766" style="s2">Two-Legger, what do you want from me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.333" end="00:41:11.900" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.166" end="00:41:13.800" style="s2">We&#39;re hosting an event in a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.333" end="00:41:16.000" style="s2">All you need to do is play the boss.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.300" end="00:41:17.500" style="s2">Oh, my.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.833" end="00:41:19.033" style="s2">Playing myself?</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.400" end="00:41:20.766" style="s2">Why beat around the bush?</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.266" end="00:41:22.266" style="s2">As long as you cooperate,</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.433" end="00:41:23.466" style="s2">you&#39;ll get an extra meal tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.633" end="00:41:25.433" style="s2">Five pounds of top-grade imported Wagyu!</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.466" end="00:41:27.300" style="s2">Two-Legger,</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.533" end="00:41:30.333" style="s2">you&#39;ve got what it takes to be a special assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.666" end="00:41:31.266" style="s2">I accept.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.933" end="00:41:32.833" style="s2">Remember this,</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.066" end="00:41:34.566" style="s2">keep the camera on my left,</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.866" end="00:41:36.733" style="s2">that&#39;s my best side.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.466" end="00:41:39.966" style="s2">No problem, Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.366" end="00:41:48.966" style="s2">You little greenhorn.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.033" end="00:41:51.733" style="s2">You&#39;re egging me on to catch that stupid bird?</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.966" end="00:41:54.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll smack you today, you hear?</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.733" end="00:41:57.200" style="s2">With her shrill voice screeching all day long,</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.800" end="00:41:59.900" style="s2">you have no idea how awful it sounds.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.600" end="00:42:02.400" style="s2">Hey, you old geezer!</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.633" end="00:42:04.266" style="s2">My voice is like an angel&#39;s!</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.400" end="00:42:06.166" style="s2">You can&#39;t even hold a piece of fruit steady,</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.300" end="00:42:07.233" style="s2">and you want to catch me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.466" end="00:42:08.400" style="s2">In your dreams!</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.700" end="00:42:10.200" style="s2">Bronte.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.400" end="00:42:13.233" style="s2">All-you-can-eat fresh mangosteens and peaches.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.466" end="00:42:17.133" style="s2">Ffion.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.600" end="00:42:18.933" style="s2">A box of premium mealworms.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.433" end="00:42:21.333" style="s2">How about trading these for one performance?</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.633" end="00:42:23.533" style="s2">Oh, my!</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.800" end="00:42:26.033" style="s2">Suddenly, I don&#39;t want to smack you anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.200" end="00:42:28.566" style="s2">I&#39;ll just catch this little bird instead.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.733" end="00:42:30.466" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll play along too!</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.666" end="00:42:33.366" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.800" end="00:42:36.533" style="s2">Why is there no &quot;hero saves the damsel&quot; scene?</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.966" end="00:42:38.466" style="s2">I want to defeat the dragon</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.700" end="00:42:40.466" style="s2">and make Miss Daisy fall for me!</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.766" end="00:42:42.133" style="s2">Otherwise, I&#39;m out!</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.800" end="00:42:44.666" style="s2">Atlas.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.133" end="00:42:46.200" style="s2">As long as you follow my lead,</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.466" end="00:42:47.366" style="s2">I&#39;ll personally help you</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.433" end="00:42:48.833" style="s2">play matchmaker with Miss Daisy.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.533" end="00:42:51.000" style="s2">You better keep your word!</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.166" end="00:42:52.666" style="s2">If I can win Miss Daisy over,</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.833" end="00:42:54.500" style="s2">I&#39;d even roll on the ground for you!</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.633" end="00:43:03.733" style="s2">Finally got all these animals on board.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.000" end="00:43:04.700" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.900" end="00:43:05.700" style="s2">going to each of them</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.733" end="00:43:06.966" style="s2">to negotiate with the animals</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.033" end="00:43:09.033" style="s2">must be harder than haggling at the market.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.233" end="00:43:14.233" style="s2">It is a bit tiring,</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.533" end="00:43:16.200" style="s2">but we finally got them all sorted out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.333" end="00:43:17.566" style="s2">For the Cultural Tourism Project,</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.700" end="00:43:18.900" style="s2">let&#39;s just wait and see the show.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.633" end="00:43:28.300" style="s2">Oh my gosh!</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.833" end="00:43:30.366" style="s2">Look at my perfect jawline.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.566" end="00:43:31.366" style="s2">Did you see that clearly?</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.533" end="00:43:32.133" style="s2">Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.166" end="00:43:34.966" style="s2">This pose is just as good as a boss in a short drama!</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.066" end="00:43:35.533" style="s2">Help!</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.000" end="00:43:37.700" style="s2">He&#39;s killing me with his jawline!</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.933" end="00:43:40.233" style="s2">Ladies and gentlemen, tourists,</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.333" end="00:43:41.233" style="s2">look at our Mr. Hunt.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.400" end="00:43:42.366" style="s2">This runway walk!</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.566" end="00:43:43.766" style="s2">This boss-like gaze!</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.900" end="00:43:44.366" style="s2">He&#39;s definitely</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.466" end="00:43:46.233" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park&#39;s top male model!</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.500" end="00:43:48.100" style="s2">Are you sure it&#39;s not a male model in a tiger suit</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.100" end="00:43:48.766" style="s2">walking the runway?</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.866" end="00:43:49.500" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.633" end="00:43:49.866" style="s2">Next,</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.133" end="00:43:52.166" style="s2">we&#39;re heading to the next stop, Monkey Ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.833" end="00:44:00.466" style="s2">Bronte!</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.800" end="00:44:02.466" style="s2">Your paws are shaking like a leaf!</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.500" end="00:44:03.200" style="s2">Trying to catch me?</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.433" end="00:44:04.366" style="s2">You need more practice!</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.566" end="00:44:06.400" style="s2">Stupid bird!</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.533" end="00:44:07.566" style="s2">Come down if you dare!</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.766" end="00:44:09.066" style="s2">I&#39;ll slap you silly!</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.366" end="00:44:10.766" style="s2">This monkey is catching a bird!</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.866" end="00:44:12.500" style="s2">What are they saying, Mr. Rivers?</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.666" end="00:44:16.866" style="s2">Don&#39;t be fooled, everyone!</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.200" end="00:44:18.400" style="s2">Understanding animal language?</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.633" end="00:44:19.866" style="s2">He&#39;s just talking nonsense!</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.566" end="00:44:22.233" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.833" end="00:44:24.733" style="s2">The reason your animals are so obedient</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.766" end="00:44:25.766" style="s2">is because they&#39;re drugged!</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.000" end="00:44:27.666" style="s2">I&#39;m reporting you for animal abuse!</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.233" end="00:44:33.566" style="s2">Mr. Rivers! Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.633" end="00:44:34.800" style="s2">That bald manager&#39;s gold watch</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.933" end="00:44:35.700" style="s2">is covered in the scent of</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.733" end="00:44:37.100" style="s2">the bespectacled Two-Legger next to him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.200" end="00:44:38.166" style="s2">It&#39;s not his at all!</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.166" end="00:44:39.233" style="s2">Mr. Webster&#39;s watch</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.300" end="00:44:40.733" style="s2">is covered in Professor Yarrow&#39;s scent.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.966" end="00:44:42.100" style="s2">Could these two men really have</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.133" end="00:44:43.300" style="s2">some unspeakable secret?</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.300" end="00:44:44.866" style="s2">Mr. Webster, report me all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.333" end="00:44:45.933" style="s2">However,</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.000" end="00:44:47.433" style="s2">that Cartier watch on your wrist</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.200" end="00:44:49.066" style="s2">is quite unique.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.166" end="00:44:50.300" style="s2">What do you care about my watch?</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.433" end="00:44:52.500" style="s2">What does this have to do with you abusing animals?</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.500" end="00:44:53.000" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.666" end="00:44:54.000" style="s2">Barrett Jr.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.700" end="00:44:56.633" style="s2">Why does that watch look so much like mine?</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.666" end="00:44:59.233" style="s2">It even has my initials on the back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.566" end="00:44:59.866" style="s2">Barrett Jr.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.066" end="00:45:00.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.133" end="00:45:02.233" style="s2">have feelings for me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.466" end="00:45:03.133" style="s2">Oh boy!</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.266" end="00:45:04.900" style="s2">This tea is sweeter than a peach!</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.533" end="00:45:07.133" style="s2">Came to catch someone else out,</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.200" end="00:45:09.500" style="s2">but exposed yourself instead!</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.733" end="00:45:10.300" style="s2">Nonsense!</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.400" end="00:45:11.333" style="s2">I drank too much last night.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.400" end="00:45:12.366" style="s2">I just grabbed the wrong one!</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.366" end="00:45:12.900" style="s2">Mr. Webster.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.033" end="00:45:13.800" style="s2">Drug test reports,</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.033" end="00:45:14.800" style="s2">animal injury records,</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.033" end="00:45:15.933" style="s2">official inspection papers</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.000" end="00:45:16.533" style="s2">You have none of them.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.633" end="00:45:17.400" style="s2">You just open your mouth</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.433" end="00:45:18.533" style="s2">to label Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.600" end="00:45:19.266" style="s2">as animal abusers.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.366" end="00:45:20.033" style="s2">We won&#39;t accept this.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.133" end="00:45:21.400" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park welcomes oversight,</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.466" end="00:45:22.666" style="s2">but we absolutely reject rumors!</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.700" end="00:45:23.833" style="s2">Maggie Lane, zoom in!</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.866" end="00:45:25.066" style="s2">Guys, the stream continues.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.133" end="00:45:26.333" style="s2">Bronte and Ffion&#39;s rivalry</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.366" end="00:45:27.300" style="s2">is officially on!</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.233" end="00:45:32.366" style="s2">That&#39;s a lot of information to take in.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.700" end="00:45:34.333" style="s2">Is Mr. Webster gay?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.100" end="00:45:35.800" style="s2">Macaque Troop!</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.100" end="00:45:37.500" style="s2">Come and get the gossip!</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.466" end="00:45:41.266" style="s2">Is this gossip reliable?</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.966" end="00:45:42.866" style="s2">Absolutely!</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.533" end="00:45:44.100" style="s2">Bronte,</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.633" end="00:45:46.433" style="s2">how come you&#39;re not hard of hearing this time?</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.333" end="00:45:48.600" style="s2">Is it the same?</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.900" end="00:45:50.666" style="s2">I love gossip the most.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.866" end="00:45:53.400" style="s2">I have zero interest in you!</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.433" end="00:45:58.533" style="s2">Look, I&#39;m married.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.766" end="00:45:59.533" style="s2">This is my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.633" end="00:46:00.133" style="s2">Mr. Yarrow,</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.300" end="00:46:01.500" style="s2">You&#39;re insulting my integrity.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.666" end="00:46:02.700" style="s2">You owe me an apology.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.366" end="00:46:04.066" style="s2">Thank goodness.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.333" end="00:46:05.066" style="s2">Scared me to death.</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.333" end="00:46:06.500" style="s2">I thought he really liked me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.733" end="00:46:07.466" style="s2">My mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.500" end="00:46:09.066" style="s2">That watch doesn&#39;t just smell like the professor.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.166" end="00:46:10.633" style="s2">It smells like a female Two-Legger too.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.700" end="00:46:11.600" style="s2">And inside his left pocket,</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.733" end="00:46:12.733" style="s2">it smells exactly the same.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.766" end="00:46:13.100" style="s2">Look!</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.333" end="00:46:14.266" style="s2">It looks like that little monkey</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.300" end="00:46:15.566" style="s2">is talking to Mr. Rivers again.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.566" end="00:46:16.233" style="s2">You&#39;re right!</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.266" end="00:46:17.433" style="s2">Do monkeys enjoy gossip too?</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.566" end="00:46:18.833" style="s2">The watch belongs to Professor Yarrow.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.933" end="00:46:20.366" style="s2">It&#39;s normal that it smells like him.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.400" end="00:46:21.366" style="s2">But this woman&#39;s scent</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.533" end="00:46:22.733" style="s2">Why is it also in his pocket?</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.800" end="00:46:23.633" style="s2">Whatever it is,</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.666" end="00:46:24.533" style="s2">if we take it out</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.700" end="00:46:25.600" style="s2">we&#39;ll find out!</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.033" end="00:46:26.500" style="s2">Ffion!</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.900" end="00:46:28.133" style="s2">See that jumping Two-Legger?</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.533" end="00:46:29.633" style="s2">The thing in his left pocket</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.766" end="00:46:30.833" style="s2">Can you help get it out?</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.866" end="00:46:31.400" style="s2">You got it!</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.500" end="00:46:32.066" style="s2">When it&#39;s done,</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.266" end="00:46:33.333" style="s2">tell your keeper to give me</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.366" end="00:46:35.366" style="s2">an extra box of fat bugs. Deal?</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.133" end="00:46:37.833" style="s2">Watch and learn.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.366" end="00:46:40.033" style="s2">Let me show you my special trick.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.533" end="00:46:42.233" style="s2">Got the scarf!</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.466" end="00:46:43.700" style="s2">Stupid bird, give it back!</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.700" end="00:46:44.166" style="s2">My skills</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.233" end="00:46:45.066" style="s2">are no joke.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.166" end="00:46:45.833" style="s2">Trying to catch me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.033" end="00:46:47.000" style="s2">Not a chance!</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.533" end="00:46:50.533" style="s2">Well done, Ffion!</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.366" end="00:46:51.766" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.300" end="00:46:53.200" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this my wife&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.333" end="00:46:55.233" style="s2">Ffion and the little monkey are amazing!</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.333" end="00:46:56.833" style="s2">Such great teamwork!</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.100" end="00:46:58.033" style="s2">I just found it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.200" end="00:46:59.866" style="s2">How would I know it&#39;s your wife&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.366" end="00:47:00.766" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.200" end="00:47:02.000" style="s2">My wife happens to be at</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.033" end="00:47:02.966" style="s2">your Wildscape Park today.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.766" end="00:47:04.666" style="s2">I&#39;ll call her over right now</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.900" end="00:47:05.900" style="s2">to verify this in person.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.500" end="00:47:16.900" style="s2">Hey, look, she&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.866" end="00:47:21.233" style="s2">That&#39;s her scent.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.033" end="00:47:29.966" style="s2">Why are you wearing my husband&#39;s watch?</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.266" end="00:47:31.266" style="s2">Are you out of your mind?!</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.300" end="00:47:33.133" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.466" end="00:47:34.300" style="s2">hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.866" end="00:47:36.066" style="s2">Stealing from us,</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.833" end="00:47:38.233" style="s2">a slap is getting off easy!</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.900" end="00:47:39.266" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.733" end="00:47:40.500" style="s2">I stole it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.533" end="00:47:45.300" style="s2">They&#39;re lying.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.500" end="00:47:46.466" style="s2">This female Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.566" end="00:47:48.166" style="s2">smells strongly of Mr. Webster.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.266" end="00:47:49.366" style="s2">They must be very close.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.366" end="00:47:50.066" style="s2">Look at that!</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.133" end="00:47:51.300" style="s2">Clover is moving again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.333" end="00:47:52.400" style="s2">Last time Clover pointed,</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.500" end="00:47:53.600" style="s2">Mr. Webster dropped his loot.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.766" end="00:47:54.700" style="s2">What&#39;s it gonna be this time?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.166" end="00:47:59.533" style="s2">Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.400" end="00:48:02.600" style="s2">Clover says you two are lying.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.066" end="00:48:05.233" style="s2">Are you messing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.600" end="00:48:06.600" style="s2">Monkeys can talk now?</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.233" end="00:48:08.300" style="s2">Then tell me this,</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.500" end="00:48:09.266" style="s2">why would a grown man</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.333" end="00:48:11.166" style="s2">pick up a woman&#39;s lipstick and scarf?</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.366" end="00:48:12.533" style="s2">A married man carrying around</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.633" end="00:48:14.033" style="s2">another man&#39;s wife&#39;s lipstick and scarf?</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.066" end="00:48:15.100" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t look like he just found them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.100" end="00:48:16.166" style="s2">I don&#39;t think he found them either.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.200" end="00:48:17.766" style="s2">I think his lies are about to be exposed.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.700" end="00:48:20.433" style="s2">Darling!</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.033" end="00:48:22.300" style="s2">Let&#39;s go public!</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.866" end="00:48:24.833" style="s2">Know your place!</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.233" end="00:48:26.866" style="s2">You&#39;re just a fling for when I&#39;m lonely.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.966" end="00:48:28.300" style="s2">You don&#39;t even compare to a single hair</p>
