<p begin="00:55:30.866" end="00:55:31.966" style="s2">We would never carelessly throw</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.033" end="00:55:33.866" style="s2">these dangerous syringes in the park.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.133" end="00:55:34.600" style="s2">These things</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.633" end="00:55:36.066" style="s2">definitely don&#39;t belong to our park!</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.200" end="00:55:37.066" style="s2">Protect the scene first.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.366" end="00:55:38.233" style="s2">Check the security footage.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.700" end="00:55:39.733" style="s2">I must find out immediately</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.800" end="00:55:40.600" style="s2">where they came from!</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.400" end="00:55:46.700" style="s2">Rex!</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.866" end="00:55:47.366" style="s2">Quick!</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.433" end="00:55:48.666" style="s2">Get the rest of the syringes in the bushes</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.733" end="00:55:49.466" style="s2">and bring them here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.566" end="00:55:53.233" style="s2">Two-Legger,</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.733" end="00:55:54.600" style="s2">hold them tight.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.900" end="00:55:56.633" style="s2">I&#39;m not picking up your trash.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.033" end="00:55:59.133" style="s2">I&#39;m definitely getting extra food tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.966" end="00:56:05.566" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.333" end="00:56:07.533" style="s2">Until we get to the bottom of this,</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.866" end="00:56:08.833" style="s2">the investment is on hold.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.333" end="00:56:09.733" style="s2">Mr. Shaw,</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.133" end="00:56:10.566" style="s2">let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.300" end="00:56:11.700" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.133" end="00:56:12.733" style="s2">you go on ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.933" end="00:56:13.866" style="s2">I&#39;m staying to help my buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.200" end="00:56:15.966" style="s2">I won&#39;t leave until we find the real culprit.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.333" end="00:56:17.900" style="s2">You can stay.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.466" end="00:56:19.066" style="s2">Handle it properly.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.233" end="00:56:20.433" style="s2">Just don&#39;t cause any trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.766" end="00:56:24.866" style="s2">Five million dollars</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.066" end="00:56:25.300" style="s2">Poof!</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.633" end="00:56:26.233" style="s2">just gone.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.233" end="00:56:26.966" style="s2">Which jerk</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.133" end="00:56:28.333" style="s2">is trying to ruin my park?</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.333" end="00:56:28.633" style="s2">Rupert,</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.833" end="00:56:30.000" style="s2">let&#39;s split up and find clues.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.166" end="00:56:31.500" style="s2">We have to find who did this today.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.500" end="00:56:31.900" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.100" end="00:56:33.100" style="s2">With me on the case,</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.100" end="00:56:34.300" style="s2">even if the culprit had wings,</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.366" end="00:56:35.266" style="s2">they wouldn&#39;t get away.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.166" end="00:56:38.866" style="s2">This blue is so tacky.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.433" end="00:56:40.833" style="s2">You look like a tour guide.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.033" end="00:56:42.166" style="s2">I&#39;ll throw it away for you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.866" end="00:56:45.533" style="s2">Stupid bird!</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.766" end="00:56:46.733" style="s2">That&#39;s a limited edition!</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.866" end="00:56:48.000" style="s2">Give me my hat back!</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.033" end="00:56:48.966" style="s2">Come on, Sherlock.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.166" end="00:56:50.166" style="s2">The hat&#39;s not leaving the park.</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.400" end="00:56:51.766" style="s2">Let&#39;s check Monkey Ridge first.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.533" end="00:57:00.233" style="s2">Bronte, think carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.300" end="00:57:01.566" style="s2">You really didn&#39;t see anyone suspicious</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.633" end="00:57:02.066" style="s2">last night?</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.100" end="00:57:03.933" style="s2">Didn&#39;t see a single shadow.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.033" end="00:57:05.766" style="s2">But I did smell a Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.900" end="00:57:07.133" style="s2">in the middle of the night.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.300" end="00:57:08.400" style="s2">As for this hat,</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.566" end="00:57:10.133" style="s2">consider it my tip fee.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.800" end="00:57:18.500" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.000" end="00:57:20.166" style="s2">What is that in your hands?</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.166" end="00:57:21.100" style="s2">Please let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.133" end="00:57:22.033" style="s2">We just found these in the park.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.033" end="00:57:22.800" style="s2">They&#39;re already numbered and sealed.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.866" end="00:57:23.900" style="s2">We were about to trace where they came from.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.933" end="00:57:25.066" style="s2">We received a verified report.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.200" end="00:57:26.200" style="s2">It claims you&#39;ve been using drugs</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.233" end="00:57:27.000" style="s2">to control the animals.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.133" end="00:57:28.566" style="s2">And now we find these syringes on the premises.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.666" end="00:57:30.000" style="s2">You need to give us a full explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.033" end="00:57:30.566" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.666" end="00:57:31.966" style="s2">please cooperate with the investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.066" end="00:57:33.333" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park is closed</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.366" end="00:57:34.266" style="s2">effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.400" end="00:57:35.466" style="s2">Seal off the relevant areas.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.633" end="00:57:37.066" style="s2">You&#39;re undergoing a full investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.900" end="00:57:39.400" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.533" end="00:57:40.666" style="s2">I&#39;m handing over all the evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.866" end="00:57:42.366" style="s2">I will fully cooperate with the investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.433" end="00:57:43.000" style="s2">But these things,</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.100" end="00:57:44.566" style="s2">they really aren&#39;t from our wildlife park.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.400" end="00:57:49.300" style="s2">That kid feeds me every day.</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.400" end="00:57:50.366" style="s2">Why would he drug me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.700" end="00:57:51.700" style="s2">If you keep accusing him,</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.866" end="00:57:53.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach you a lesson today!</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.233" end="00:57:53.533" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.700" end="00:57:54.733" style="s2">The director would never hurt us.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.933" end="00:57:56.066" style="s2">He even gives me big bananas.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.266" end="00:57:57.200" style="s2">No one is allowed to snatch it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.233" end="00:57:57.866" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.866" end="00:57:58.466" style="s2">Why are these animals</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.466" end="00:57:59.300" style="s2">suddenly acting so erratic?</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.433" end="00:58:00.233" style="s2">Could this be a side effect</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.233" end="00:58:01.133" style="s2">of long-term medication?</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.133" end="00:58:01.966" style="s2">If we confirm they&#39;ve been drugged,</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.066" end="00:58:03.366" style="s2">you&#39;re looking at a year&#39;s closure at best.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.466" end="00:58:04.866" style="s2">At worst, the Landscape Authority takes over.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.900" end="00:58:06.100" style="s2">Until we get to the bottom of this,</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.100" end="00:58:07.466" style="s2">we can&#39;t risk them getting hurt again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.700" end="00:58:09.200" style="s2">If needed, we&#39;ll relocate them</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.300" end="00:58:10.100" style="s2">for centralized care.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.100" end="00:58:10.533" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.700" end="00:58:11.533" style="s2">You dare to kick me</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.633" end="00:58:12.333" style="s2">out of my own home?</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.433" end="00:58:13.533" style="s2">Point that finger at me again!</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.700" end="00:58:14.866" style="s2">I&#39;ll smack you, I swear!</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.900" end="00:58:16.133" style="s2">Sir, please don&#39;t relocate them.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.233" end="00:58:16.966" style="s2">Just give me one minute.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.033" end="00:58:18.400" style="s2">I promise I can calm them down.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.500" end="00:58:19.000" style="s2">Stop yelling!</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.033" end="00:58:19.666" style="s2">They don&#39;t understand you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.933" end="00:58:21.166" style="s2">You&#39;re just making it look like a side effect.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.266" end="00:58:23.166" style="s2">If you want to help, just sit and act normal.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.266" end="00:58:26.866" style="s2">Fine. We won&#39;t relocate the animals for now.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.866" end="00:58:27.866" style="s2">They can stay here under observation.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.900" end="00:58:29.400" style="s2">But their condition must be recorded at all times.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.433" end="00:58:30.366" style="s2">Relocation can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.500" end="00:58:31.933" style="s2">But we need to inspect every zone today.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.100" end="00:58:34.900" style="s2">Feed, facilities, cameras, and animal conditions.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.033" end="00:58:36.100" style="s2">Don&#39;t miss a single corner!</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.933" end="00:58:39.533" style="s2">No problem.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.733" end="00:58:40.400" style="s2">Right this way.</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.833" end="00:58:41.366" style="s2">I&#39;ll lead the way.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.533" end="00:58:42.566" style="s2">Check any area you want.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.266" end="00:58:47.500" style="s2">Inside my royal palace,</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.733" end="00:58:48.633" style="s2">why is there trash?</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.766" end="00:58:49.533" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper,</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.733" end="00:58:50.866" style="s2">get rid of it right now!</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.033" end="00:58:51.466" style="s2">Princess.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.900" end="00:58:52.366" style="s2">What trash?</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.466" end="00:58:53.233" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch it with your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.366" end="00:58:54.600" style="s2">Push it onto the tray for me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.166" end="00:59:03.900" style="s2">Wildscape.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.700" end="00:59:06.166" style="s2">This is from Wildscape Park!</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.700" end="00:59:07.800" style="s2">Sir, look at this.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.300" end="00:59:08.700" style="s2">Wildscape.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.900" end="00:59:10.400" style="s2">It&#39;s the logo of Wildscape Park next door.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.666" end="00:59:11.766" style="s2">This is very likely a piece of</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.800" end="00:59:12.833" style="s2">their special feed bag.</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.466" end="00:59:14.433" style="s2">That guy must&#39;ve used this bag</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.600" end="00:59:15.500" style="s2">to sneak the syringes in!</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.766" end="00:59:16.800" style="s2">Case closed, right?</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.166" end="00:59:18.866" style="s2">It only proves</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.933" end="00:59:20.633" style="s2">the scrap is from Wildscape Park.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.666" end="00:59:22.233" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t prove it held syringes.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.366" end="00:59:24.066" style="s2">Mr. Ellison, the case isn&#39;t closed yet.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.100" end="00:59:25.366" style="s2">There is indeed blue residue inside.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.466" end="00:59:25.900" style="s2">Ms. Pemberton,</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.133" end="00:59:27.166" style="s2">seal it for testing right away.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.333" end="00:59:28.600" style="s2">Also pull the Leopard Cat Pavilion&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.766" end="00:59:30.166" style="s2">footage and access logs from last night.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.300" end="00:59:38.266" style="s2">Hold on, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.066" end="00:59:39.633" style="s2">Mr. Webster</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.833" end="00:59:40.933" style="s2">Mr. Webster from the park next door</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.133" end="00:59:41.800" style="s2">and I have bad blood.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.900" end="00:59:43.433" style="s2">And this fragment came from his park.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.633" end="00:59:44.733" style="s2">He&#39;s highly suspicious.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.133" end="00:59:46.800" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.400" end="00:59:48.966" style="s2">bad blood only means you suspect him.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.333" end="00:59:50.733" style="s2">These are just guesses for now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.833" end="00:59:51.933" style="s2">They don&#39;t count as evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.333" end="00:59:53.133" style="s2">You Two-Leggers</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.166" end="00:59:54.733" style="s2">are so adorably foolish.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.833" end="00:59:57.000" style="s2">If one plan fails, let him try again.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.033" end="00:59:58.900" style="s2">Let&#39;s see who really catches the mouse.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.633" end="01:00:00.366" style="s2">Right!</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.366" end="01:00:03.933" style="s2">Bro.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.300" end="01:00:05.100" style="s2">Are you alright?</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.433" end="01:00:06.366" style="s2">Should we pause the case</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.400" end="01:00:07.400" style="s2">and see a doctor?</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.100" end="01:00:08.700" style="s2">I&#39;m great.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.833" end="01:00:09.633" style="s2">I&#39;m perfectly fine.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.900" end="01:00:10.766" style="s2">Never been better.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.800" end="01:00:11.500" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a plan!</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.766" end="01:00:12.766" style="s2">We can announce to the public</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.900" end="01:00:14.200" style="s2">that we&#39;re resuming reservations.</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.333" end="01:00:15.533" style="s2">Meanwhile, we&#39;ll keep it a secret</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.566" end="01:00:16.666" style="s2">that we&#39;ve made a breakthrough.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.800" end="01:00:18.533" style="s2">When the culprit realizes they failed,</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.600" end="01:00:19.833" style="s2">they&#39;ll probably try again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.900" end="01:00:20.900" style="s2">We just leave an opening,</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.966" end="01:00:21.766" style="s2">block their escape,</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.800" end="01:00:24.000" style="s2">and wait for them to take the bait.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.033" end="01:00:24.933" style="s2">You just found a threat,</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.966" end="01:00:25.966" style="s2">yet you want to open normally</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.133" end="01:00:26.633" style="s2">and wait for them?</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.800" end="01:00:27.766" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you using the animals as bait?</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.900" end="01:00:28.666" style="s2">This is ridiculous!</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.666" end="01:00:29.533" style="s2">We can discuss a trap,</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.633" end="01:00:31.100" style="s2">but animal safety is no joke.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.133" end="01:00:32.400" style="s2">Any plan that lets the suspect</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.466" end="01:00:33.500" style="s2">get near the animals again</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.500" end="01:00:34.366" style="s2">will not be approved.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.366" end="01:00:35.733" style="s2">The animal zones will be double-fenced.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.833" end="01:00:37.266" style="s2">Bait will only be in the outer warehouse.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.366" end="01:00:38.100" style="s2">We&#39;ll limit visitors.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.233" end="01:00:39.866" style="s2">We&#39;ll intercept them at the supply gate.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.000" end="01:00:41.366" style="s2">I promise they won&#39;t lose a single hair.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.833" end="01:00:45.100" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle the outer security</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.133" end="01:00:46.133" style="s2">and surveillance equipment.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.533" end="01:00:48.533" style="s2">I swear on the Ellison Group&#39;s reputation,</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.833" end="01:00:50.866" style="s2">no one will lay a finger on a single animal.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.266" end="01:00:58.633" style="s2">The Landscape Authority must supervise</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.666" end="01:00:59.300" style="s2">the whole process.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.400" end="01:01:01.433" style="s2">The animal zones will remain closed and isolated.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.466" end="01:01:02.766" style="s2">If there&#39;s any risk of losing control,</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.900" end="01:01:04.300" style="s2">the plan will be terminated immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.100" end="01:01:05.833" style="s2">Mhm.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.533" end="01:01:12.500" style="s2">Let&#39;s go, Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.566" end="01:01:13.733" style="s2">Let&#39;s gather our animal advisors</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.800" end="01:01:14.866" style="s2">and figure out our battle plan.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.200" end="01:01:17.100" style="s2">Hey, whose idea was this?</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.266" end="01:01:19.000" style="s2">Shouldn&#39;t you consult me, the Princess,</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.066" end="01:01:20.266" style="s2">before planning your battle?</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.266" end="01:01:20.800" style="s2">Yes, yes, yes.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.900" end="01:01:21.700" style="s2">I didn&#39;t think it through.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.733" end="01:01:23.000" style="s2">You are the chief advisor, Princess.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.033" end="01:01:23.800" style="s2">Please enlighten us.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.333" end="01:01:30.633" style="s2">What did the little cat just say?</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.900" end="01:01:32.366" style="s2">Does she really want to be our strategist?</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.533" end="01:01:33.833" style="s2">She wants us to consult her first.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.100" end="01:01:36.066" style="s2">She&#39;s Princess and Chief Strategist now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.700" end="01:01:39.300" style="s2">Princess.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.833" end="01:01:41.266" style="s2">I&#39;ll install an alarm button here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.766" end="01:01:42.966" style="s2">If any bad guys get close to you,</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.133" end="01:01:44.033" style="s2">press it immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.400" end="01:01:45.500" style="s2">I&#39;ll get the signal right away.</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.633" end="01:01:46.033" style="s2">Understand?</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.266" end="01:01:49.433" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.666" end="01:01:50.266" style="s2">Did you hear me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.400" end="01:01:51.133" style="s2">At least make a sound</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.200" end="01:01:52.166" style="s2">so I know you understand.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.200" end="01:01:53.733" style="s2">Ill-mannered Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.133" end="01:01:57.166" style="s2">You should say &quot;Princess, please listen&quot; first.</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.833" end="01:02:04.200" style="s2">Princess.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.300" end="01:02:05.600" style="s2">Please listen.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.733" end="01:02:08.266" style="s2">Princess.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.066" end="01:02:09.600" style="s2">Make sure you</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.666" end="01:02:10.833" style="s2">get used to the button.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.100" end="01:02:13.200" style="s2">If anything&#39;s wrong</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.233" end="01:02:15.600" style="s2">Alright, the Princess gets it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.700" end="01:02:17.266" style="s2">You are dismissed.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.633" end="01:02:19.866" style="s2">This cat even expects a &quot;Princess, please listen.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.966" end="01:02:20.433" style="s2">And then?</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.833" end="01:02:21.666" style="s2">What else did she say?</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.766" end="01:02:22.500" style="s2">She told me</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.300" end="01:02:24.366" style="s2">I am dismissed.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.500" end="01:02:27.100" style="s2">I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.300" end="01:02:28.000" style="s2">I&#39;m dying!</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.166" end="01:02:29.600" style="s2">First you have bossy tiger Rex,</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.700" end="01:02:30.966" style="s2">and now a princess leopard cat.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.066" end="01:02:32.566" style="s2">Were they all actors in a past life?</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.566" end="01:02:32.966" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.400" end="01:02:34.300" style="s2">Time to go find your</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.366" end="01:02:35.433" style="s2">bossy tiger Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.333" end="01:02:38.733" style="s2">Two-Legger, he&#39;s laughing so hard.</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.866" end="01:02:40.000" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you laughing?</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.166" end="01:02:41.900" style="s2">Were you born without a smile?</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.100" end="01:02:43.600" style="s2">Galen, did that get to you?</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.866" end="01:02:45.066" style="s2">It totally got to you!</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.033" end="01:02:54.300" style="s2">Here we go again.</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.433" end="01:02:55.800" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.933" end="01:02:57.500" style="s2">Someone&#39;s trying to sabotage the park.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.533" end="01:02:58.533" style="s2">I&#39;ll put a panic button</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.600" end="01:02:59.366" style="s2">right by the feeding chute.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.533" end="01:03:00.866" style="s2">Hit it if you see anything off.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.900" end="01:03:01.466" style="s2">Understand?</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.833" end="01:03:02.033" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.333" end="01:03:03.233" style="s2">Making such a big fuss.</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.366" end="01:03:03.933" style="s2">Piece of cake.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.000" end="01:03:05.133" style="s2">They&#39;d better hope I don&#39;t catch them.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.333" end="01:03:06.200" style="s2">One swipe of my paw,</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.333" end="01:03:07.933" style="s2">and I&#39;ll squash that Two-Legger flat.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.333" end="01:03:10.066" style="s2">Achoo!</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.900" end="01:03:12.466" style="s2">That&#39;s why you&#39;re the boss, Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.666" end="01:03:13.333" style="s2">One swipe from you</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.500" end="01:03:14.533" style="s2">would make the stones tremble.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.700" end="01:03:16.000" style="s2">The safety of Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.033" end="01:03:17.166" style="s2">rests entirely in your paws.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.233" end="01:03:18.100" style="s2">Rex&#39;s got that kingly vibe.</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.300" end="01:03:19.133" style="s2">He&#39;s totally got this.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.133" end="01:03:20.300" style="s2">If you catch &#39;em, I&#39;ll personally deliver</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.333" end="01:03:21.633" style="s2">10 pounds of premium Wagyu beef.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.666" end="01:03:22.300" style="s2">Not an ounce less.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.300" end="01:03:23.633" style="s2">I&#39;m not doing this for the food.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.800" end="01:03:25.533" style="s2">It&#39;s mainly out of a strong sense of duty.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.600" end="01:03:26.066" style="s2">Put it here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.266" end="01:03:27.033" style="s2">Easy for my paw.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.533" end="01:03:29.033" style="s2">We need to have everyone on alert before dark.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.366" end="01:03:30.200" style="s2">We can&#39;t leave any loopholes</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.233" end="01:03:30.833" style="s2">for the guy behind this.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.400" end="01:03:31.933" style="s2">We gotta hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.933" end="01:03:32.266" style="s2">Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.433" end="01:03:33.333" style="s2">Since you&#39;re just tagging along with me,</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.500" end="01:03:34.333" style="s2">use your superpower of wealth</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.333" end="01:03:35.866" style="s2">and set up wireless panic buttons all over the park.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.033" end="01:03:36.800" style="s2">They have to be installed today.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.833" end="01:03:37.933" style="s2">No problem, piece of cake.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.966" end="01:03:38.600" style="s2">I&#39;ll have someone bring over</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.633" end="01:03:40.000" style="s2">the most advanced wireless alarms right now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.000" end="01:03:41.000" style="s2">They&#39;ll be all over the park in no time.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.033" end="01:03:41.500" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.500" end="01:03:42.200" style="s2">You handle the buttons.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.266" end="01:03:43.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll go talk to the other animals.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.433" end="01:03:43.933" style="s2">Before dark,</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.033" end="01:03:45.433" style="s2">we&#39;re going to tighten this net completely.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.066" end="01:03:48.366" style="s2">Bro.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.600" end="01:03:49.733" style="s2">All the alarm points are set up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.933" end="01:03:50.600" style="s2">Everything&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.966" end="01:03:52.033" style="s2">Now we just wait for that Webster guy</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.100" end="01:03:53.033" style="s2">to walk right into our trap.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.600" end="01:03:57.400" style="s2">Stay alert tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.933" end="01:03:59.100" style="s2">Check out any movement carefully first.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.300" end="01:03:59.966" style="s2">Don&#39;t rush in blindly.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.166" end="01:04:01.166" style="s2">And definitely don&#39;t alert them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.966" end="01:04:07.800" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.066" end="01:04:08.566" style="s2">They&#39;re here!</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.733" end="01:04:10.333" style="s2">In the bushes right behind Monkey Ridge.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.466" end="01:04:12.133" style="s2">Creeping around looking super sketchy!</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.700" end="01:04:13.400" style="s2">Finally.</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.400" end="01:04:16.966" style="s2">The real show begins now.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.766" end="01:04:30.100" style="s2">Look!</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.300" end="01:04:30.800" style="s2">The one who got</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.866" end="01:04:32.533" style="s2">smacked real hard a few days ago,</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.900" end="01:04:34.733" style="s2">that fat Two-Legger is back!</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.466" end="01:04:37.066" style="s2">The wimp who went crying back</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.100" end="01:04:38.700" style="s2">to his mommy after getting hit?</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.833" end="01:04:39.733" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that him?</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.866" end="01:04:41.433" style="s2">Carrying a net in the middle of the night.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.633" end="01:04:43.133" style="s2">Is he up to no good?</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.433" end="01:04:56.433" style="s2">Oh, my.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.766" end="01:04:58.200" style="s2">Looking for me at this hour?</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.533" end="01:05:00.166" style="s2">Go on, speak.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.366" end="01:05:02.900" style="s2">What business could you possibly have with me, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.933" end="01:05:03.533" style="s2">Ahhh!</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.066" end="01:05:05.100" style="s2">A monkey!</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.166" end="01:05:09.233" style="s2">His guts are</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.266" end="01:05:10.600" style="s2">smaller than a mouse.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.966" end="01:05:12.200" style="s2">How useless!</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.600" end="01:05:21.166" style="s2">Mommy!</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.566" end="01:05:23.233" style="s2">This wildlife park is terrifying!</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.733" end="01:05:24.666" style="s2">Monkeys blocking the way,</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.000" end="01:05:26.966" style="s2">and why are there alarms on the ground?!</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.733" end="01:05:30.433" style="s2">Webster!</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.033" end="01:05:31.900" style="s2">You bastard!</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.466" end="01:05:34.233" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna skin you alive!</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.433" end="01:05:37.133" style="s2">Oh no, Rupert is too impulsive.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.166" end="01:05:38.266" style="s2">He completely blew our cover!</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.466" end="01:05:39.366" style="s2">Crap.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.633" end="01:05:40.533" style="s2">I&#39;ve been spotted.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.900" end="01:05:41.700" style="s2">Good thing I memorized</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.700" end="01:05:43.833" style="s2">the park&#39;s layout beforehand. I gotta run!</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.033" end="01:05:44.766" style="s2">After him!</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.700" end="01:05:52.200" style="s2">Oh no!</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.600" end="01:05:53.933" style="s2">There&#39;s a side door near Elephant Grove.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.100" end="01:05:55.800" style="s2">That&#39;s where feed is usually delivered.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.833" end="01:05:56.500" style="s2">Then</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.800" end="01:05:57.600" style="s2">What do we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.900" end="01:05:59.000" style="s2">If he makes it to that door,</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.200" end="01:06:00.700" style="s2">we waited out here all night for nothing!</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.933" end="01:06:01.866" style="s2">If we miss him this time,</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.000" end="01:06:03.533" style="s2">it&#39;ll be hard to catch him red-handed again.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.600" end="01:06:04.800" style="s2">We can&#39;t let him get away!</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.766" end="01:06:16.933" style="s2">Ffion, stop him!</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.000" end="01:06:18.500" style="s2">Atlas, block his way!</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.566" end="01:06:20.733" style="s2">Guys, aim for that bald fatty!</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.966" end="01:06:21.866" style="s2">Don&#39;t peck his eyes!</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.033" end="01:06:23.733" style="s2">Just scare his shiny bald head!</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.800" end="01:06:24.733" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him escape!</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.466" end="01:06:29.833" style="s2">Ouch! Where did these damn birds come from?</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.933" end="01:06:31.833" style="s2">Get lost! All of you, get lost!</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.533" end="01:06:51.666" style="s2">How dare you cause trouble</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.700" end="01:06:52.733" style="s2">on my date with Daisy!</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.866" end="01:06:54.200" style="s2">Take a taste of my</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.300" end="01:06:55.000" style="s2">mudball!</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.000" end="01:07:05.200" style="s2">Let&#39;s see where you&#39;ll run now!</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.300" end="01:07:06.033" style="s2">We caught you red-handed.</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.166" end="01:07:07.400" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how you talk your way out of this.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.133" end="01:07:10.766" style="s2">We only chased him for a few minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.833" end="01:07:12.233" style="s2">How did he end up looking like this?</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.466" end="01:07:13.066" style="s2">Mr. Webster!</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.400" end="01:07:13.966" style="s2">Stop playing dead!</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.133" end="01:07:14.833" style="s2">Tell the truth!</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.866" end="01:07:15.966" style="s2">Besides planting those syringes,</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.100" end="01:07:17.033" style="s2">did you inject the animals</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.066" end="01:07:18.066" style="s2">with any kind of drugs?</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.166" end="01:07:19.100" style="s2">What syringes?</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.300" end="01:07:20.900" style="s2">I have no idea what you&#39;re talking about!</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.933" end="01:07:22.466" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that just some stunt</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.500" end="01:07:23.266" style="s2">you pulled yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.300" end="01:07:24.100" style="s2">Still trying to deny it?</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.233" end="01:07:26.366" style="s2">I really didn&#39;t plant them!</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.666" end="01:07:29.866" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.300" end="01:07:30.666" style="s2">Wait</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.066" end="01:07:32.866" style="s2">That Two-Legger scent on the syringes</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.000" end="01:07:33.666" style="s2">I smelled it</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.833" end="01:07:36.333" style="s2">It&#39;s completely different from his smell!</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.866" end="01:07:37.466" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.666" end="01:07:38.566" style="s2">So it really wasn&#39;t him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.866" end="01:07:40.066" style="s2">Then who planted the syringes?</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.233" end="01:07:41.666" style="s2">Who is the one that really wants to</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.900" end="01:07:43.066" style="s2">ruin the wildlife park?</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.000" end="01:07:48.533" style="s2">If you didn&#39;t leave the syringe,</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.933" end="01:07:50.000" style="s2">then why were you sneaking around</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.033" end="01:07:51.400" style="s2">my wildlife park in the middle of the night?</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.633" end="01:07:52.400" style="s2">Spit it out!</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.700" end="01:07:53.833" style="s2">I&#39;ll talk! I&#39;ll talk!</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.933" end="01:07:55.700" style="s2">During your last stream, you mentioned that watch,</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.333" end="01:07:57.133" style="s2">which got me fired!</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.833" end="01:07:58.900" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t just swallow my anger.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.600" end="01:08:00.566" style="s2">So I wanted revenge.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.866" end="01:08:01.866" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.866" end="01:08:03.266" style="s2">you came here tonight to hurt my animals?</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.533" end="01:08:03.966" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.300" end="01:08:05.500" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t dare hurt the animals!</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.900" end="01:08:07.333" style="s2">I just wanted to steal a monkey.</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.866" end="01:08:09.466" style="s2">I just wanted to give you guys a headache.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.000" end="01:08:11.466" style="s2">I really don&#39;t know anything about a syringe,</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.800" end="01:08:13.466" style="s2">and I definitely didn&#39;t drug any animals!</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.500" end="01:08:14.300" style="s2">I thought we had</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.333" end="01:08:16.100" style="s2">some evil mastermind on our hands.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.266" end="01:08:17.333" style="s2">But it&#39;s just this?</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.466" end="01:08:18.466" style="s2">Talk about petty.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.633" end="01:08:20.700" style="s2">He&#39;s an embarrassment to Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.566" end="01:08:22.366" style="s2">Oh my goodness.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.466" end="01:08:24.266" style="s2">His big revenge plan is stealing a monkey?</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.433" end="01:08:25.700" style="s2">How pathetic is that?</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.066" end="01:08:30.633" style="s2">So the animals and I spent all day</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.766" end="01:08:31.666" style="s2">on high alert for nothing,</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.933" end="01:08:33.266" style="s2">fighting invisible enemies?</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.500" end="01:08:34.933" style="s2">So the trail is completely dead now?</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.933" end="01:08:36.433" style="s2">What a waste of the fortune I spent</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.466" end="01:08:37.400" style="s2">on this alarm system.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.266" end="01:08:40.866" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.300" end="01:08:42.566" style="s2">Since he didn&#39;t plant the syringe,</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.733" end="01:08:43.500" style="s2">it means the real culprit</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.566" end="01:08:44.500" style="s2">is still hiding in the dark.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.833" end="01:08:45.800" style="s2">For the animals&#39; safety,</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.933" end="01:08:47.833" style="s2">the lockdown investigation can&#39;t wait.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.366" end="01:08:55.466" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper,</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.666" end="01:08:56.333" style="s2">I smell it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.466" end="01:08:57.466" style="s2">Over in those woods,</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.600" end="01:08:59.300" style="s2">there&#39;s a strange Two-Legger scent.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.400" end="01:09:01.366" style="s2">It matches the syringe exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.366" end="01:09:02.300" style="s2">Hey, Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.533" end="01:09:03.833" style="s2">Keep pretending to interrogate him here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.933" end="01:09:04.466" style="s2">Make a big scene.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.933" end="01:09:06.233" style="s2">Ffion and I will go check it out.</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.833" end="01:09:08.466" style="s2">Webster!</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.666" end="01:09:09.633" style="s2">How long have you been planning</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.666" end="01:09:10.533" style="s2">this little monkey heist?</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.633" end="01:09:12.333" style="s2">How big is the sack? Where&#39;s the car?</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.433" end="01:09:13.233" style="s2">Did you buy monkey food?</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.466" end="01:09:14.333" style="s2">Tell me everything!</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.533" end="01:09:17.200" style="s2">The real culprit who left the syringe</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.500" end="01:09:18.466" style="s2">is somewhere close.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.566" end="01:09:19.000" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.166" end="01:09:20.300" style="s2">let&#39;s see where you can hide.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.666" end="01:09:36.566" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.766" end="01:09:37.466" style="s2">I saw him!</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.733" end="01:09:39.266" style="s2">Dressed like a lump of black coal.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.500" end="01:09:40.933" style="s2">Scurried off toward the northeast.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.366" end="01:09:45.900" style="s2">That idiot, Mr. Webster.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.066" end="01:09:47.733" style="s2">With him over there drawing all the attention,</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.900" end="01:09:49.766" style="s2">this frame-up is completely foolproof.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.000" end="01:09:51.800" style="s2">Last time I only dropped a few syringes.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.000" end="01:09:53.900" style="s2">This time, I&#39;ll inject the animals directly</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.966" end="01:09:54.900" style="s2">and make them go crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.100" end="01:09:56.666" style="s2">Once the Landscape Authority shuts it down,</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.900" end="01:09:58.433" style="s2">I&#39;ll take over this wildlife park.</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.466" end="01:10:05.100" style="s2">This guy is really greedy.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.533" end="01:10:07.333" style="s2">He&#39;s going straight for Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.166" end="01:10:21.900" style="s2">Crap.</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.633" end="01:10:23.866" style="s2">Who?</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.200" end="01:10:24.666" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.800" end="01:10:25.566" style="s2">Get out here!</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.700" end="01:10:36.433" style="s2">Damn, just a stupid bird.</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.933" end="01:10:38.100" style="s2">Scaring myself for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.466" end="01:10:39.100" style="s2">Time is tight.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.300" end="01:10:40.366" style="s2">Gotta find Rex quickly.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.500" end="01:10:41.500" style="s2">Before things go wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.633" end="01:10:47.466" style="s2">Thanks, Ffion!</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.466" end="01:11:05.633" style="s2">Where did this punk come from?</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.066" end="01:11:06.900" style="s2">Dare to mess with the king?</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.400" end="01:11:08.133" style="s2">Get out of here!</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.833" end="01:11:14.700" style="s2">Mom!</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.566" end="01:11:24.500" style="s2">What are you waiting for?</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.766" end="01:11:25.300" style="s2">Catch him!</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.633" end="01:11:42.533" style="s2">They&#39;re getting closer.</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.933" end="01:11:43.533" style="s2">What do I do?</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.766" end="01:11:48.033" style="s2">Heaven is on my side!</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.166" end="01:11:56.566" style="s2">Time to use my family&#39;s lock-picking skills.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.666" end="01:11:57.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t fail me now.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.033" end="01:12:02.666" style="s2">I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.900" end="01:12:03.266" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.600" end="01:12:05.266" style="s2">You can go eat my dust!</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.766" end="01:12:09.933" style="s2">Monkey Ridge has a complex terrain.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.966" end="01:12:10.866" style="s2">If I hide inside,</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.200" end="01:12:12.333" style="s2">let&#39;s see how they find me!</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.866" end="01:12:17.233" style="s2">Oh my god!</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.266" end="01:12:18.733" style="s2">Why are all the monkeys here?</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.066" end="01:12:33.200" style="s2">What&#39;s this Two-Legger doing so late?</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.300" end="01:12:34.066" style="s2">Why is he picking the lock?</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.133" end="01:12:34.666" style="s2">Sleepwalking?</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.666" end="01:12:35.533" style="s2">Hey, monkeys!</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.666" end="01:12:36.433" style="s2">This is the Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.533" end="01:12:37.500" style="s2">Causing trouble in the park!</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.566" end="01:12:38.400" style="s2">Stall him right here!</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.566" end="01:12:40.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll go get the Director!</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.466" end="01:12:42.733" style="s2">So it&#39;s you throwing</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.866" end="01:12:44.466" style="s2">Trash all over the park, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.733" end="01:12:46.466" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna teach you a lesson today!</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.633" end="01:12:47.466" style="s2">Little monkeys!</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.666" end="01:12:48.733" style="s2">Surround him!</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.800" end="01:12:52.400" style="s2">Oh, crap!</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.666" end="01:12:54.433" style="s2">They&#39;re not gonna scratch me, are they?</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.633" end="01:13:00.533" style="s2">Mighty monkey bosses</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.833" end="01:13:01.700" style="s2">Let&#39;s not be hasty.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.266" end="01:13:02.766" style="s2">I have food.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.333" end="01:13:04.200" style="s2">You can have it all!</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.133" end="01:13:16.066" style="s2">Get him!</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.433" end="01:13:18.400" style="s2">Coat first, then the pants!</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.633" end="01:13:20.933" style="s2">Make him run away bare-bottomed!</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.233" end="01:13:22.400" style="s2">This coat is really nice!</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.566" end="01:13:24.500" style="s2">Pull hard so we can use it as a blanket!</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.666" end="01:13:28.700" style="s2">Stop grabbing!</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.033" end="01:13:29.700" style="s2">My clothes!</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.200" end="01:13:31.100" style="s2">Get off me!</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.066" end="01:13:34.333" style="s2">Make way, make way!</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.433" end="01:13:36.066" style="s2">Let me test the Two-Legger&#39;s tickle spots!</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.500" end="01:13:39.300" style="s2">Stop tickling!</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.466" end="01:13:40.566" style="s2">Please, let me go!</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.966" end="01:13:41.900" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry!</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.200" end="01:13:45.933" style="s2">Hurry up!</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.000" end="01:13:47.100" style="s2">Let&#39;s move faster, guys!</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.233" end="01:13:49.033" style="s2">The fun ends when the Director gets here!</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.166" end="01:13:57.566" style="s2">Look at my prize!</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.833" end="01:13:59.333" style="s2">These pants are pretty sturdy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.533" end="01:14:00.566" style="s2">They make a great swing!</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.666" end="01:14:03.200" style="s2">You guys</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.433" end="01:14:04.333" style="s2">You&#39;re bullying me!</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.700" end="01:14:05.400" style="s2">These aren&#39;t monkeys.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.500" end="01:14:06.800" style="s2">They&#39;re just a bunch of bandits!</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.733" end="01:14:08.233" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.300" end="01:14:10.533" style="s2">Come get your monkeys!</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.766" end="01:14:12.433" style="s2">I&#39;ll stop running, alright?</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.000" end="01:14:13.333" style="s2">Heh.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.566" end="01:14:15.000" style="s2">You can&#39;t even take this.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.133" end="01:14:17.433" style="s2">And you dared to cause trouble in my park?</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.566" end="01:14:19.633" style="s2">I can&#39;t even be bothered to hit you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.266" end="01:14:29.866" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.233" end="01:14:30.900" style="s2">Rupert!</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.200" end="01:14:32.233" style="s2">You&#39;re finally here!</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.566" end="01:14:34.100" style="s2">Get me out of here, please!</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.566" end="01:14:36.433" style="s2">He&#39;s not hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.300" end="01:14:46.500" style="s2">W-what is going on?</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.833" end="01:14:48.200" style="s2">Why did you strip him like this?</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.600" end="01:14:50.100" style="s2">Corbin.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.433" end="01:14:52.166" style="s2">You actually wear pink heart boxers?</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.300" end="01:14:53.333" style="s2">Interesting taste!</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.466" end="01:14:54.200" style="s2">Stop looking!</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.300" end="01:14:55.766" style="s2">Get that flashlight out of my face!</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.366" end="01:15:00.866" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.933" end="01:15:02.000" style="s2">Let him go, guys.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.033" end="01:15:02.666" style="s2">Let him out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.933" end="01:15:11.700" style="s2">Misunderstanding!</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.766" end="01:15:12.633" style="s2">It&#39;s a misunderstanding!</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.933" end="01:15:13.866" style="s2">I-I was sleepwalking!</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.066" end="01:15:15.066" style="s2">I wandered into Monkey Ridge.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.066" end="01:15:15.800" style="s2">Sleepwalking?</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.366" end="01:15:17.166" style="s2">If you were sleepwalking,</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.266" end="01:15:18.500" style="s2">then I&#39;m Emperor Augustus.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.400" end="01:15:20.500" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do a thing!</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.700" end="01:15:21.766" style="s2">Why are you grabbing me?</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.100" end="01:15:29.900" style="s2">Oh my gosh!</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.066" end="01:15:30.766" style="s2">This piece of coal</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.866" end="01:15:32.000" style="s2">hid something in his sock!</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.133" end="01:15:33.833" style="s2">The smell makes me dizzy!</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.533" end="01:15:41.200" style="s2">Mr. Shaw,</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.066" end="01:15:43.333" style="s2">even my bird has caught onto</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.366" end="01:15:44.066" style="s2">your little trick.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.933" end="01:15:49.266" style="s2">T-this isn&#39;t mine!</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.700" end="01:15:51.433" style="s2">This stupid bird planted it to frame me!</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.433" end="01:15:52.100" style="s2">Oh, please.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.333" end="01:15:53.633" style="s2">You shameless Two-Legger,</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.766" end="01:15:54.600" style="s2">blaming that dumb bird?</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.766" end="01:15:55.866" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna slap you!</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.966" end="01:16:02.166" style="s2">This syringe is identical</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.200" end="01:16:03.533" style="s2">to the one found in Tiger Territory.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.700" end="01:16:04.400" style="s2">Bag the evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.700" end="01:16:05.533" style="s2">Take him away.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.700" end="01:16:13.266" style="s2">Galen, you just wait!</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.933" end="01:16:15.066" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back!</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.166" end="01:16:22.766" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.000" end="01:16:23.966" style="s2">Since the matter is settled,</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.000" end="01:16:24.933" style="s2">we&#39;re officially withdrawing</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.966" end="01:16:26.866" style="s2">the closure order for Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.966" end="01:16:29.700" style="s2">Thank you, sir!</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.100" end="01:16:35.166" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.433" end="01:16:37.066" style="s2">I did a great job again this time.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.166" end="01:16:38.766" style="s2">Where are the fat bugs you promised me?</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.766" end="01:16:39.700" style="s2">I haven&#39;t forgotten about you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.833" end="01:16:41.366" style="s2">Premium mealworms, all you can eat.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.600" end="01:16:42.066" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.200" end="01:16:43.300" style="s2">Since everything is resolved,</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.433" end="01:16:43.900" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t we</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.933" end="01:16:45.466" style="s2">celebrate with the animals today?</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.500" end="01:16:46.266" style="s2">Yes, Maggie.</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.333" end="01:16:47.333" style="s2">Go to the storeroom and bring out</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.433" end="01:16:48.233" style="s2">the best beef and fruit.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.333" end="01:16:49.733" style="s2">Okay, I&#39;ll go get it ready.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.366" end="01:16:56.866" style="s2">Eat some more, darling.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.966" end="01:16:58.600" style="s2">You&#39;ve gotten so thin lately.</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.766" end="01:17:01.133" style="s2">You were so brave last night.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.266" end="01:17:02.466" style="s2">I knew I picked the right guy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.933" end="01:17:04.133" style="s2">That&#39;s enough, you two.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.266" end="01:17:05.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget I can understand you!</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.833" end="01:17:06.800" style="s2">Single Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.000" end="01:17:08.133" style="s2">You&#39;re just jealous of me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.300" end="01:17:13.900" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.366" end="01:17:15.633" style="s2">Great news!</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.100" end="01:17:17.766" style="s2">What great news?</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.300" end="01:17:19.300" style="s2">You&#39;re so happy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.166" end="01:17:21.733" style="s2">To make up for</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.733" end="01:17:23.333" style="s2">not trusting you before, my dad</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.366" end="01:17:24.733" style="s2">decided to resume the investment!</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.400" end="01:17:26.166" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.400" end="01:17:28.166" style="s2">The total investment was bumped up to</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.200" end="01:17:29.200" style="s2">eight million dollars!</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.600" end="01:17:31.800" style="s2">E-Eight million dollars?</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.000" end="01:17:32.700" style="s2">Yep!</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.100" end="01:17:36.100" style="s2">The duck flew away,</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.500" end="01:17:38.400" style="s2">and now it came back as a roast duck!</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.100" end="01:17:50.966" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.800" end="01:17:53.033" style="s2">This recent crisis</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.366" end="01:17:54.633" style="s2">You handled it very well.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.266" end="01:17:56.500" style="s2">Thank you, Chairman Ellison.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.166" end="01:17:57.633" style="s2">Dad!</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.766" end="01:17:58.300" style="s2">What about me?</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.400" end="01:17:59.333" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t brought my guys</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.366" end="01:18:00.400" style="s2">to Tiger Territory in time,</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.733" end="01:18:01.933" style="s2">Corbin Shaw would&#39;ve escaped.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.666" end="01:18:05.666" style="s2">You?</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.733" end="01:18:06.833" style="s2">You staying out of the way</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.033" end="01:18:08.766" style="s2">is already a blessing.</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.533" end="01:18:12.066" style="s2">Chairman.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.100" end="01:18:12.700" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.800" end="01:18:13.533" style="s2">The contract is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.700" end="01:18:14.566" style="s2">Ready to be signed.</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.866" end="01:18:24.466" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.566" end="01:18:25.533" style="s2">Finance has been notified</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.566" end="01:18:27.066" style="s2">to transfer the $8 million.</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.133" end="01:18:28.600" style="s2">The transfer receipt just came through.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.633" end="01:18:29.933" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, it&#39;s in!</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.000" end="01:18:31.466" style="s2">$8 million, on the dot.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.133" end="01:18:35.866" style="s2">Well, well, well.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.100" end="01:18:37.633" style="s2">You little greenhorn.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.700" end="01:18:40.300" style="s2">Get me some of your finest fruits.</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.500" end="01:18:41.233" style="s2">And if possible,</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.466" end="01:18:43.933" style="s2">find me a buddy to hang out with.</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.533" end="01:18:46.900" style="s2">True.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.366" end="01:18:48.333" style="s2">It&#39;s about time we brought</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.333" end="01:18:49.533" style="s2">some fresh blood to the park.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.566" end="01:18:50.233" style="s2">Chairman Ellison.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.266" end="01:18:51.266" style="s2">Bronte wants a new playmate.</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.400" end="01:18:52.600" style="s2">I want to follow quarantine protocols</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.666" end="01:18:53.600" style="s2">and partner with a certified</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.666" end="01:18:54.666" style="s2">overseas conservation group</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.733" end="01:18:56.400" style="s2">to bring in a social monkey species.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.433" end="01:18:56.900" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.933" end="01:18:57.600" style="s2">Interesting.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.100" end="01:18:59.566" style="s2">It actually wants a playmate?</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.333" end="01:19:01.733" style="s2">Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.533" end="01:19:03.900" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you want to prove yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.333" end="01:19:05.866" style="s2">I&#39;m putting you in charge of this.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.933" end="01:19:09.333" style="s2">Dad!</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.533" end="01:19:10.000" style="s2">Leave it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.166" end="01:19:11.500" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to worry at all.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.066" end="01:19:14.666" style="s2">Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.766" end="01:19:16.100" style="s2">We&#39;re counting on you this time.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.100" end="01:19:17.400" style="s2">Let&#39;s get one thing straight.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.633" end="01:19:19.333" style="s2">Find me someone I can actually talk to.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.466" end="01:19:21.233" style="s2">Don&#39;t bring back some diva I have to serve.</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.466" end="01:19:22.566" style="s2">Quite demanding, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.566" end="01:19:23.933" style="s2">Maggie, prep the pavilion plans.</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.066" end="01:19:25.766" style="s2">Mr. Shaw, help us with the protocols.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.866" end="01:19:27.333" style="s2">Rupert, you&#39;re in charge of picking.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.466" end="01:19:28.500" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.533" end="01:19:29.333" style="s2">is getting a new member!</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.666" end="01:19:35.166" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.633" end="01:19:36.033" style="s2">I hired</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.266" end="01:19:37.666" style="s2">a top international transport agency</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.066" end="01:19:39.066" style="s2">to bring the new species over.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.133" end="01:19:40.233" style="s2">It&#39;s almost at the gate!</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.733" end="01:19:42.033" style="s2">What species did you get?</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.200" end="01:19:43.733" style="s2">Making me wait at the exhibit so early.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.066" end="01:19:45.033" style="s2">You&#39;ll see in a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.100" end="01:19:46.500" style="s2">It&#39;ll absolutely blow your mind.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.433" end="01:19:55.166" style="s2">Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.333" end="01:19:56.933" style="s2">Is this the new monkey species you meant?</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.033" end="01:19:58.166" style="s2">You call this thing a monkey?</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.200" end="01:19:58.666" style="s2">Yeah!</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.733" end="01:19:59.466" style="s2">Look at those pecs.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.600" end="01:20:00.166" style="s2">And that build.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.400" end="01:20:01.533" style="s2">Isn&#39;t he awesome?</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.433" end="01:20:07.366" style="s2">Sawadee kha.</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.766" end="01:20:08.800" style="s2">Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.966" end="01:20:10.933" style="s2">So this is my new home, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.233" end="01:20:12.600" style="s2">Bro.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.233" end="01:20:14.500" style="s2">Do you know what he just said?</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.433" end="01:20:18.666" style="s2">Ugh, what&#39;s that smell in the air?</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.933" end="01:20:19.400" style="s2">He said</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.766" end="01:20:22.166" style="s2">The smell of this zoo is killing him.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.500" end="01:20:24.233" style="s2">There&#39;s no mistake!</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.433" end="01:20:25.433" style="s2">Where is my badass chimp?</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.566" end="01:20:26.700" style="s2">How did I end up with a sissy?</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.866" end="01:20:27.800" style="s2">And with a Thai accent!</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.833" end="01:20:31.133" style="s2">I hate this!</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.233" end="01:20:33.800" style="s2">I have a tender heart beneath this tough exterior!</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.100" end="01:20:34.833" style="s2">He also says</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.966" end="01:20:37.033" style="s2">He has a tender heart beneath his tough exterior.</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.166" end="01:20:38.933" style="s2">I can&#39;t take this.</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.700" end="01:20:40.600" style="s2">This is too much information.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.033" end="01:20:41.800" style="s2">I need to go calm down.</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.700" end="01:20:44.666" style="s2">Ah, whatever.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.866" end="01:20:45.933" style="s2">We&#39;ll just have to make the best of it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.166" end="01:20:46.766" style="s2">Please put him in</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.833" end="01:20:48.766" style="s2">the new exhibit area next to Monkey Ridge.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.700" end="01:20:58.833" style="s2">You clueless brat!</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.900" end="01:21:00.000" style="s2">I asked for a sweet and gentle</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.033" end="01:21:00.700" style="s2">pretty female monkey!</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.800" end="01:21:01.733" style="s2">What the heck is this thing?!</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.766" end="01:21:02.833" style="s2">I&#39;ll smack you silly today!</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.866" end="01:21:04.000" style="s2">Don&#39;t be so mean, oldie!</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.100" end="01:21:05.300" style="s2">I&#39;m the very definition of gentle.</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.500" end="01:21:06.700" style="s2">You should treat me with care!</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.733" end="01:21:08.333" style="s2">Ugh, you clueless fool!</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.533" end="01:21:10.033" style="s2">I&#39;ll settle the score with you later!</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.200" end="01:21:10.766" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.966" end="01:21:12.566" style="s2">I want a Barbie-pink straw mat</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.633" end="01:21:13.766" style="s2">and a full-length mirror!</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.833" end="01:21:14.866" style="s2">Maggie, go buy them.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.900" end="01:21:16.366" style="s2">A Barbie-pink straw mat and a big mirror.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.366" end="01:21:16.833" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.266" end="01:21:17.566" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.566" end="01:21:19.066" style="s2">Is this really what Jethro asked for?</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.233" end="01:21:27.400" style="s2">I must be losing my mind.</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.966" end="01:21:28.333" style="s2">Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.033" end="01:21:29.566" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.700" end="01:21:30.700" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry!</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.000" end="01:21:32.666" style="s2">Not necessarily.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.800" end="01:21:39.133" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.400" end="01:21:40.700" style="s2">Is this the travel streamer, Avalon?</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.833" end="01:21:41.766" style="s2">Our park just brought in</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.833" end="01:21:42.700" style="s2">Jethro, the gorilla.</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.733" end="01:21:43.533" style="s2">Are you free to bring your fans</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.600" end="01:21:44.400" style="s2">over for a look tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.566" end="01:21:44.833" style="s2">Great.</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.900" end="01:21:46.400" style="s2">It&#39;s a deal then.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.166" end="01:21:47.533" style="s2">Hold on.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.666" end="01:21:48.866" style="s2">Galen, are you out of your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.000" end="01:21:49.700" style="s2">That total diva?</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.966" end="01:21:51.133" style="s2">You want a streamer to promote him?</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.300" end="01:21:52.900" style="s2">Rupert.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.200" end="01:21:54.100" style="s2">Just wait and see.</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.833" end="01:21:56.433" style="s2">Hey fam!</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.466" end="01:21:58.300" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park has a new arrival!</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.433" end="01:21:59.466" style="s2">Hurry up and drop your hype</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.500" end="01:22:00.266" style="s2">in the chat!</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.200" end="01:22:02.866" style="s2">Attention, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.933" end="01:22:04.000" style="s2">This is our new arrival,</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.366" end="01:22:05.066" style="s2">Jethro!</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.166" end="01:22:05.733" style="s2">Oh my!</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.933" end="01:22:07.333" style="s2">So many cameras looking at me!</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.600" end="01:22:07.833" style="s2">Quick,</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.000" end="01:22:08.933" style="s2">get my left side.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.233" end="01:22:10.733" style="s2">It looks way better than my right!</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.866" end="01:22:11.633" style="s2">Oh, please.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.933" end="01:22:13.166" style="s2">What an absolute embarrassment.</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.500" end="01:22:14.900" style="s2">I really wanna smack him right now.</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.900" end="01:22:16.433" style="s2">The gorilla is even making a peace sign!</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.466" end="01:22:19.200" style="s2">It has to be a female, right?</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.200" end="01:22:20.033" style="s2">So vain.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.466" end="01:22:22.566" style="s2">This is a male.</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.333" end="01:22:24.066" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.633" end="01:22:25.733" style="s2">The gorilla is saying</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.833" end="01:22:27.366" style="s2">you should all get his left side.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.366" end="01:22:28.300" style="s2">It&#39;s his best side.</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.866" end="01:22:39.333" style="s2">Is that Rex next door?</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.633" end="01:22:41.033" style="s2">He&#39;s so macho!</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.200" end="01:22:43.633" style="s2">Dude,</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.566" end="01:22:45.266" style="s2">don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.666" end="01:22:47.166" style="s2">you&#39;ve got a crush on Rex?</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.266" end="01:22:54.200" style="s2">What the heck.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.600" end="01:22:55.833" style="s2">Never seen that before.</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.566" end="01:22:58.400" style="s2">So gross.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.233" end="01:23:04.100" style="s2">Two-Legger,</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.566" end="01:23:05.066" style="s2">listen up.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.366" end="01:23:07.233" style="s2">Get this floral-shirt monster</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.266" end="01:23:08.300" style="s2">out of my sight!</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.900" end="01:23:10.866" style="s2">Oh, wow.</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.233" end="01:23:12.833" style="s2">He&#39;s exactly the kind of</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.933" end="01:23:14.600" style="s2">mighty hero of my dreams.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.066" end="01:23:17.600" style="s2">I have completely fallen for him.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.500" end="01:23:20.800" style="s2">Director, translate for us!</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.933" end="01:23:22.233" style="s2">They were roaring at each other just now.</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.300" end="01:23:23.200" style="s2">What were they talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.900" end="01:23:24.900" style="s2">Settle down, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.900" end="01:23:25.700" style="s2">Our Rex just said</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.166" end="01:23:27.500" style="s2">that the new neighbor is quite handsome.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.733" end="01:23:29.200" style="s2">And Jethro here enthusiastically replied</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.900" end="01:23:31.066" style="s2">that he hopes he and Rex</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.133" end="01:23:32.833" style="s2">can become a loving family.</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.033" end="01:23:43.800" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.300" end="01:23:45.966" style="s2">Believe it or not, I will toss you</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.966" end="01:23:46.766" style="s2">right into the gutter!</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.233" end="01:23:48.733" style="s2">Rex,</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.066" end="01:23:49.500" style="s2">calm down.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.233" end="01:23:51.000" style="s2">Please, calm down.</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.633" end="01:23:52.333" style="s2">I&#39;m just doing this for</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.366" end="01:23:53.333" style="s2">your premium imported beef!</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.633" end="01:23:58.966" style="s2">Oh, Rex!</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.166" end="01:24:00.266" style="s2">See you next time.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.433" end="01:24:02.666" style="s2">I&#39;ll be waiting for you in my dreams tonight!</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.766" end="01:24:03.400" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.566" end="01:24:04.700" style="s2">Jethro&#39;s gesture just now</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.700" end="01:24:06.100" style="s2">I don&#39;t think you need to translate it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.166" end="01:24:07.266" style="s2">We all understood that one.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.800" end="01:24:09.366" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.466" end="01:24:10.666" style="s2">This promotion was a massive success!</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.733" end="01:24:11.900" style="s2">The stream&#39;s popularity shot up to</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.933" end="01:24:13.133" style="s2">top three on the entire network!</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.200" end="01:24:14.533" style="s2">We&#39;ll definitely have huge crowds tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.533" end="01:24:15.100" style="s2">Thank you so much!</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.366" end="01:24:21.800" style="s2">Jethro.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.266" end="01:24:23.166" style="s2">You did great today.</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.866" end="01:24:24.800" style="s2">If you can keep it up</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.800" end="01:24:25.300" style="s2">tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.533" end="01:24:26.700" style="s2">you&#39;ll eat all you want every day.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.300" end="01:24:34.133" style="s2">Pfft.</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.366" end="01:24:34.966" style="s2">Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.166" end="01:24:36.833" style="s2">That&#39;s just my basic routine.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.300" end="01:24:38.333" style="s2">But if you can get Rex</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.400" end="01:24:39.566" style="s2">to talk to me tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.266" end="01:24:41.133" style="s2">I might just show you</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.166" end="01:24:42.366" style="s2">some even better tricks.</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.566" end="01:24:43.700" style="s2">He&#39;d better not fall into my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.000" end="01:24:45.100" style="s2">Or I&#39;ll smack the life out of him.</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.133" end="01:24:46.766" style="s2">It&#39;s over. It&#39;s totally over.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.966" end="01:24:48.400" style="s2">Please just blind me for three days.</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.700" end="01:24:52.300" style="s2">Hold on, bro.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.466" end="01:24:52.833" style="s2">Calm down.</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.533" end="01:24:54.233" style="s2">You&#39;re a male.</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.366" end="01:24:55.266" style="s2">Rex is a male, too.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.600" end="01:24:56.366" style="s2">You two aren&#39;t a match.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.500" end="01:24:57.400" style="s2">You can&#39;t be having these dangerous</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.566" end="01:24:58.066" style="s2">thoughts.</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.633" end="01:24:59.600" style="s2">Oh, stop it!</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.666" end="01:25:00.666" style="s2">What kind of dirty things</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.700" end="01:25:01.533" style="s2">are you thinking about?</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.733" end="01:25:02.800" style="s2">I just simply admire</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.833" end="01:25:04.200" style="s2">Rex&#39;s masculinity.</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.566" end="01:25:05.500" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.633" end="01:25:06.400" style="s2">I have a dirty mind.</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.600" end="01:25:07.000" style="s2">I promise you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.433" end="01:25:08.500" style="s2">I&#39;ll go find Rex right now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.833" end="01:25:09.800" style="s2">Hey, Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.000" end="01:25:11.000" style="s2">Come get some beef.</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.033" end="01:25:15.766" style="s2">A weasel bearing gifts</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.133" end="01:25:17.333" style="s2">You&#39;re up to no good.</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.733" end="01:25:19.800" style="s2">You&#39;re sharp, Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.266" end="01:25:21.166" style="s2">Jethro next door</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.433" end="01:25:21.866" style="s2">wants you to</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.900" end="01:25:23.266" style="s2">say hi to him tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.100" end="01:25:30.966" style="s2">The King talking to that sissy?</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.200" end="01:25:32.866" style="s2">You must be out of your mind.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.100" end="01:25:35.666" style="s2">Rex,</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.866" end="01:25:36.766" style="s2">think of the big picture.</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.266" end="01:25:38.700" style="s2">Just say hello, that&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.433" end="01:25:39.833" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.600" end="01:25:41.400" style="s2">But if he dares to</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.433" end="01:25:42.200" style="s2">act up in front of me,</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.366" end="01:25:43.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll take one swipe</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.233" end="01:25:44.166" style="s2">and send him flying.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.366" end="01:25:46.333" style="s2">Everything is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.600" end="01:25:47.833" style="s2">Now we wait for tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.500" end="01:25:57.666" style="s2">I watched the stream yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.866" end="01:25:58.300" style="s2">This gorilla</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.366" end="01:25:59.466" style="s2">is such a macho softie.</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.933" end="01:26:00.466" style="s2">You mean</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.966" end="01:26:02.500" style="s2">Brutus in a pink dress?</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.900" end="01:26:07.800" style="s2">Hello everyone,</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.900" end="01:26:09.500" style="s2">welcome to Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.633" end="01:26:11.000" style="s2">to see our gorilla.</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.233" end="01:26:15.600" style="s2">Will he do the peace sign again today?</p>
<p begin="01:26:20.266" end="01:26:20.766" style="s2">Oh my god!</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.100" end="01:26:21.700" style="s2">Everyone, look!</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.933" end="01:26:22.500" style="s2">This gorilla</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.766" end="01:26:24.166" style="s2">Is he secretly human or what?</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.033" end="01:26:36.366" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.200" end="01:26:38.733" style="s2">Is this the same gorilla?</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.666" end="01:26:41.366" style="s2">Keeper.</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.733" end="01:26:43.833" style="s2">Here&#39;s the trick I promised.</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.700" end="01:26:50.966" style="s2">He</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.366" end="01:26:52.700" style="s2">He knows how to hula!</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.966" end="01:26:56.400" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.666" end="01:26:57.533" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.233" end="01:26:59.533" style="s2">Isn&#39;t my hula dance</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.666" end="01:27:01.033" style="s2">just mesmerizing?</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.600" end="01:27:02.566" style="s2">Tonight&#39;s bananas</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.033" end="01:27:04.700" style="s2">You&#39;d better double them!</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.833" end="01:27:06.733" style="s2">Are you sure there&#39;s no extra charge for this?</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.033" end="01:27:08.833" style="s2">This is amazing, haha!</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.200" end="01:27:11.100" style="s2">This trick</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.533" end="01:27:12.533" style="s2">is insane!</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.066" end="01:27:23.866" style="s2">Don&#39;t just stand there.</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.133" end="01:27:24.800" style="s2">Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.000" end="01:27:26.133" style="s2">Where&#39;s the applause?</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.466" end="01:27:29.433" style="s2">Our Jethro is asking,</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.600" end="01:27:30.600" style="s2">where is the applause?</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.300" end="01:27:34.933" style="s2">This gorilla dances better than me!</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.133" end="01:27:35.833" style="s2">I&#39;d like to call him,</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.033" end="01:27:37.100" style="s2">a flexible fatty.</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.000" end="01:27:40.733" style="s2">Cheers!</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.900" end="01:27:42.166" style="s2">Don&#39;t stop the applause.</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.333" end="01:27:43.633" style="s2">If there&#39;s some upbeat music,</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.866" end="01:27:45.066" style="s2">it&#39;d be even better.</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.366" end="01:27:50.800" style="s2">Oh my goodness.</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.100" end="01:27:51.966" style="s2">Monkey Clan!</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.133" end="01:27:53.633" style="s2">Let&#39;s show &#39;em what we got!</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.833" end="01:27:55.366" style="s2">Let&#39;s make some beats for him!</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.533" end="01:27:57.433" style="s2">Boom, tsh, boom, tsh!</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.533" end="01:27:58.433" style="s2">Here we go!</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.133" end="01:28:17.100" style="s2">Oh yeah!</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.400" end="01:28:19.000" style="s2">Let&#39;s get moving!</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.966" end="01:28:30.433" style="s2">Oh my god!</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.600" end="01:28:31.766" style="s2">The monkeys are beatboxing for him!</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.866" end="01:28:32.533" style="s2">They&#39;re having a dance-off!</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.766" end="01:28:33.733" style="s2">This is mind-blowing!</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.666" end="01:28:36.966" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.133" end="01:28:38.300" style="s2">How do we book tickets for tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.333" end="01:28:39.300" style="s2">We wanna bring our friends to see this.</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.500" end="01:28:40.500" style="s2">Yeah, exactly!</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.800" end="01:28:41.766" style="s2">Oh, come on!</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.133" end="01:28:43.200" style="s2">Stealing my thunder?</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.366" end="01:28:44.066" style="s2">Are they kidding me?</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.366" end="01:28:45.666" style="s2">I&#39;ll win them back!</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.800" end="01:28:55.266" style="s2">Look at you Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.566" end="01:28:56.433" style="s2">Take a good look at</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.500" end="01:28:57.900" style="s2">my majestic beauty today.</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.366" end="01:28:59.833" style="s2">Keep your eyes glued to me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.033" end="01:29:01.533" style="s2">Nobody is allowed to look away!</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.466" end="01:29:04.266" style="s2">Look at Rex!</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.400" end="01:29:05.900" style="s2">He&#39;s actually wearing a suit today!</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.233" end="01:29:06.900" style="s2">Oh my gosh!</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.200" end="01:29:08.466" style="s2">Look at that intense gaze!</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.633" end="01:29:09.866" style="s2">And those beefy pecs!</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.133" end="01:29:10.600" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.733" end="01:29:11.866" style="s2">Please translate it for us!</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.633" end="01:29:16.233" style="s2">Our Rex just said</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.300" end="01:29:17.400" style="s2">that your eyes</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.533" end="01:29:19.133" style="s2">must remain only on him.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.133" end="01:29:22.900" style="s2">Be honest.</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.100" end="01:29:24.400" style="s2">You guys are already completely</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.500" end="01:29:25.733" style="s2">head over heels for me!</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.533" end="01:29:34.866" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.033" end="01:29:36.533" style="s2">Why did Rex suddenly freeze?</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.733" end="01:29:38.466" style="s2">Yeah, it must be part of the act.</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.700" end="01:29:45.233" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.700" end="01:29:46.800" style="s2">Rex, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.033" end="01:29:48.366" style="s2">I know you look cool like this,</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.766" end="01:29:48.866" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.900" end="01:29:50.266" style="s2">maybe move a little?</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.200" end="01:29:54.266" style="s2">My royal back</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.866" end="01:29:56.766" style="s2">why is it giving out on me now?</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.266" end="01:29:59.233" style="s2">Oh, crap!</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.666" end="01:30:00.033" style="s2">Back,</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.266" end="01:30:01.366" style="s2">I command you,</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.400" end="01:30:01.933" style="s2">right now,</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.066" end="01:30:02.566" style="s2">this instant,</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.800" end="01:30:03.933" style="s2">straighten up for me immediately!</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.466" end="01:30:05.133" style="s2">Rex,</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.266" end="01:30:07.100" style="s2">is this really the time to play the alpha boss?</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.233" end="01:30:16.800" style="s2">Haha</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.400" end="01:30:18.166" style="s2">Don&#39;t panic, everyone!</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.266" end="01:30:19.966" style="s2">Our boy Rex just threw his back out.</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.300" end="01:30:20.633" style="s2">Maggie!</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.800" end="01:30:22.433" style="s2">Quick, go get Dr. Armstrong!</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.233" end="01:30:29.133" style="s2">Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.433" end="01:30:31.500" style="s2">Why are you moving as slow as snails?</p>
<p begin="01:30:31.633" end="01:30:33.733" style="s2">If my back actually gets seriously messed up</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.866" end="01:30:35.566" style="s2">I&#39;ll make every single one of you pay.</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.900" end="01:30:45.900" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.200" end="01:30:47.466" style="s2">This tiger is too agitated!</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.633" end="01:30:48.933" style="s2">We have to sedate him!</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.600" end="01:30:57.400" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.466" end="01:30:58.500" style="s2">Do you have a death wish?!</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.800" end="01:30:59.500" style="s2">Get out of there!</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.733" end="01:31:01.700" style="s2">That&#39;s a man-eating beast!</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.733" end="01:31:09.333" style="s2">Rex,</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.700" end="01:31:10.966" style="s2">could you calm down a bit?</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.300" end="01:31:13.166" style="s2">Otherwise the vet can&#39;t treat you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.733" end="01:31:14.500" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.800" end="01:31:17.666" style="s2">I&#39;ll play along with you this once.</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.033" end="01:31:18.733" style="s2">Oh, damn!</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.800" end="01:31:20.233" style="s2">He actually calmed him down.</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.233" end="01:31:21.133" style="s2">Dr. Armstrong,</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.233" end="01:31:22.133" style="s2">come on in.</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.166" end="01:31:23.333" style="s2">Oh, geez.</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.600" end="01:31:25.500" style="s2">Look at this clueless guy.</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.400" end="01:31:27.266" style="s2">No reaction.</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.700" end="01:31:28.233" style="s2">Rex,</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.466" end="01:31:29.366" style="s2">tell me the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.900" end="01:31:30.400" style="s2">Your back,</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.966" end="01:31:31.833" style="s2">are you faking it?</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.500" end="01:31:38.833" style="s2">Oh, crap.</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.966" end="01:31:40.133" style="s2">You figured it out.</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.600" end="01:31:43.866" style="s2">Very funny, Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.466" end="01:31:46.100" style="s2">I was saying you&#39;ve got thick skin.</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.300" end="01:31:48.200" style="s2">How could you throw out your back just by posing?</p>
<p begin="01:31:48.566" end="01:31:50.433" style="s2">This king is just using his brain.</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.633" end="01:31:51.833" style="s2">It&#39;s all that sissy&#39;s fault.</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.700" end="01:31:53.700" style="s2">Taking away the attention</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.700" end="01:31:55.100" style="s2">that rightfully belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.800" end="01:32:02.500" style="s2">Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.766" end="01:32:03.800" style="s2">You can stop pretending now.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.233" end="01:32:04.833" style="s2">I promise you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.933" end="01:32:06.366" style="s2">Tomorrow&#39;s park promotional poster</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.400" end="01:32:07.600" style="s2">will feature you front and center.</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.700" end="01:32:08.066" style="s2">Deal?</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.966" end="01:32:14.666" style="s2">Now that sounds more like it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.833" end="01:32:16.200" style="s2">You can take that cowardly</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.266" end="01:32:17.400" style="s2">Two-Legger and scram.</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.566" end="01:32:19.666" style="s2">This king has to go back to radiating charm.</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.600" end="01:32:24.433" style="s2">Dr. Armstrong.</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.533" end="01:32:25.433" style="s2">The tiger&#39;s fine now.</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.466" end="01:32:26.166" style="s2">You can head back.</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.833" end="01:32:27.533" style="s2">The tiger</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.766" end="01:32:28.700" style="s2">Is really okay?</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.866" end="01:32:29.200" style="s2">Really.</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.333" end="01:32:30.966" style="s2">Sorry for making you come all the way out here.</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.133" end="01:32:33.500" style="s2">He seemed in terrible shape just a minute ago.</p>
<p begin="01:32:33.966" end="01:32:34.966" style="s2">So weird.</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.833" end="01:32:44.633" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.666" end="01:32:45.300" style="s2">It&#39;s bad!</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.433" end="01:32:46.900" style="s2">Jethro&#39;s lying on the ground, not moving!</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.900" end="01:32:48.966" style="s2">What? What&#39;s wrong with him now?</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.300" end="01:32:50.900" style="s2">He&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.166" end="01:32:52.366" style="s2">learning from you, is he?</p>
<p begin="01:32:53.200" end="01:32:55.200" style="s2">Comparing this king to that sissy</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.400" end="01:32:57.700" style="s2">Your brain must be broken, Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.566" end="01:33:00.000" style="s2">No time to bicker with you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.933" end="01:33:02.433" style="s2">Nancy,</p>
<p begin="01:33:02.566" end="01:33:03.466" style="s2">let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.833" end="01:33:21.366" style="s2">Why is Jethro acting like this?</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.600" end="01:33:22.833" style="s2">Is he sick?</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.433" end="01:33:27.033" style="s2">Jethro.</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.500" end="01:33:28.200" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.066" end="01:33:31.933" style="s2">Director.</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.166" end="01:33:35.433" style="s2">I&#39;m just really missing my homeland today.</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.800" end="01:33:37.433" style="s2">You grew up right here in the park.</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.433" end="01:33:38.300" style="s2">What homeland?</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.533" end="01:33:39.333" style="s2">What do you really want?</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.866" end="01:33:42.333" style="s2">I wanna hear some authentic</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.533" end="01:33:45.233" style="s2">live heavy metal drumbeats from Duskhaven.</p>
<p begin="01:33:45.733" end="01:33:46.933" style="s2">Without those sick beats,</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.200" end="01:33:49.233" style="s2">I just can&#39;t bring myself to move.</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.800" end="01:33:50.733" style="s2">Where am I supposed to find</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.733" end="01:33:52.333" style="s2">a live heavy metal band?</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.033" end="01:33:59.233" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.433" end="01:34:00.533" style="s2">I&#39;ve got an idea!</p>
<p begin="01:34:00.900" end="01:34:03.100" style="s2">We can get a few empty iron barrels!</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.400" end="01:34:05.300" style="s2">They&#39;ll sound real loud if we hit them!</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.500" end="01:34:09.466" style="s2">Hehehe.</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.666" end="01:34:10.733" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.866" end="01:34:12.266" style="s2">Banging on iron barrels,</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.500" end="01:34:13.900" style="s2">just leave it to us!</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.400" end="01:34:15.933" style="s2">Ffion!</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.100" end="01:34:16.500" style="s2">Bronte!</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.800" end="01:34:17.300" style="s2">Good job.</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.966" end="01:34:18.266" style="s2">Maggie,</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.500" end="01:34:19.533" style="s2">get someone to Monkey Ridge</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.633" end="01:34:21.033" style="s2">and put some empty iron barrels there.</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.133" end="01:34:21.866" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.633" end="01:34:24.833" style="s2">Everyone, please stay calm.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.000" end="01:34:26.500" style="s2">Jethro will be fine in a moment.</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.233" end="01:34:38.266" style="s2">Oh yeah!</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.600" end="01:34:39.700" style="s2">Little monkeys!</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.066" end="01:34:41.533" style="s2">Start banging!</p>
<p begin="01:34:48.733" end="01:34:49.700" style="s2">Whoa!</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.866" end="01:34:51.500" style="s2">These beats are awesome!</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.866" end="01:35:11.533" style="s2">Hey guys!</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.600" end="01:35:12.533" style="s2">Are you seeing this?</p>
<p begin="01:35:12.800" end="01:35:13.933" style="s2">The monkeys are playing DJ!</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.066" end="01:35:15.833" style="s2">And Jethro&#39;s doing a Duskhaven dance!</p>
<p begin="01:35:20.733" end="01:35:21.600" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.700" end="01:35:22.866" style="s2">is this really not a show</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.900" end="01:35:24.400" style="s2">you&#39;ve rehearsed a million times?</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.600" end="01:35:29.633" style="s2">This isn&#39;t a rehearsal.</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.166" end="01:35:31.666" style="s2">It&#39;s simply because Jethro</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.733" end="01:35:32.633" style="s2">loves to show off,</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.900" end="01:35:34.900" style="s2">and his energy rubbed off on the monkeys next to him.</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.100" end="01:35:42.933" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.100" end="01:35:44.800" style="s2">what exactly did you say to them just now?</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.833" end="01:35:46.033" style="s2">Is there a show tomorrow too?</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.200" end="01:35:47.933" style="s2">I&#39;m booking tomorrow&#39;s tickets right now!</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.666" end="01:35:57.466" style="s2">Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.533" end="01:35:59.433" style="s2">Starlight Wildlife Park is dominating</p>
<p begin="01:35:59.500" end="01:36:00.966" style="s2">every trending list on social media!</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.100" end="01:36:09.600" style="s2">Chairman!</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.800" end="01:36:10.500" style="s2">Great news!</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.566" end="01:36:11.466" style="s2">Take a look at this!</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.266" end="01:36:26.100" style="s2">Excellent.</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.566" end="01:36:28.200" style="s2">Galen really delivered.</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.800" end="01:36:29.700" style="s2">And Rupert finally</p>
<p begin="01:36:29.800" end="01:36:31.200" style="s2">did something worthwhile for once.</p>
<p begin="01:36:33.333" end="01:36:34.033" style="s2">Mr. Shaw,</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.533" end="01:36:35.633" style="s2">draft up a long-term</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.666" end="01:36:37.000" style="s2">strategic partnership agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.266" end="01:36:39.000" style="s2">And add a $10 million investment.</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.100" end="01:36:40.233" style="s2">We&#39;ll sign it this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.400" end="01:36:41.166" style="s2">Yes, Chairman.</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.166" end="01:36:42.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll get on it right away.</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.233" end="01:37:02.333" style="s2">Hello, Mr. Shaw.</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.433" end="01:37:03.033" style="s2">Good morning!</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.066" end="01:37:03.766" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.900" end="01:37:04.800" style="s2">Our Chairman decided</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.866" end="01:37:07.000" style="s2">to partner with the wildlife park long-term</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.033" end="01:37:08.633" style="s2">and invest another ten million dollars</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.666" end="01:37:09.666" style="s2">to make it the country&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.766" end="01:37:11.333" style="s2">most unique wildlife park.</p>
<p begin="01:37:11.766" end="01:37:12.833" style="s2">With these little guys around,</p>
<p begin="01:37:13.366" end="01:37:15.466" style="s2">being unique is the least of our worries.</p>
<p begin="01:37:15.500" end="01:37:16.200" style="s2">Not a problem.</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.333" end="01:37:17.166" style="s2">Looking forward to it!</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.700" end="01:37:23.166" style="s2">Maggie.</p>
<p begin="01:37:23.466" end="01:37:24.666" style="s2">Ellison Group is giving us</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.700" end="01:37:26.033" style="s2">an extra ten million dollars!</p>
<p begin="01:37:26.200" end="01:37:27.000" style="s2">Once the money arrives,</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.100" end="01:37:29.066" style="s2">the animals are getting the best food every meal!</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.466" end="01:37:32.300" style="s2">That&#39;s wonderful, Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.400" end="01:37:34.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll redo the purchase orders right away</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.000" end="01:37:35.800" style="s2">and have them send the top-tier goods.</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.466" end="01:37:37.700" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave it to you then, Maggie.</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.800" end="01:37:38.966" style="s2">I&#39;ll go check on the animals.</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.000" end="01:37:39.700" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:51.366" end="01:37:52.233" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.833" end="01:37:53.866" style="s2">Who&#39;s got the guts</p>
<p begin="01:37:53.900" end="01:37:56.000" style="s2">to steal my absolute favorite beef!</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.366" end="01:37:59.866" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:38:00.400" end="01:38:01.200" style="s2">How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.600" end="01:38:03.233" style="s2">Who dares to steal from a tiger?</p>
<p begin="01:38:03.266" end="01:38:04.866" style="s2">Oh, Mr. Rivers!</p>
<p begin="01:38:05.100" end="01:38:06.533" style="s2">My imported bananas</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.600" end="01:38:08.333" style="s2">a bunch of them are missing!</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.866" end="01:38:10.966" style="s2">I am just so furious!</p>
<p begin="01:38:11.666" end="01:38:12.900" style="s2">Jethro got robbed too?</p>
<p begin="01:38:13.266" end="01:38:14.800" style="s2">Do we have a rat infestation or something?</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.166" end="01:38:25.933" style="s2">Ouch!</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.166" end="01:38:27.133" style="s2">Who was that?</p>
<p begin="01:38:31.833" end="01:38:33.133" style="s2">I gotta say,</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.366" end="01:38:35.833" style="s2">the grub here is mighty fine!</p>
<p begin="01:38:37.933" end="01:38:39.366" style="s2">A food thief</p>
<p begin="01:38:39.466" end="01:38:41.066" style="s2">And one from Henan, too.</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.000" end="01:38:51.100" style="s2">That sound just now</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.433" end="01:38:52.666" style="s2">It&#39;s not from our animals.</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.733" end="01:38:54.133" style="s2">An outside animal slipped in.</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.700" end="01:39:01.300" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.500" end="01:39:02.200" style="s2">Bad news!</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.533" end="01:39:03.566" style="s2">I just did inventory.</p>
<p begin="01:39:03.866" end="01:39:05.300" style="s2">The fresh meat and fruit in storage</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.633" end="01:39:06.800" style="s2">The numbers don&#39;t add up.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.133" end="01:39:09.033" style="s2">Storage?</p>
<p begin="01:39:09.633" end="01:39:10.700" style="s2">Was the lock broken?</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.666" end="01:39:14.833" style="s2">The lock was perfectly fine.</p>
<p begin="01:39:15.200" end="01:39:15.933" style="s2">I checked the cameras.</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.466" end="01:39:17.800" style="s2">They only caught a blurry black shadow.</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.066" end="01:39:18.766" style="s2">Flashing right by.</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.166" end="01:39:20.566" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t see what it was at all.</p>
<p begin="01:39:23.733" end="01:39:25.800" style="s2">Seems the storage got robbed too.</p>
<p begin="01:39:27.300" end="01:39:27.833" style="s2">Too?</p>
<p begin="01:39:28.600" end="01:39:31.000" style="s2">Is something else missing, Director?</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.200" end="01:39:33.833" style="s2">The food in their enclosures was stolen too.</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.200" end="01:39:47.400" style="s2">We&#39;ll set a trap.</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.233" end="01:39:49.700" style="s2">Since it wants to play dirty,</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.300" end="01:39:52.266" style="s2">we&#39;ll catch it right in our trap.</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.633" end="01:39:58.066" style="s2">Galen,</p>
<p begin="01:39:58.233" end="01:39:59.600" style="s2">what did you tell the animals?</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.166" end="01:40:01.900" style="s2">The monkeys will climb up and keep watch.</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.100" end="01:40:02.800" style="s2">Rex and Jethro</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.900" end="01:40:04.100" style="s2">will guard their territories.</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.266" end="01:40:05.466" style="s2">If anyone notices anything off,</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.633" end="01:40:07.000" style="s2">they&#39;ll signal me right away.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.066" end="01:40:12.500" style="s2">You&#39;re something else, man.</p>
<p begin="01:40:15.200" end="01:40:16.933" style="s2">Now for the final step.</p>
<p begin="01:40:28.000" end="01:40:28.400" style="s2">Ffion.</p>
<p begin="01:40:28.800" end="01:40:30.233" style="s2">You&#39;re on low patrol tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.366" end="01:40:31.066" style="s2">Take this with you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:31.200" end="01:40:32.233" style="s2">Make sure you don&#39;t lose it.</p>
<p begin="01:40:32.233" end="01:40:33.000" style="s2">Two-Legger.</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.100" end="01:40:35.300" style="s2">Tonight, I&#39;m definitely gonna hunt down</p>
<p begin="01:40:35.366" end="01:40:35.966" style="s2">that food thief.</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.133" end="01:40:38.466" style="s2">Just remember to get me double the fat bugs.</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.466" end="01:40:39.633" style="s2">All you can eat.</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.500" end="01:40:44.433" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait to see</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.466" end="01:40:46.066" style="s2">who this mysterious thief is.</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.166" end="01:40:48.033" style="s2">Everything is set.</p>
<p begin="01:40:48.533" end="01:40:49.066" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.500" end="01:40:51.166" style="s2">we&#39;ll see who has the last laugh.</p>
<p begin="01:41:08.733" end="01:41:09.366" style="s2">Oh boy!</p>
<p begin="01:41:09.533" end="01:41:10.166" style="s2">Here it comes!</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.366" end="01:41:11.066" style="s2">Little birds,</p>
<p begin="01:41:11.266" end="01:41:12.366" style="s2">keep your eyes peeled!</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.900" end="01:41:19.266" style="s2">Hehe!</p>
<p begin="01:41:19.466" end="01:41:21.633" style="s2">Meat and fruit served on a silver platter.</p>
<p begin="01:41:22.000" end="01:41:24.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll gladly take it all!</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.000" end="01:41:26.300" style="s2">Catch the thief!</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.466" end="01:41:27.233" style="s2">Get it!</p>
<p begin="01:41:33.066" end="01:41:34.466" style="s2">On our turf?</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.500" end="01:41:36.200" style="s2">Where do you think you&#39;re going?</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.600" end="01:41:41.233" style="s2">Let me show you what I can do!</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.666" end="01:41:52.333" style="s2">Oh no!</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.600" end="01:41:53.400" style="s2">It&#39;s getting away!</p>
<p begin="01:41:56.666" end="01:41:58.833" style="s2">You think you can catch me with that?</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.366" end="01:42:01.366" style="s2">You guys need a lot more practice!</p>
<p begin="01:42:05.733" end="01:42:07.633" style="s2">Stop wasting your energy!</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.766" end="01:42:09.800" style="s2">Just go home and go to sleep!</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.966" end="01:42:18.300" style="s2">What the heck was that thing?</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.200" end="01:42:20.533" style="s2">That was way too fast!</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.166" end="01:42:26.966" style="s2">I didn&#39;t even get a clear look at it.</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.400" end="01:42:28.500" style="s2">We&#39;ll have to wait until tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.000" end="01:42:30.100" style="s2">With the way it mocked us,</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.500" end="01:42:31.700" style="s2">it&#39;s definitely coming back.</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.233" end="01:42:43.033" style="s2">Hey, Galen.</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.133" end="01:42:43.866" style="s2">Do you think that feather</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.900" end="01:42:45.066" style="s2">belongs to the thief from last night?</p>
<p begin="01:42:48.233" end="01:42:49.100" style="s2">It&#39;s his.</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.366" end="01:42:50.700" style="s2">The feather is as long as a palm.</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.866" end="01:42:52.133" style="s2">It must be a large bird.</p>
<p begin="01:42:54.433" end="01:42:55.933" style="s2">No wonder it flew so fast!</p>
<p begin="01:42:56.433" end="01:42:58.400" style="s2">These two stupid Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="01:42:58.533" end="01:43:00.333" style="s2">What are they looking at my feather for?</p>
<p begin="01:43:01.133" end="01:43:03.100" style="s2">I can hear you, little thief.</p>
<p begin="01:43:03.266" end="01:43:04.366" style="s2">Who are you calling stupid?</p>
<p begin="01:43:12.466" end="01:43:14.400" style="s2">Damn, this is a big thief!</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.800" end="01:43:16.200" style="s2">You can actually hear me?</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.400" end="01:43:17.666" style="s2">I really underestimated you!</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.433" end="01:43:20.166" style="s2">Yeah, you just wait.</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.200" end="01:43:21.300" style="s2">We are gonna catch you!</p>
<p begin="01:43:21.466" end="01:43:23.833" style="s2">Gonna try that garbage trap again?</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.133" end="01:43:25.900" style="s2">That&#39;s just free food for me!</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.266" end="01:43:27.100" style="s2">You&#39;re delusional.</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.100" end="01:43:27.533" style="s2">Galen.</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.900" end="01:43:29.100" style="s2">Is it mocking us again?</p>
<p begin="01:43:29.466" end="01:43:31.433" style="s2">Wow, you actually guessed it right.</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.466" end="01:43:33.233" style="s2">Get down here!</p>
<p begin="01:43:33.500" end="01:43:35.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll pluck out all your feathers!</p>
<p begin="01:43:41.366" end="01:43:42.666" style="s2">This jumping Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.766" end="01:43:44.333" style="s2">must have mush for brains.</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.633" end="01:43:45.433" style="s2">Time to go.</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.600" end="01:43:47.666" style="s2">The stupid might rub off on me.</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.100" end="01:43:50.400" style="s2">Ow! Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:43:50.700" end="01:43:51.566" style="s2">We have to catch it!</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.200" end="01:43:53.666" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna pluck its feathers!</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.566" end="01:43:59.266" style="s2">Right, this time we&#39;ll set a mid-air bait</p>
<p begin="01:43:59.400" end="01:44:00.833" style="s2">and use an aerial net to catch him.</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.266" end="01:44:25.566" style="s2">This trick again?</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.700" end="01:44:27.300" style="s2">You really haven&#39;t improved at all.</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.500" end="01:44:30.066" style="s2">I&#39;ll gladly accept this meat once more.</p>
<p begin="01:44:44.666" end="01:44:45.700" style="s2">He bit it! He bit it!</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.733" end="01:44:47.833" style="s2">Keeper, pull the rope quickly!</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.533" end="01:44:51.266" style="s2">Pull the net!</p>
<p begin="01:44:54.266" end="01:44:54.933" style="s2">I&#39;m not running anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.666" end="01:44:57.966" style="s2">Haha, gotcha!</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.066" end="01:44:59.466" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if you, you stupid bird,</p>
<p begin="01:44:59.600" end="01:45:00.466" style="s2">can still be so arrogant!</p>
<p begin="01:45:00.566" end="01:45:02.066" style="s2">Still dare to throw bones at me?</p>
<p begin="01:45:02.100" end="01:45:04.033" style="s2">This yapping Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.166" end="01:45:05.166" style="s2">is so damn annoying.</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.400" end="01:45:07.533" style="s2">I&#39;m caught, I admit defeat.</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.566" end="01:45:08.733" style="s2">Still acting tough?</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.766" end="01:45:11.200" style="s2">I, Galen, specialize in taming stubborn animals!</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.766" end="01:45:21.733" style="s2">Oh, Two-Legger Keeper.</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.866" end="01:45:23.733" style="s2">I&#39;m just a little eagle who got lost</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.800" end="01:45:24.666" style="s2">in a big storm.</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.800" end="01:45:26.100" style="s2">My tummy was so empty,</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.466" end="01:45:28.266" style="s2">I accidentally ate some meat.</p>
<p begin="01:45:29.300" end="01:45:30.500" style="s2">I know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:45:30.766" end="01:45:31.933" style="s2">Please don&#39;t hurt me.</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.933" end="01:45:33.733" style="s2">Oh, sweetie, stop acting.</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.766" end="01:45:35.333" style="s2">You called me a stupid bird earlier.</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.433" end="01:45:36.433" style="s2">I haven&#39;t forgotten that.</p>
<p begin="01:45:41.066" end="01:45:43.333" style="s2">Exactly. Why play the victim now?</p>
<p begin="01:45:43.533" end="01:45:44.766" style="s2">I really want to smack him.</p>
<p begin="01:45:49.866" end="01:45:50.300" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:45:50.766" end="01:45:52.500" style="s2">I don&#39;t fall for the pity act.</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.533" end="01:46:02.066" style="s2">Hello, is this the Wildlife Conservation Agency?</p>
<p begin="01:46:02.100" end="01:46:04.533" style="s2">I&#39;m Galen Rivers from Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.666" end="01:46:06.300" style="s2">We had an unexpected intrusion</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.300" end="01:46:07.333" style="s2">from a wild eagle.</p>
<p begin="01:46:07.500" end="01:46:10.133" style="s2">Yes, please send some officers tomorrow</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.166" end="01:46:11.033" style="s2">to take it in.</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.000" end="01:46:12.766" style="s2">Ah.</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.266" end="01:46:15.866" style="s2">No, no, no, Two-Legger Keeper.</p>
<p begin="01:46:16.233" end="01:46:17.566" style="s2">Please don&#39;t send me away.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.966" end="01:46:19.466" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to go to some Sanctuary.</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.833" end="01:46:21.633" style="s2">I&#39;ll be good, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.733" end="01:46:26.166" style="s2">It&#39;s a little late to beg now.</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.766" end="01:46:29.166" style="s2">He actually knows how to beg.</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.266" end="01:46:30.600" style="s2">Stupid bird, just you wait.</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.700" end="01:46:31.700" style="s2">They&#39;re coming for you.</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.300" end="01:46:33.500" style="s2">Oh no, oh no.</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.966" end="01:46:35.700" style="s2">I totally played myself.</p>
<p begin="01:46:54.133" end="01:46:55.900" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, thank you so much</p>
<p begin="01:46:55.900" end="01:46:56.900" style="s2">for calling us about this.</p>
<p begin="01:46:57.000" end="01:46:58.500" style="s2">Please take this eagle away.</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.533" end="01:47:00.166" style="s2">He&#39;s been causing trouble for days.</p>
<p begin="01:47:13.966" end="01:47:15.133" style="s2">Here&#39;s my chance!</p>
<p begin="01:47:22.533" end="01:47:24.133" style="s2">I&#39;m not going to the sanctuary!</p>
<p begin="01:47:24.733" end="01:47:26.333" style="s2">Only total idiots go there!</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.533" end="01:47:27.333" style="s2">The food over there</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.366" end="01:47:28.700" style="s2">is nowhere near as good!</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.266" end="01:47:30.633" style="s2">I&#39;m not going!</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.033" end="01:47:32.933" style="s2">Oh no, the eagle&#39;s getting stressed out.</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.166" end="01:47:34.266" style="s2">He&#39;s highly agitated now.</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.833" end="01:47:43.200" style="s2">Director, this wild eagle is untamed.</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.233" end="01:47:43.833" style="s2">In this state,</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.900" end="01:47:45.166" style="s2">it&#39;s highly likely to attack</p>
<p begin="01:47:45.166" end="01:47:46.466" style="s2">tourists and citizens nearby.</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.500" end="01:47:47.766" style="s2">Approved. Do it now.</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.200" end="01:47:53.333" style="s2">The eagle just doesn&#39;t want to go to the agency.</p>
<p begin="01:47:53.533" end="01:47:55.200" style="s2">Using a tranquilizer gun is too extreme.</p>
<p begin="01:47:58.233" end="01:47:59.766" style="s2">Wait, don&#39;t shoot!</p>
<p begin="01:48:00.066" end="01:48:01.433" style="s2">I have a way to talk him down.</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.366" end="01:48:04.533" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, this is a wild bird of prey.</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.533" end="01:48:05.933" style="s2">It&#39;s extremely dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:48:06.000" end="01:48:07.000" style="s2">You&#39;re joking with your life!</p>
<p begin="01:48:13.200" end="01:48:15.433" style="s2">Director Palmer, please trust me.</p>
<p begin="01:48:25.566" end="01:48:28.600" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, are you sure you want to take this risk?</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.733" end="01:48:30.300" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. If I can&#39;t handle it,</p>
<p begin="01:48:30.400" end="01:48:31.766" style="s2">it won&#39;t be too late for you to step in.</p>
<p begin="01:48:37.566" end="01:48:39.366" style="s2">Gulliver, come down first.</p>
<p begin="01:48:39.533" end="01:48:40.566" style="s2">Let&#39;s have a talk.</p>
<p begin="01:48:40.600" end="01:48:41.533" style="s2">I&#39;m not listening.</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.633" end="01:48:42.766" style="s2">All I hear is blah, blah, blah.</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.800" end="01:48:47.466" style="s2">I have a way to let you stay here.</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.700" end="01:48:54.733" style="s2">Can you really make them let me stay?</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.200" end="01:48:56.100" style="s2">I can even feed you</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.133" end="01:48:59.066" style="s2">fresh fruit and beef for every meal. How&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="01:48:59.100" end="01:48:59.766" style="s2">Think about it.</p>
<p begin="01:49:02.033" end="01:49:03.333" style="s2">With food that good on the line,</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.766" end="01:49:04.933" style="s2">what&#39;s there to think about?</p>
<p begin="01:49:05.900" end="01:49:08.500" style="s2">Get ready to catch me, Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.900" end="01:49:12.566" style="s2">Is he going to attack Mr. Rivers?</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.400" end="01:49:15.066" style="s2">I knew it wouldn&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.866" end="01:49:27.200" style="s2">You promised me, ya hear!</p>
<p begin="01:49:27.333" end="01:49:28.366" style="s2">No backing out now!</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.366" end="01:49:31.566" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. Just behave yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:49:33.033" end="01:49:34.300" style="s2">Look at those three Two-Leggers</p>
<p begin="01:49:34.300" end="01:49:35.400" style="s2">with their mouths wide open.</p>
<p begin="01:49:35.566" end="01:49:36.433" style="s2">Are they hungry too?</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.500" end="01:49:39.400" style="s2">H-How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.366" end="01:49:43.433" style="s2">A wild eagle actually willingly</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.533" end="01:49:44.600" style="s2">approached Mr. Rivers?</p>
<p begin="01:49:52.800" end="01:49:55.466" style="s2">Director, it seems to have a connection with our park.</p>
<p begin="01:49:55.600" end="01:49:56.700" style="s2">I&#39;d like to request that this eagle</p>
<p begin="01:49:56.733" end="01:49:58.000" style="s2">stays at Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.166" end="01:50:01.366" style="s2">Since it listens to you so well,</p>
<p begin="01:50:01.466" end="01:50:02.566" style="s2">it&#39;s fine if it stays with you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:02.600" end="01:50:03.500" style="s2">However, you need to go through</p>
<p begin="01:50:03.533" end="01:50:04.900" style="s2">the procedures for introducing wildlife.</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.900" end="01:50:06.300" style="s2">No problem, Director.</p>
<p begin="01:50:06.400" end="01:50:07.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll get it done.</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.000" end="01:50:08.366" style="s2">Tell Mr. Rivers about</p>
<p begin="01:50:08.400" end="01:50:09.266" style="s2">the things he needs to keep in mind.</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.100" end="01:50:12.400" style="s2">First, Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.600" end="01:50:14.233" style="s2">eagles are large birds of prey.</p>
<p begin="01:50:14.366" end="01:50:15.333" style="s2">They can be aggressive,</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.366" end="01:50:16.833" style="s2">and require strict training.</p>
<p begin="01:50:20.566" end="01:50:22.200" style="s2">Second, on its foot,</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.366" end="01:50:23.933" style="s2">you must install a tracker</p>
<p begin="01:50:23.933" end="01:50:25.833" style="s2">to prevent it getting lost or hurting anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.233" end="01:50:30.000" style="s2">Yahoo!</p>
<p begin="01:50:30.300" end="01:50:32.100" style="s2">I get to eat delicious food every day!</p>
<p begin="01:50:32.400" end="01:50:33.166" style="s2">Two-Legger bro,</p>
<p begin="01:50:33.433" end="01:50:35.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow you faithfully from now on!</p>
<p begin="01:50:39.200" end="01:50:41.566" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, you really need to train it well.</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.966" end="01:50:44.566" style="s2">Come back, Gulliver!</p>
<p begin="01:50:54.433" end="01:50:56.233" style="s2">Coming, bro!</p>
<p begin="01:50:57.366" end="01:51:00.500" style="s2">His taming skills are truly extraordinary.</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.800" end="01:51:04.033" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, would you be interested in joining</p>
<p begin="01:51:04.066" end="01:51:05.433" style="s2">the National Wildlife Park selection?</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.666" end="01:51:10.766" style="s2">The N-National Wildlife Park?</p>
<p begin="01:51:10.866" end="01:51:13.200" style="s2">Yes, with strong policy support</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.566" end="01:51:15.033" style="s2">and your top-notch skills,</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.333" end="01:51:16.800" style="s2">you just might make the cut.</p>
<p begin="01:51:20.233" end="01:51:22.033" style="s2">Okay, I&#39;ll join the selection.</p>
<p begin="01:51:22.566" end="01:51:23.566" style="s2">Then it&#39;s settled.</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.700" end="01:51:24.366" style="s2">We&#39;ll be on our way.</p>
<p begin="01:51:24.466" end="01:51:25.766" style="s2">Remember to finish the paperwork.</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.800" end="01:51:26.533" style="s2">Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="01:51:39.600" end="01:51:42.233" style="s2">Director, Gulliver&#39;s paperwork is all set!</p>
<p begin="01:51:43.300" end="01:51:45.466" style="s2">Maggie, that was really fast!</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.800" end="01:51:49.200" style="s2">Yeah, the wildlife park</p>
<p begin="01:51:49.233" end="01:51:50.400" style="s2">is gonna be lively again!</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.466" end="01:51:51.766" style="s2">Let&#39;s go take a look, Maggie.</p>
<p begin="01:51:56.766" end="01:51:58.200" style="s2">Where&#39;d you get that banana?</p>
<p begin="01:51:58.400" end="01:52:01.066" style="s2">Swiped it from Jethro, of course!</p>
<p begin="01:52:02.600" end="01:52:03.366" style="s2">Swiped it right from</p>
<p begin="01:52:03.466" end="01:52:04.766" style="s2">Jethro, of course.</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.166" end="01:52:06.666" style="s2">As the old saying goes,</p>
<p begin="01:52:06.966" end="01:52:09.133" style="s2">stolen fruit is the sweetest.</p>
<p begin="01:52:11.233" end="01:52:12.866" style="s2">Is that how you use that saying?</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.700" end="01:52:16.500" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:52:16.966" end="01:52:18.133" style="s2">If you don&#39;t kick out</p>
<p begin="01:52:18.133" end="01:52:19.866" style="s2">this Flat-Feather Critter today,</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.200" end="01:52:22.300" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna toss you in a ditch!</p>
<p begin="01:52:22.566" end="01:52:23.900" style="s2">Yeah, exactly!</p>
<p begin="01:52:24.500" end="01:52:25.666" style="s2">My imported banana</p>
<p begin="01:52:25.833" end="01:52:27.600" style="s2">is still right in its beak!</p>
<p begin="01:52:28.766" end="01:52:29.866" style="s2">You stupid bird!</p>
<p begin="01:52:30.033" end="01:52:31.333" style="s2">Come over here if you dare!</p>
<p begin="01:52:31.566" end="01:52:33.466" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna beat you to a pulp today!</p>
<p begin="01:52:38.233" end="01:52:40.166" style="s2">You&#39;re all just too dumb!</p>
<p begin="01:52:42.600" end="01:52:43.566" style="s2">Alright, alright.</p>
<p begin="01:52:43.766" end="01:52:45.633" style="s2">Double rations tonight to make up for it!</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.766" end="01:52:49.400" style="s2">Gulliver, you make trouble again,</p>
<p begin="01:52:49.666" end="01:52:51.066" style="s2">you get no beef at all!</p>
<p begin="01:52:53.433" end="01:52:55.033" style="s2">Director, look at the ticket reservations!</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.100" end="01:52:56.433" style="s2">Looks like we&#39;re gonna be busy again!</p>
<p begin="01:53:04.766" end="01:53:06.566" style="s2">Haha, Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.800" end="01:53:09.133" style="s2">Look up and admire my handsome flight!</p>
<p begin="01:53:12.366" end="01:53:13.500" style="s2">Oh my god, why is this big bird</p>
<p begin="01:53:13.600" end="01:53:14.466" style="s2">flying right at us?</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.466" end="01:53:15.400" style="s2">Don&#39;t panic, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.433" end="01:53:17.033" style="s2">This is our park&#39;s new member, Gulliver.</p>
<p begin="01:53:17.033" end="01:53:18.400" style="s2">He just wants to say hi to everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:53:18.500" end="01:53:19.366" style="s2">He won&#39;t hurt anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:53:19.400" end="01:53:21.300" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, what is Gulliver saying?</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.200" end="01:53:23.666" style="s2">He just told us to look at</p>
<p begin="01:53:23.700" end="01:53:24.900" style="s2">his handsome posture.</p>
<p begin="01:53:25.666" end="01:53:28.600" style="s2">Haha, this eagle sure knows how to show off!</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.500" end="01:53:50.200" style="s2">This little snack is pretty sweet.</p>
<p begin="01:53:50.333" end="01:53:51.366" style="s2">Tastes good!</p>
<p begin="01:53:51.433" end="01:53:53.466" style="s2">Wow, it can even pick up crumbs from the ground!</p>
<p begin="01:53:53.500" end="01:53:55.233" style="s2">Big bird, big bird, look here!</p>
<p begin="01:53:55.300" end="01:53:57.033" style="s2">This little Two-Legger is kind of cute.</p>
<p begin="01:53:57.166" end="01:53:58.666" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you a solo shot!</p>
<p begin="01:54:04.300" end="01:54:05.400" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, it just</p>
<p begin="01:54:05.566" end="01:54:06.800" style="s2">flapped its wings and blinked.</p>
<p begin="01:54:06.833" end="01:54:07.933" style="s2">What is it trying to say now?</p>
<p begin="01:54:07.966" end="01:54:09.300" style="s2">He says since the little girl</p>
<p begin="01:54:09.333" end="01:54:10.033" style="s2">is so adorable,</p>
<p begin="01:54:10.066" end="01:54:11.133" style="s2">he&#39;s saying hi to her.</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.166" end="01:54:12.000" style="s2">Yay!</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.366" end="01:54:18.266" style="s2">Galen Rivers.</p>
<p begin="01:54:18.900" end="01:54:20.266" style="s2">I&#39;m finally back.</p>
<p begin="01:54:21.033" end="01:54:23.300" style="s2">If I don&#39;t ruin this crappy park of yours,</p>
<p begin="01:54:24.000" end="01:54:25.400" style="s2">my name isn&#39;t Corbin Shaw.</p>
<p begin="01:54:35.300" end="01:54:35.800" style="s2">Galen.</p>
<p begin="01:54:36.266" end="01:54:37.733" style="s2">You got lucky last time.</p>
<p begin="01:54:38.333" end="01:54:39.200" style="s2">This time I&#39;ll fake</p>
<p begin="01:54:39.266" end="01:54:40.833" style="s2">a video of you abusing animals</p>
<p begin="01:54:41.033" end="01:54:42.000" style="s2">and post it online.</p>
<p begin="01:54:42.400" end="01:54:43.800" style="s2">Let&#39;s see you bounce back from this.</p>
<p begin="01:54:49.266" end="01:54:50.833" style="s2">Who&#39;s this Two-Legger thief?</p>
<p begin="01:54:51.000" end="01:54:52.666" style="s2">Sneaking in at the dead of night.</p>
<p begin="01:54:52.933" end="01:54:54.200" style="s2">He smells awful.</p>
<p begin="01:54:55.566" end="01:54:56.066" style="s2">Oh boy.</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.166" end="01:54:57.766" style="s2">This Two-Legger is definitely up to no good.</p>
<p begin="01:54:58.133" end="01:54:59.066" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep an eye on him here.</p>
<p begin="01:54:59.366" end="01:55:00.333" style="s2">Gulliver, hurry up and fetch</p>
<p begin="01:55:00.666" end="01:55:01.700" style="s2">the Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="01:55:01.700" end="01:55:02.266" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:55:02.333" end="01:55:03.166" style="s2">On it.</p>
<p begin="01:55:15.533" end="01:55:16.866" style="s2">Gulliver.</p>
<p begin="01:55:17.000" end="01:55:18.000" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you asleep?</p>
<p begin="01:55:18.233" end="01:55:19.033" style="s2">Having a fit?</p>
<p begin="01:55:19.166" end="01:55:20.300" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you a fit!</p>
<p begin="01:55:20.900" end="01:55:22.000" style="s2">There&#39;s a shady-looking</p>
<p begin="01:55:22.033" end="01:55:22.766" style="s2">Two-Legger thief</p>
<p begin="01:55:22.833" end="01:55:23.833" style="s2">sneaking into the park.</p>
<p begin="01:55:24.266" end="01:55:25.733" style="s2">He&#39;s holding some red thing</p>
<p begin="01:55:25.766" end="01:55:26.800" style="s2">over by Jethro!</p>
<p begin="01:55:27.100" end="01:55:27.400" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:55:27.866" end="01:55:30.200" style="s2">Why is someone always trying to sabotage my park?</p>
<p begin="01:55:32.266" end="01:55:32.900" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:55:33.066" end="01:55:33.800" style="s2">I misjudged you.</p>
<p begin="01:55:34.066" end="01:55:35.166" style="s2">Let&#39;s go have a look.</p>
<p begin="01:55:51.066" end="01:55:52.233" style="s2">This Two-Legger</p>
<p begin="01:55:52.300" end="01:55:54.300" style="s2">What is he doing in my territory?</p>
<p begin="01:56:00.200" end="01:56:01.133" style="s2">Jethro.</p>
<p begin="01:56:01.466" end="01:56:02.866" style="s2">Play along nicely.</p>
<p begin="01:56:03.433" end="01:56:05.066" style="s2">Let me put some makeup on you tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:56:05.333" end="01:56:08.000" style="s2">You&#39;ll be famous all over the country tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:56:10.433" end="01:56:11.333" style="s2">Corbin Shaw.</p>
<p begin="01:56:12.266" end="01:56:13.566" style="s2">So it is you.</p>
<p begin="01:56:15.866" end="01:56:17.500" style="s2">Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="01:56:17.866" end="01:56:18.866" style="s2">Is this makeup</p>
<p begin="01:56:18.866" end="01:56:20.133" style="s2">paint prepared for me?</p>
<p begin="01:56:20.333" end="01:56:21.500" style="s2">How thoughtful!</p>
<p begin="01:56:21.900" end="01:56:22.633" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna do</p>
<p begin="01:56:22.700" end="01:56:24.933" style="s2">the trendiest look right now!</p>
<p begin="01:56:27.800" end="01:56:29.000" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:56:29.333" end="01:56:33.000" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna make you look so pretty!</p>
<p begin="01:56:33.833" end="01:56:34.133" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="01:56:34.600" end="01:56:35.466" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.433" end="01:56:39.266" style="s2">Don&#39;t move!</p>
<p begin="01:56:39.566" end="01:56:41.200" style="s2">Or I&#39;ll mess it up!</p>
<p begin="01:56:48.000" end="01:56:48.933" style="s2">Stop it!</p>
<p begin="01:56:49.666" end="01:56:51.666" style="s2">This isn&#39;t how it&#39;s supposed to go!</p>
<p begin="01:56:53.533" end="01:56:55.466" style="s2">Just one more touch.</p>
<p begin="01:57:02.533" end="01:57:04.366" style="s2">Corbin Shaw really brought this on himself.</p>
<p begin="01:57:04.600" end="01:57:06.333" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t even look like a Two-Legger anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:57:06.433" end="01:57:08.766" style="s2">I give Jethro a perfect score for this!</p>
<p begin="01:57:08.766" end="01:57:09.800" style="s2">Cheers!</p>
<p begin="01:57:09.966" end="01:57:11.266" style="s2">Absolutely perfect!</p>
<p begin="01:57:20.800" end="01:57:22.700" style="s2">That gorilla is terrifying.</p>
<p begin="01:57:27.100" end="01:57:28.733" style="s2">Good thing I have a Plan B.</p>
<p begin="01:57:28.900" end="01:57:31.000" style="s2">Big Rex, here I come!</p>
<p begin="01:57:44.500" end="01:57:45.700" style="s2">I&#39;d better not go in.</p>
<p begin="01:57:45.766" end="01:57:47.700" style="s2">Provoking it from outside should work.</p>
<p begin="01:57:52.600" end="01:57:54.400" style="s2">Where did this clown come from?</p>
<p begin="01:57:54.500" end="01:57:55.933" style="s2">He&#39;s a damn eyesore!</p>
<p begin="01:57:56.233" end="01:57:56.733" style="s2">Two-Legger!</p>
<p begin="01:57:56.966" end="01:57:58.866" style="s2">Get this lunatic out of here right now!</p>
<p begin="01:58:01.633" end="01:58:03.300" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t the tiger reacting?</p>
<p begin="01:58:03.500" end="01:58:05.133" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t seeing me like this piss it off?</p>
<p begin="01:58:05.333" end="01:58:06.433" style="s2">Come on, give me a roar!</p>
<p begin="01:58:07.100" end="01:58:08.466" style="s2">I need some raging footage!</p>
<p begin="01:58:08.500" end="01:58:08.966" style="s2">Gulliver.</p>
<p begin="01:58:09.466" end="01:58:09.666" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="01:58:09.900" end="01:58:11.133" style="s2">Snatch the phone from that guy&#39;s hand.</p>
<p begin="01:58:11.200" end="01:58:11.700" style="s2">Bring it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:58:14.466" end="01:58:15.133" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="01:58:15.466" end="01:58:17.100" style="s2">Who stole my damn phone?</p>
<p begin="01:58:19.500" end="01:58:20.166" style="s2">Stupid bird!</p>
<p begin="01:58:20.266" end="01:58:21.533" style="s2">Give my phone back right now!</p>
<p begin="01:58:21.733" end="01:58:23.133" style="s2">My video&#39;s on there!</p>
<p begin="01:58:31.566" end="01:58:32.266" style="s2">Gulliver!</p>
<p begin="01:58:32.633" end="01:58:34.433" style="s2">This metal thing is pretty cool.</p>
<p begin="01:58:35.100" end="01:58:37.200" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna whip you good today!</p>
<p begin="01:58:39.600" end="01:58:41.133" style="s2">It&#39;s you stinking monkeys again!</p>
<p begin="01:58:41.233" end="01:58:42.666" style="s2">Give me back my phone right now!</p>
<p begin="01:58:43.766" end="01:58:45.900" style="s2">Director Shaw, in a good mood, I see.</p>
<p begin="01:58:45.933" end="01:58:47.266" style="s2">Not sleeping in the middle of the night,</p>
<p begin="01:58:47.466" end="01:58:49.600" style="s2">but coming to my wildlife park to exercise?</p>
<p begin="01:58:50.066" end="01:58:50.566" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:58:51.866" end="01:58:52.766" style="s2">Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:58:57.066" end="01:58:58.433" style="s2">You&#39;ll have to ask my eagle.</p>
<p begin="01:58:58.533" end="01:58:59.666" style="s2">He&#39;s the one who told me.</p>
<p begin="01:59:05.133" end="01:59:06.700" style="s2">How&#39;s that, Two-Legger Keeper?</p>
<p begin="01:59:06.933" end="01:59:08.166" style="s2">I did a good job, right?</p>
<p begin="01:59:08.466" end="01:59:09.466" style="s2">Perfect score.</p>
<p begin="01:59:11.966" end="01:59:13.600" style="s2">That damn bird!</p>
<p begin="01:59:14.300" end="01:59:15.633" style="s2">Ruined my plans!</p>
<p begin="01:59:17.100" end="01:59:18.766" style="s2">Here, Two-Legger Fool.</p>
<p begin="01:59:18.966" end="01:59:20.800" style="s2">I&#39;m bored of it, take it back.</p>
<p begin="01:59:21.200" end="01:59:21.933" style="s2">Oh no.</p>
<p begin="01:59:21.966" end="01:59:24.466" style="s2">The video of my failure is on that phone!</p>
<p begin="01:59:24.866" end="01:59:26.133" style="s2">It can&#39;t be exposed!</p>
<p begin="01:59:26.266" end="01:59:27.766" style="s2">Or I&#39;m completely finished!</p>
<p begin="01:59:27.800" end="01:59:28.766" style="s2">I need to get it back!</p>
<p begin="01:59:28.900" end="01:59:29.300" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="01:59:29.400" end="01:59:30.466" style="s2">Give me back my phone!</p>
<p begin="01:59:33.300" end="01:59:34.933" style="s2">Help! Stop hitting me!</p>
<p begin="01:59:34.966" end="01:59:35.333" style="s2">Gulliver!</p>
<p begin="01:59:35.400" end="01:59:36.800" style="s2">Stop, let him go!</p>
<p begin="01:59:44.233" end="01:59:46.033" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, I was wrong!</p>
<p begin="01:59:46.366" end="01:59:47.166" style="s2">I&#39;ll never do it again!</p>
<p begin="01:59:47.466" end="01:59:48.566" style="s2">Please, give the phone</p>
<p begin="01:59:52.000" end="01:59:52.800" style="s2">It&#39;s over</p>
<p begin="01:59:54.966" end="01:59:55.900" style="s2">No, this isn&#39;t right!</p>
<p begin="01:59:56.033" end="01:59:57.200" style="s2">I was supposed to edit this video.</p>
<p begin="01:59:57.466" end="01:59:58.333" style="s2">Why did it post automatically?</p>
<p begin="01:59:58.566" end="01:59:59.400" style="s2">I have to take it down!</p>
<p begin="01:59:59.433" end="01:59:59.900" style="s2">Director Shaw.</p>
<p begin="02:00:00.033" end="02:00:00.666" style="s2">Up in the middle of the night,</p>
<p begin="02:00:00.733" end="02:00:01.666" style="s2">putting on a performance art show here?</p>
<p begin="02:00:01.733" end="02:00:02.566" style="s2">And you even uploaded it.</p>
<p begin="02:00:02.566" end="02:00:02.966" style="s2">Uploaded it</p>
<p begin="02:00:03.033" end="02:00:04.033" style="s2">Getting a lot of views, huh.</p>
<p begin="02:00:04.066" end="02:00:05.366" style="s2">Oh boy.</p>
<p begin="02:00:05.366" end="02:00:07.966" style="s2">Talk about shooting yourself in the foot.</p>
<p begin="02:00:08.000" end="02:00:08.966" style="s2">Security, that&#39;s him!</p>
<p begin="02:00:09.166" end="02:00:10.566" style="s2">Sneaking into the park late at night,</p>
<p begin="02:00:10.633" end="02:00:12.133" style="s2">and trying to provoke the animals!</p>
<p begin="02:00:18.133" end="02:00:18.766" style="s2">Mr. Rivers,</p>
<p begin="02:00:18.933" end="02:00:19.933" style="s2">we&#39;ll take him away right now.</p>
<p begin="02:00:19.966" end="02:00:22.000" style="s2">I&#39;m innocent! I didn&#39;t do anything!</p>
<p begin="02:00:22.533" end="02:00:24.066" style="s2">They&#39;re the ones who beat me up!</p>
<p begin="02:00:26.300" end="02:00:26.833" style="s2">Shut it.</p>
<p begin="02:00:26.966" end="02:00:28.633" style="s2">Your video is everywhere now.</p>
<p begin="02:00:30.733" end="02:00:31.233" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="02:00:31.433" end="02:00:32.200" style="s2">Just you wait!</p>
<p begin="02:00:32.766" end="02:00:34.100" style="s2">I will be back!</p>
<p begin="02:00:34.300" end="02:00:35.600" style="s2">Safe travels, Mr. Shaw.</p>
<p begin="02:00:38.366" end="02:00:38.966" style="s2">Mr. Jennings.</p>
<p begin="02:00:39.133" end="02:00:40.333" style="s2">This Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="02:00:40.366" end="02:00:41.666" style="s2">is really blowing up online right now.</p>
<p begin="02:00:45.733" end="02:00:47.433" style="s2">This definitely isn&#39;t the result of</p>
<p begin="02:00:47.466" end="02:00:48.333" style="s2">ordinary training.</p>
<p begin="02:00:48.666" end="02:00:49.966" style="s2">If we acquire this wildlife park,</p>
<p begin="02:00:50.100" end="02:00:50.933" style="s2">extract those animals&#39;</p>
<p begin="02:00:51.000" end="02:00:52.066" style="s2">DNA samples for breeding,</p>
<p begin="02:00:52.066" end="02:00:53.666" style="s2">the commercial value would be astronomical.</p>
<p begin="02:00:58.900" end="02:00:59.500" style="s2">Get ready.</p>
<p begin="02:00:59.600" end="02:01:00.933" style="s2">We&#39;re going to Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="02:01:01.066" end="02:01:02.900" style="s2">Let&#39;s have a good chat with Director Rivers.</p>
<p begin="02:01:17.600" end="02:01:19.566" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, $100 million</p>
<p begin="02:01:19.900" end="02:01:21.366" style="s2">to buy Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="02:01:21.366" end="02:01:22.866" style="s2">and the rights to all the animals.</p>
<p begin="02:01:23.566" end="02:01:25.000" style="s2">$100 million?</p>
<p begin="02:01:25.000" end="02:01:27.433" style="s2">Holy crap, his eyes just glazed over.</p>
<p begin="02:01:27.666" end="02:01:28.433" style="s2">Is he really gonna</p>
<p begin="02:01:28.466" end="02:01:29.233" style="s2">sell the park?</p>
<p begin="02:01:35.300" end="02:01:36.466" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper,</p>
<p begin="02:01:36.966" end="02:01:38.366" style="s2">I ain&#39;t agreeing to this!</p>
<p begin="02:01:40.000" end="02:01:41.566" style="s2">You absolutely cannot sell!</p>
<p begin="02:01:47.966" end="02:01:50.200" style="s2">Galen, snap out of it!</p>
<p begin="02:01:50.766" end="02:01:52.433" style="s2">You can&#39;t just toss us aside!</p>
<p begin="02:01:54.366" end="02:01:55.300" style="s2">You can&#39;t abandon</p>
<p begin="02:01:55.366" end="02:01:56.266" style="s2">our partnership!</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.833" end="02:02:06.566" style="s2">Mr. Jennings, I appreciate the generous offer.</p>
<p begin="02:02:06.666" end="02:02:08.366" style="s2">But this wildlife park is my home.</p>
<p begin="02:02:08.466" end="02:02:09.366" style="s2">I will never sell it.</p>
<p begin="02:02:15.333" end="02:02:18.766" style="s2">Refusal just means the stakes aren&#39;t high enough.</p>
<p begin="02:02:19.666" end="02:02:20.666" style="s2">$200 million.</p>
<p begin="02:02:21.600" end="02:02:22.433" style="s2">$200 million.</p>
<p begin="02:02:22.533" end="02:02:23.333" style="s2">Summit Holdings</p>
<p begin="02:02:23.433" end="02:02:24.566" style="s2">What exactly are they thinking?</p>
<p begin="02:02:27.333" end="02:02:29.800" style="s2">Mr. Jennings, I&#39;ve made my decision.</p>
<p begin="02:02:29.833" end="02:02:30.566" style="s2">We&#39;re doomed!</p>
<p begin="02:02:30.766" end="02:02:32.066" style="s2">The price is way too high.</p>
<p begin="02:02:32.266" end="02:02:33.833" style="s2">Is this kid really gonna sell?</p>
<p begin="02:02:34.333" end="02:02:35.300" style="s2">Since you&#39;ve made up your mind,</p>
<p begin="02:02:35.433" end="02:02:36.566" style="s2">then let&#39;s proceed with this transfer—</p>
<p begin="02:02:36.600" end="02:02:37.466" style="s2">Hold on a second.</p>
<p begin="02:02:40.866" end="02:02:42.000" style="s2">I never said I was selling.</p>
<p begin="02:02:51.200" end="02:02:52.066" style="s2">Director Rivers!</p>
<p begin="02:02:53.800" end="02:02:54.466" style="s2">Two hundred million.</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.533" end="02:02:57.033" style="s2">You could buy three parks in Riverdale with that.</p>
<p begin="02:02:57.133" end="02:02:58.000" style="s2">Three parks of</p>
<p begin="02:02:58.033" end="02:02:59.333" style="s2">your size!</p>
<p begin="02:03:00.266" end="02:03:02.333" style="s2">Don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="02:03:05.500" end="02:03:06.233" style="s2">Mr. Jennings.</p>
<p begin="02:03:07.300" end="02:03:08.400" style="s2">Forget two hundred million.</p>
<p begin="02:03:08.766" end="02:03:10.766" style="s2">Even if you offer a billion, it&#39;s useless.</p>
<p begin="02:03:11.566" end="02:03:12.600" style="s2">I&#39;m not selling.</p>
<p begin="02:03:21.033" end="02:03:21.733" style="s2">Well said.</p>
<p begin="02:03:22.366" end="02:03:25.100" style="s2">The Two-Legger Keeper is awesome!</p>
<p begin="02:03:30.833" end="02:03:31.366" style="s2">Galen.</p>
<p begin="02:03:31.900" end="02:03:33.600" style="s2">You better not cross Summit Holdings.</p>
<p begin="02:03:34.366" end="02:03:36.766" style="s2">Think carefully before you speak.</p>
<p begin="02:03:39.533" end="02:03:42.033" style="s2">Please leave, Mr. Jennings.</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.066" end="02:03:43.500" style="s2">I&#39;m ready to welcome my visitors.</p>
<p begin="02:03:47.066" end="02:03:50.100" style="s2">You ungrateful punk!</p>
<p begin="02:03:53.166" end="02:03:55.066" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch the Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="02:03:55.600" end="02:03:56.700" style="s2">Watch this!</p>
<p begin="02:04:01.100" end="02:04:02.633" style="s2">Ah! My head!</p>
<p begin="02:04:03.666" end="02:04:05.266" style="s2">Where&#39;d this damn bird come from?!</p>
<p begin="02:04:06.033" end="02:04:08.100" style="s2">Get away! Get away!</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.366" end="02:04:26.866" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="02:04:27.866" end="02:04:28.533" style="s2">Very well!</p>
<p begin="02:04:30.300" end="02:04:31.266" style="s2">This isn&#39;t over!</p>
<p begin="02:04:39.600" end="02:04:41.766" style="s2">Oh, see yourself out!</p>
<p begin="02:04:42.733" end="02:04:44.633" style="s2">Damn, bro!</p>
<p begin="02:04:45.400" end="02:04:47.500" style="s2">I freaking love you!</p>
<p begin="02:04:53.166" end="02:04:54.433" style="s2">Stop being gross.</p>
<p begin="02:04:56.333" end="02:04:56.833" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="02:04:57.033" end="02:04:58.666" style="s2">We gotta get ready to open the park.</p>
<p begin="02:04:59.233" end="02:05:00.900" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell my dad when I get back today.</p>
<p begin="02:05:00.933" end="02:05:02.333" style="s2">He has to give our wildlife park</p>
<p begin="02:05:02.366" end="02:05:03.166" style="s2">more investment.</p>
<p begin="02:05:22.200" end="02:05:23.100" style="s2">That&#39;s odd.</p>
<p begin="02:05:23.333" end="02:05:23.933" style="s2">Galen,</p>
<p begin="02:05:24.266" end="02:05:25.433" style="s2">it&#39;s almost 10 o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="02:05:25.800" end="02:05:26.366" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t there</p>
<p begin="02:05:26.466" end="02:05:27.333" style="s2">a single person here?</p>
<p begin="02:05:29.766" end="02:05:31.000" style="s2">I&#39;m wondering the same thing.</p>
<p begin="02:05:31.933" end="02:05:33.266" style="s2">The 5,000 tickets for today</p>
<p begin="02:05:33.466" end="02:05:34.700" style="s2">were sold out in half a second.</p>
<p begin="02:05:42.433" end="02:05:44.266" style="s2">Could all 5,000 of them</p>
<p begin="02:05:44.566" end="02:05:46.166" style="s2">have overslept together?</p>
<p begin="02:05:59.266" end="02:06:01.133" style="s2">Director! Young Ellison!</p>
<p begin="02:06:02.033" end="02:06:02.666" style="s2">Something happened!</p>
<p begin="02:06:03.233" end="02:06:04.166" style="s2">Something big!</p>
<p begin="02:06:07.133" end="02:06:08.833" style="s2">Maggie, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="02:06:09.100" end="02:06:09.866" style="s2">Slow down.</p>
<p begin="02:06:14.033" end="02:06:14.633" style="s2">Look at this.</p>
<p begin="02:06:14.966" end="02:06:16.166" style="s2">Some visitors who bought tickets</p>
<p begin="02:06:16.266" end="02:06:17.400" style="s2">posted a video in the fan group.</p>
<p begin="02:06:17.766" end="02:06:18.833" style="s2">The road to our Wildlife Park,</p>
<p begin="02:06:19.200" end="02:06:20.300" style="s2">the only main road we have,</p>
<p begin="02:06:20.633" end="02:06:22.300" style="s2">has been blocked off by Summit Holdings!</p>
<p begin="02:06:28.500" end="02:06:30.433" style="s2">What the hell, a landslide?</p>
<p begin="02:06:30.666" end="02:06:31.933" style="s2">That road was fine yesterday.</p>
<p begin="02:06:32.066" end="02:06:33.166" style="s2">Not even a single crack.</p>
<p begin="02:06:33.566" end="02:06:35.000" style="s2">Landslide, my ass!</p>
<p begin="02:06:45.000" end="02:06:47.233" style="s2">The Two-Legger visitors can&#39;t get in.</p>
<p begin="02:06:47.400" end="02:06:48.466" style="s2">What do we do now?</p>
<p begin="02:06:51.000" end="02:06:51.900" style="s2">Oh my.</p>
<p begin="02:06:51.933" end="02:06:53.400" style="s2">The bad guys blocked the road!</p>
<p begin="02:06:59.400" end="02:07:01.000" style="s2">Those bastards at Summit Holdings.</p>
<p begin="02:07:01.100" end="02:07:02.166" style="s2">Playing nice didn&#39;t work yesterday,</p>
<p begin="02:07:02.300" end="02:07:03.366" style="s2">so they&#39;re playing hardball today!</p>
<p begin="02:07:08.533" end="02:07:09.533" style="s2">Maggie, Rupert.</p>
<p begin="02:07:10.066" end="02:07:11.800" style="s2">Let&#39;s go inside and figure it out.</p>
<p begin="02:07:13.633" end="02:07:13.966" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="02:07:14.266" end="02:07:15.866" style="s2">There&#39;s always a way to fix things.</p>
<p begin="02:07:17.400" end="02:07:18.066" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="02:07:29.600" end="02:07:31.466" style="s2">Director, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="02:07:38.666" end="02:07:40.266" style="s2">Is there really no other way?</p>
<p begin="02:07:44.166" end="02:07:45.800" style="s2">Maggie, hold it.</p>
<p begin="02:07:46.100" end="02:07:47.700" style="s2">Sighing will blow our good luck away.</p>
<p begin="02:07:48.733" end="02:07:49.733" style="s2">At a time like this,</p>
<p begin="02:07:49.733" end="02:07:51.866" style="s2">how can you still make jokes, Director?</p>
<p begin="02:07:53.800" end="02:07:54.533" style="s2">Ah.</p>
<p begin="02:07:58.900" end="02:07:59.600" style="s2">I&#39;ve got it!</p>
<p begin="02:08:00.633" end="02:08:01.466" style="s2">If they block the road,</p>
<p begin="02:08:01.866" end="02:08:03.166" style="s2">we&#39;ll just open a new one!</p>
<p begin="02:08:09.933" end="02:08:11.233" style="s2">What&#39;s the big deal?</p>
<p begin="02:08:11.500" end="02:08:12.800" style="s2">If the main road is blocked,</p>
<p begin="02:08:13.000" end="02:08:14.133" style="s2">isn&#39;t there that old,</p>
<p begin="02:08:14.366" end="02:08:16.166" style="s2">overgrown dirt trail in the back</p>
<p begin="02:08:16.200" end="02:08:18.400" style="s2">that leads right to the back of Monkey Ridge?</p>
<p begin="02:08:20.533" end="02:08:21.133" style="s2">Right!</p>
<p begin="02:08:21.533" end="02:08:22.800" style="s2">There&#39;s still that path in the back</p>
<p begin="02:08:23.066" end="02:08:24.300" style="s2">left by the Old Keeper!</p>
<p begin="02:08:28.600" end="02:08:29.133" style="s2">Director!</p>
<p begin="02:08:29.500" end="02:08:30.366" style="s2">That back trail</p>
<p begin="02:08:30.566" end="02:08:32.166" style="s2">has been abandoned for over ten years.</p>
<p begin="02:08:32.900" end="02:08:34.466" style="s2">The weeds are taller than a person,</p>
<p begin="02:08:34.666" end="02:08:35.666" style="s2">and there are no signs!</p>
<p begin="02:08:37.633" end="02:08:38.833" style="s2">Even if we make an announcement,</p>
<p begin="02:08:38.966" end="02:08:40.200" style="s2">the visitors won&#39;t find it!</p>
<p begin="02:08:40.533" end="02:08:42.433" style="s2">Yeah, it&#39;s out in the wilderness.</p>
<p begin="02:08:42.566" end="02:08:44.433" style="s2">If visitors get lost and something happens,</p>
<p begin="02:08:44.533" end="02:08:45.500" style="s2">it&#39;ll be even worse.</p>
<p begin="02:08:52.933" end="02:08:54.066" style="s2">What&#39;s the big deal?</p>
<p begin="02:08:54.600" end="02:08:55.300" style="s2">I know it well.</p>
<p begin="02:08:55.666" end="02:08:57.333" style="s2">I can navigate for the Two-Leggers.</p>
<p begin="02:09:04.033" end="02:09:05.866" style="s2">Guiding from above is a piece of cake.</p>
<p begin="02:09:06.066" end="02:09:06.900" style="s2">I can do it too!</p>
<p begin="02:09:09.566" end="02:09:13.500" style="s2">Leave the Monkey Ridge trail to me!</p>
<p begin="02:09:16.633" end="02:09:19.366" style="s2">Great, send it to the visitors now!</p>
<p begin="02:09:40.866" end="02:09:41.766" style="s2">Check your phones!</p>
<p begin="02:09:41.800" end="02:09:42.900" style="s2">The park just sent a message.</p>
<p begin="02:09:43.266" end="02:09:45.100" style="s2">It says to follow Ffion and Gulliver</p>
<p begin="02:09:45.166" end="02:09:46.466" style="s2">to take the back mountain path!</p>
<p begin="02:09:57.233" end="02:09:58.666" style="s2">Hey, Two-Leggers!</p>
<p begin="02:09:59.033" end="02:09:59.833" style="s2">Stay close to me!</p>
<p begin="02:10:00.366" end="02:10:02.400" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you down a secret path!</p>
<p begin="02:10:07.600" end="02:10:08.866" style="s2">What are you all waiting for?</p>
<p begin="02:10:08.966" end="02:10:10.000" style="s2">Come on, keep up!</p>
<p begin="02:10:12.233" end="02:10:13.066" style="s2">Here they come!</p>
<p begin="02:10:13.100" end="02:10:13.866" style="s2">Let&#39;s go check it out!</p>
<p begin="02:10:37.400" end="02:10:39.100" style="s2">Bronte, we&#39;re here!</p>
<p begin="02:10:39.366" end="02:10:40.866" style="s2">The rest is up to you!</p>
<p begin="02:10:44.433" end="02:10:45.666" style="s2">Alrighty!</p>
<p begin="02:10:45.933" end="02:10:47.533" style="s2">Head left, folks!</p>
<p begin="02:10:48.033" end="02:10:50.766" style="s2">Watch my gestures, don&#39;t fall behind!</p>
<p begin="02:11:00.866" end="02:11:01.633" style="s2">Holy crap!</p>
<p begin="02:11:01.766" end="02:11:02.766" style="s2">The monkeys in the trees!</p>
<p begin="02:11:02.800" end="02:11:03.933" style="s2">They&#39;re navigating for us!</p>
<p begin="02:11:04.200" end="02:11:05.533" style="s2">This is so unreal!</p>
<p begin="02:11:06.933" end="02:11:08.466" style="s2">Quick, post this online!</p>
<p begin="02:11:08.600" end="02:11:09.466" style="s2">This isn&#39;t a road closure!</p>
<p begin="02:11:09.666" end="02:11:10.733" style="s2">It&#39;s an immersive adventure!</p>
<p begin="02:11:10.866" end="02:11:11.766" style="s2">Way more fun than the main road!</p>
<p begin="02:11:12.000" end="02:11:12.766" style="s2">A million times!</p>
<p begin="02:11:36.300" end="02:11:37.500" style="s2">Bad news, Mr. Jennings!</p>
<p begin="02:11:37.633" end="02:11:38.466" style="s2">The wildlife park opened</p>
<p begin="02:11:38.600" end="02:11:39.633" style="s2">an immersive adventure route.</p>
<p begin="02:11:39.766" end="02:11:40.466" style="s2">It&#39;s trending all over</p>
<p begin="02:11:40.500" end="02:11:41.200" style="s2">social media right now!</p>
<p begin="02:11:41.366" end="02:11:42.533" style="s2">Visitor numbers are going up!</p>
<p begin="02:11:55.966" end="02:11:57.066" style="s2">Get everyone together.</p>
<p begin="02:11:58.600" end="02:12:00.300" style="s2">Tonight, I&#39;m gonna wreck</p>
<p begin="02:12:00.366" end="02:12:01.666" style="s2">that crappy back trail for good!</p>
<p begin="02:12:05.133" end="02:12:07.366" style="s2">Let&#39;s see him bounce back from that!</p>
<p begin="02:12:19.933" end="02:12:21.400" style="s2">Make it quick, let&#39;s move!</p>
<p begin="02:12:22.266" end="02:12:24.200" style="s2">Use the wire fence and get this dirt path</p>
<p begin="02:12:24.266" end="02:12:25.200" style="s2">sealed up tight!</p>
<p begin="02:12:30.066" end="02:12:32.200" style="s2">Humans coming! High alert, everyone!</p>
<p begin="02:12:33.400" end="02:12:34.700" style="s2">You guys stall them right here!</p>
<p begin="02:12:34.866" end="02:12:36.466" style="s2">I&#39;ll go fetch Director Rivers!</p>
<p begin="02:12:38.466" end="02:12:40.133" style="s2">Listen up, Monkey Clan!</p>
<p begin="02:12:40.666" end="02:12:43.000" style="s2">These goons are back here asking for trouble!</p>
<p begin="02:12:43.400" end="02:12:45.066" style="s2">Let &#39;em have it! Show no mercy!</p>
<p begin="02:12:56.700" end="02:12:58.400" style="s2">Ah! What just hit my head?!</p>
<p begin="02:12:58.666" end="02:12:59.566" style="s2">That hurts!</p>
<p begin="02:13:03.333" end="02:13:05.200" style="s2">Why are there so many?! Run!</p>
<p begin="02:13:11.633" end="02:13:14.433" style="s2">Stupid bird, stop pecking! Help!</p>
<p begin="02:13:15.466" end="02:13:17.866" style="s2">Ah, what the hell is going on?!</p>
<p begin="02:13:27.533" end="02:13:28.400" style="s2">Mr. Jennings.</p>
<p begin="02:13:28.466" end="02:13:30.300" style="s2">Bringing this many people up the hill at night</p>
<p begin="02:13:30.466" end="02:13:31.766" style="s2">Was it just to get yourself</p>
<p begin="02:13:31.800" end="02:13:33.166" style="s2">a bird&#39;s nest hairstyle?</p>
<p begin="02:13:33.266" end="02:13:35.100" style="s2">Galen, you did this on purpose!</p>
<p begin="02:13:39.733" end="02:13:40.566" style="s2">Mr. Jennings.</p>
<p begin="02:13:41.200" end="02:13:42.200" style="s2">What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="02:13:42.366" end="02:13:44.066" style="s2">Only Summit Holdings gets to block roads</p>
<p begin="02:13:44.066" end="02:13:44.733" style="s2">and plot against me,</p>
<p begin="02:13:44.900" end="02:13:46.233" style="s2">but I, Galen Rivers,</p>
<p begin="02:13:46.366" end="02:13:48.033" style="s2">can&#39;t play the mantis stalking the cicada?</p>
<p begin="02:13:48.033" end="02:13:49.566" style="s2">You knew we were coming!</p>
<p begin="02:13:49.633" end="02:13:50.566" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="02:13:56.233" end="02:13:57.200" style="s2">Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="02:13:57.533" end="02:13:58.466" style="s2">Those bad guys in black</p>
<p begin="02:13:58.566" end="02:13:59.566" style="s2">are heading into the mountains</p>
<p begin="02:13:59.600" end="02:14:00.500" style="s2">with barbed wire!</p>
<p begin="02:14:02.733" end="02:14:03.866" style="s2">Got it, Ffion.</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.966" end="02:14:05.366" style="s2">Go tell Bronte and Gulliver.</p>
<p begin="02:14:05.766" end="02:14:07.466" style="s2">Let&#39;s put on a good show for them,</p>
<p begin="02:14:07.466" end="02:14:10.500" style="s2">and wait for Mr. Jennings to walk right into our trap.</p>
<p begin="02:14:13.266" end="02:14:16.066" style="s2">Mr. Jennings, look at the camera and smile.</p>
<p begin="02:14:16.400" end="02:14:17.433" style="s2">I&#39;ve recorded everything.</p>
<p begin="02:14:18.133" end="02:14:19.533" style="s2">Now it&#39;s your turn to wait.</p>
<p begin="02:14:21.733" end="02:14:22.533" style="s2">It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="02:14:25.466" end="02:14:26.733" style="s2">Take them all down!</p>
<p begin="02:14:26.933" end="02:14:27.633" style="s2">Send them away!</p>
<p begin="02:14:28.000" end="02:14:28.900" style="s2">Make it a big show!</p>
<p begin="02:14:33.666" end="02:14:34.833" style="s2">Two-Legger Fool,</p>
<p begin="02:14:35.333" end="02:14:37.833" style="s2">you have to give us a big reward!</p>
<p begin="02:14:38.266" end="02:14:39.133" style="s2">Keeper! Keeper!</p>
<p begin="02:14:39.300" end="02:14:41.066" style="s2">Tomorrow I want the biggest and sweetest</p>
<p begin="02:14:41.066" end="02:14:41.566" style="s2">peach!</p>
<p begin="02:14:41.866" end="02:14:44.266" style="s2">Alright, extra food for everyone tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="02:14:45.033" end="02:14:46.200" style="s2">Galen, the video we just took</p>
<p begin="02:14:46.233" end="02:14:47.066" style="s2">has been successfully posted</p>
<p begin="02:14:47.100" end="02:14:47.966" style="s2">on all major platforms.</p>
<p begin="02:14:47.966" end="02:14:49.433" style="s2">Alright, get back to Monkey Ridge.</p>
<p begin="02:14:49.566" end="02:14:50.766" style="s2">I need to lock the back gate.</p>
<p begin="02:14:52.333" end="02:14:54.066" style="s2">Everything will be over tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="02:14:58.066" end="02:14:58.666" style="s2">Yes!</p>
<p begin="02:14:58.933" end="02:14:59.866" style="s2">The road is clear!</p>
<p begin="02:15:01.000" end="02:15:02.700" style="s2">We can welcome visitors today!</p>
<p begin="02:15:09.300" end="02:15:09.933" style="s2">Director Palmer!</p>
<p begin="02:15:10.066" end="02:15:11.166" style="s2">What brings you here today?</p>
<p begin="02:15:12.533" end="02:15:13.233" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="02:15:13.533" end="02:15:14.500" style="s2">As for Summit Holdings,</p>
<p begin="02:15:14.633" end="02:15:16.133" style="s2">authorities dealt with them overnight.</p>
<p begin="02:15:16.433" end="02:15:18.133" style="s2">I&#39;m here today with the experts</p>
<p begin="02:15:18.266" end="02:15:19.500" style="s2">to evaluate your application</p>
<p begin="02:15:19.600" end="02:15:21.500" style="s2">for National Wildlife Excellence Center,</p>
<p begin="02:15:21.566" end="02:15:23.266" style="s2">and conduct an on-site inspection.</p>
<p begin="02:15:23.633" end="02:15:24.766" style="s2">Distinguished experts,</p>
<p begin="02:15:25.166" end="02:15:26.466" style="s2">welcome to Starlight Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="02:15:26.566" end="02:15:27.533" style="s2">We welcome your guidance.</p>
<p begin="02:15:27.800" end="02:15:29.733" style="s2">Lead the way, Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="02:15:29.833" end="02:15:30.900" style="s2">Please, experts,</p>
<p begin="02:15:31.066" end="02:15:31.700" style="s2">follow me.</p>
<p begin="02:15:35.500" end="02:15:36.300" style="s2">Experts,</p>
<p begin="02:15:36.466" end="02:15:38.266" style="s2">this is the last zone in our park.</p>
<p begin="02:15:41.233" end="02:15:42.733" style="s2">Two-Legger experts,</p>
<p begin="02:15:43.066" end="02:15:44.766" style="s2">welcome to Monkey Ridge!</p>
<p begin="02:15:45.233" end="02:15:46.466" style="s2">Two-Legger experts,</p>
<p begin="02:15:46.533" end="02:15:47.733" style="s2">welcome to Monkey Ridge!</p>
<p begin="02:15:48.066" end="02:15:49.333" style="s2">A warm welcome to you!</p>
<p begin="02:15:49.466" end="02:15:51.133" style="s2">Give us a really high score!</p>
<p begin="02:15:53.766" end="02:15:55.300" style="s2">Try one of our peaches.</p>
<p begin="02:15:55.633" end="02:15:58.333" style="s2">Give our park a perfect score, won&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="02:16:00.900" end="02:16:01.533" style="s2">My goodness.</p>
<p begin="02:16:01.700" end="02:16:03.300" style="s2">He&#39;s actually sharing his food.</p>
<p begin="02:16:03.466" end="02:16:05.600" style="s2">This level of trust between animals and humans</p>
<p begin="02:16:05.733" end="02:16:07.066" style="s2">is incredibly rare.</p>
<p begin="02:16:08.100" end="02:16:08.766" style="s2">Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="02:16:08.866" end="02:16:11.166" style="s2">On behalf of the experts, I officially announce</p>
<p begin="02:16:11.333" end="02:16:12.533" style="s2">that you&#39;ve passed the evaluation.</p>
<p begin="02:16:12.600" end="02:16:14.500" style="s2">The approval documents will be issued soon.</p>
<p begin="02:16:14.500" end="02:16:15.166" style="s2">That&#39;s wonderful!</p>
<p begin="02:16:15.900" end="02:16:17.166" style="s2">Thank you so much, experts.</p>
<p begin="02:16:23.233" end="02:16:24.400" style="s2">Hey, Mr. Rivers.</p>
<p begin="02:16:24.500" end="02:16:25.366" style="s2">You&#39;ve been pacing all morning,</p>
<p begin="02:16:25.566" end="02:16:26.666" style="s2">walked a thousand miles already.</p>
<p begin="02:16:26.700" end="02:16:27.866" style="s2">Worn out your shoes yet?</p>
<p begin="02:16:28.566" end="02:16:29.700" style="s2">Director Palmer is coming today</p>
<p begin="02:16:29.700" end="02:16:30.766" style="s2">with the evaluation results.</p>
<p begin="02:16:30.966" end="02:16:31.766" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait!</p>
<p begin="02:16:31.833" end="02:16:32.566" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="02:16:34.366" end="02:16:34.900" style="s2">Galen!</p>
<p begin="02:16:34.933" end="02:16:36.200" style="s2">The documents are here!</p>
<p begin="02:16:36.733" end="02:16:37.433" style="s2">Great news!</p>
<p begin="02:16:37.433" end="02:16:38.400" style="s2">Director Palmer!</p>
<p begin="02:16:38.500" end="02:16:39.266" style="s2">Did we get it?</p>
<p begin="02:16:41.866" end="02:16:42.466" style="s2">We got it!</p>
<p begin="02:16:42.800" end="02:16:43.933" style="s2">Your Starlight Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="02:16:43.966" end="02:16:44.900" style="s2">has been officially named</p>
<p begin="02:16:44.966" end="02:16:46.466" style="s2">a National Wildlife Excellence Center</p>
<p begin="02:16:46.633" end="02:16:47.966" style="s2">for Ecological Interaction!</p>
<p begin="02:16:49.266" end="02:16:50.166" style="s2">And that&#39;s not all!</p>
<p begin="02:16:50.300" end="02:16:51.466" style="s2">The national special support fund</p>
<p begin="02:16:51.733" end="02:16:52.866" style="s2">of ten million dollars</p>
<p begin="02:16:52.966" end="02:16:54.766" style="s2">has already been transferred to your account!</p>
<p begin="02:16:55.433" end="02:16:56.300" style="s2">Ten million dollars!</p>
<p begin="02:16:56.566" end="02:16:57.633" style="s2">National base!</p>
<p begin="02:16:59.200" end="02:17:01.200" style="s2">My Starlight Wildlife Park made it!</p>
<p begin="02:17:01.433" end="02:17:02.066" style="s2">Galen,</p>
<p begin="02:17:02.366" end="02:17:03.966" style="s2">you really pulled it off this time!</p>
<p begin="02:17:04.033" end="02:17:05.633" style="s2">Mr. Rivers, you&#39;re amazing!</p>
<p begin="02:17:05.700" end="02:17:06.600" style="s2">We finally did it!</p>
<p begin="02:17:06.666" end="02:17:08.000" style="s2">Oh, my goodness.</p>
<p begin="02:17:08.233" end="02:17:09.733" style="s2">This is really nice!</p>
<p begin="02:17:11.000" end="02:17:13.933" style="s2">Our park is finally going to be rich!</p>
<p begin="02:17:14.400" end="02:17:14.800" style="s2">Yay!</p>
<p begin="02:17:15.033" end="02:17:16.433" style="s2">I want ten big bananas!</p>
<p begin="02:17:16.566" end="02:17:17.700" style="s2">No, a hundred!</p>
<p begin="02:17:17.766" end="02:17:18.500" style="s2">Cheers!</p>
<p begin="02:17:18.633" end="02:17:19.533" style="s2">A national base!</p>
<p begin="02:17:19.766" end="02:17:21.333" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna change into a prettier shirt!</p>
<p begin="02:17:21.466" end="02:17:22.400" style="s2">To celebrate!</p>
<p begin="02:17:22.433" end="02:17:24.266" style="s2">Way to go, Two-Legger Keeper!</p>
<p begin="02:17:28.100" end="02:17:30.266" style="s2">These are my drama queen animals.</p>
<p begin="02:17:30.900" end="02:17:31.633" style="s2">Our story</p>
<p begin="02:17:31.700" end="02:17:33.366" style="s2">has only just begun.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.200" end="00:04:42.900" style="s2">That tiger is such a boss!</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
